<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">Isaiah</book>
  <para style="h">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Isaiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz’ tapa Isaiah in Judah kumpi ahi Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz le Hezekiah-te’ hun sunga Judah gam le Jerusalem tawh kisai ama’ mangmunate tam bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vantung aw, za in, leitung aw, ngai in; bangzieh ahei cile Topa in gen zo hi: “Ka tate khoi-in ka khangliensah a, ahi vangin amate in keima ei ledo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawngtang in ama a nei pa thei a, laa in zong a pu’ anpiehna thei buong sam hi. Ahi vangin Israel in a thei sih a, ka mite in a thei sih hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ah, mawnei minam, khielna netcip mite, sietna a bawlte’ suonlehlahte, a gamtatsie tapate, amate in Topa a nuasie ta vua, Israel Siengtho Pa simmaw-in, a elngat kilkel uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bang dingin siet nading suibe lai na hi uh ahei? Bang dingin ledo lailai na hi uh ahei? Lutang buppi a ci na a, lungsim vannuoi a gim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ketaw panin zangsip dongin a damna mun om lo a, hinanle liemma, sidup, liemna sisan naisante a om hi. Tuate a nai kisen lo a, kitun loin, sathau zong kinu lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na gam uh a kilawi ta a, na khuopite uh mei in katum ta hi; namdangte in na mit mu-un na gam a netum ta uhi; gamdang mite in a suhsiet ziehun gamdai gamkhing a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lengga huona hlampheng bang, tangmai lo-a buh bang le a ki-imtawm khuopi bangin Zion’ tanu kinuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in themkhat ei na hinkhawi lo hi leh, Sodom i bang zo ta ding vua, Gomorrah i bang zo ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />No, Sodom uliente aw, Topa’ thu za un! Gomorrah mite aw, Topa’ thuhilh ngai un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tua zata-a a tam na biehpiehnate uh kei adingin bang hi leltah ahei?” Topa in ci hi; tuutang meihal biehnate le a kivathau ganhingte’ thau ka kham zo ta hi; bawngtangte, tuunote le keel site tawh ka lung a kim sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mai-ah a kilah dinga nang pei ciengun, na khut sung panun koi in tamte ang ngen ahei? Keima inntuol tuoncil nawn sih un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />bangma-a kimang lo biehpiehnate hing peipi nawn sih un; kei adingin tuate pen gimnamtui kidahhuoi ahi hi. Hladet ni, sabbath ni, le khawmpi hlatnate, khielna tawh a kidim kikhopna thupite ka thuoh zo nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na hla thate ule a kise na pawite uh ka muda hi; kei adingin tuate vangih khat suoh a, tuate ka puohna-in ka gimsi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na khut uh nang zah ciengin keima in ka mit ka sing ding a, thu tampi ngen nan locin kang ngaipieh sih ding hi; na khut uh sisan a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />No le no kisil tawm unlen, kisiengthosah un. Ka muna-ah na gitlo gamtatnate uh paimang un; gitlo nasep khawl unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />sil hoi bawl kisin un; thutang sui unlen, a kibawlsie mite hunkhie un, pa nei lote panpi unlen, meigongte thu vaihawmpi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in ci hi: Tu-in hing pei un, thu kikumton vai. Na mawnate uh puon ausan bang tama le vua bangin ang paa ding hi; na mawnate uh puon sandup bang tama le tuumul bangin ang ngo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note na lungkim vua thu na man uleh, leitang pana a pieng ga hoite na ne ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />hinanle nielin nei ledo uleh, namsau in note ang vatmai ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile Topa in genzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangci dan-a a muonhuoi khuopi numei pahtat suoh ta vanuh adiei! Ama thutang tawh kidim ngai-in tua sungah dihtatna om ngai napi- tu-in mi thatte a om ta veleh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na ngun sam-eh kai zo a, na zu tui tawh kihal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na miliente khu mi ledote ahi vua, gutate tawh kigopte ahi uhi. Mi zosie in guhgol a dei vua, letsong a sui uhi. Amate in pa nei lote panpi loin, a kung vuah meigongte’ thu zong tung lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ziehin Thunei pen Topa , Israel-te’ Vanglien Pa in tam bangin ci hi: “Ah, ka galte tungah ka lungthahna ka sungsuh ding a, kei mama in ka langte tungah phu ka la ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note langkhatah ka khut ka hla ding a, na sam-eh teng uh tuisuoh sahin, na siagawm zosie uh ka lamang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A masa lai bangin na thukhente uh ka koikia ding a, tuale a kipatcil hun bangin na thu kuppite uh ka koikia ding hi. Tua zaw ciengin a dih khuopi, a thuman khuopi, a muonhuoi khuopi ang kici ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thutang tawh Zion kitankhie ding a, ama sungah a kisiakia mite dihna tawh kitankhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hizongle mi ledote le mawneite kisuhsiet tha ding a, Topa taisante ahile kimangthaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile note in na kipahpi uh gangpi singte na maizumpi ding uhi; na deiteel uh umte ziehin na maisan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note pen a te a vul gangpi sing le tui a nga lo um khat tawh na kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Patlom bangin mihatpa a nem ding a, amau’ nasep khu meisi leng bang ding hi; amate le amau’ nasep katum ding a, a phel ding koima a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz’ tapa Isaiah in Judah gam le Jerusalem tawh kisai-in tam bangin mu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ang tung ding nite ah Topa’ biehinn muol pen muol golte lahah a sang penin kikipsah ding a, tuale muoltangte tungah a kitawisang ding hi; minam zosie in tua mun a zuon valuoi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi tampite a haw ding vua, “Hing pei un, Jacob’ Pasien’ biehinn, Topa’ muol tungah va kato ta vai; tuaci’n eite in ama’ ketot i zui thei nadingin, ama in eite tungah a lampite ei hil ding hi,” a ci ding uhi. Azieh pen Zion panin thuhilna pusuoh ding a, Jerusalem panin Topa’ kammal pusuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in minamte kikalah thukhen ding a, mi tampite adingin kiselna vengsah ding hi; amate in a namsaute uh kangkui-in a kheng ding vua, a teipite singba heuna namkawi-in kheng ding uhi; minam khat in minam khat tungah namsau leh nawn lo ding a, amate in galdo dan zong a sin nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jacob’ innkuonte aw, hing pei unlen, Topa ’ khuovah sungah kalsuon va vui!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen no Jacob’ innkuonte aw, note in na mite’ lampite na taisan zo uhi. Amate nisuona lam pana aisante tawh a kidim vua, Philistia-te banga thu mavang gente ahi uhi. Gamdang mite tawh amate khutbeng tonin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A gam uh ngun le kham tawh kidim a, amau’ goute in tawp hun ci nei lo hi; a gam uh sakol tawh kidim a, a lengte un zong tawp hun nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A gam uh milimte tawh kidim hi; a khut vua a bawlsate’ mai, a khutme vua a bawlsate’ mai-ah amate a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale mite a neilut vua, mi zosie kiniemkoi suh hi, amau’ mawna maisah sin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa’ giinhuoina pan le a thupi a vanglietna panin suongpi-ah lut unlen, leivui lahah kiphuol un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mite’ kilietsahna mitte kiniemkoi ding a, mi zosie’ kiphatsahna kiniemkhieh ding hi; khum ni ciengin Topa beh kitawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen Vanglien Topa in a kiphasah le a kiliensah zosie, a kitawisangte le a kidomsang zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a kidawh sang, a kilamto, Lebanon muol taamtah kung zosie; Bashan gam sunga gangpi sing zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />muol sang zosie le muoltang sang zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />inn dawsang zosie le kulpi muonhuoi zosie;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tarshish tembaw zosie le khut siema kibawl a etlawm na zosie tungah, ama in ngiemkoi hun ding ni khat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mite’ kilietsahna kiniemkhieh ding a, mite’ kiphatsahna kiniemkoi ding hi; khum ni ciengin Topa beh kitawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Milimte zosie mangthai sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung zausah dinga ama ang kipat ciengin, Topa’ giinhuoina le ama’ a thupi a vanglietnate panin, a vanglien ama’ thupina panin suonghawm sung le leihawm sungah mite lutin a kiphuol ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin mite in bieh dinga a bawltawm uh kham le ngun milimte, bahte le buite tungah a paimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leitung zausah dinga ama ang kipat ciengin, Topa’ giinhuoina pan le a lien a minthanna panin suonghawm sung le kenkawm sungah amate a lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nahvanga a husang beh ahi mihingte panin kihei un. Amate leltah banga simtah ahei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Azieh pen tu-in Thunei pen pa, Vanglien Topa in Jerusalem le Judah gam panin nuntahna le luhinna, nuntahna an zosie, nuntahna tui zosie a lamang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Galhang pa le galkap pa, thukhen pa le kamsang pa, aisan pa le upa pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mi sawmnga a uhpa le mi zalien pa, thu kuppipa le mitphiel siempa, le bum siemte a lamang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau’ ulien dingin naupangte ka bawl ding a, naungehte in amate a uh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mite khatlekhat, mi zosie in a guolte ciet, mi zosie in a vengte ciet, a bawlsie ding uhi; khangnote in khanghamte nuoisie ding a, mi ginalote in a zatah huoi mite a nuoisie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi kimkhat in a be sunga a sanggampa nangawn manin, “Nang in puon na nei hi; nang, kohaw’ makai pa nang hi ding a, tami a sielomtang teng pen nangma khut sung hi ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanle khum ni-in adang khat in, “Kei mi cidamsah pa ka hi sih ding hi; ka inn sungah an le puon a om sih hi; mite makai dingin nei bawl sih ding uhi,” ci-in a gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a kamsuo ule a sepnate un Topa langpangin ama’ vanglietna opna a simmaw ziehun, Jerusalem kipalpua-in Judah gam a pua zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amau’ maisuo in amate langah teci a pang hi; Sodom bangin amate in a mawna uh a phuongzah vua, amate in a phuol sih uhi. Amate in gimna nga ta uheh! Bangzieh ahei cile amate in amau’ tungma ah sietna a kitut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a nasep gate ne ding uh ahi ziehin, bangza-in amate hampha ci thu mawpeng mite kungah gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mawnei mite in gimna nga taheh! Amate bangza-in hamsie uh ahei, bangzieh ahei cile amau’ khuta a sepna utawh kizui-in, a tung vuah kibawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima’ mite, naupangte pen amate a bawlsiete ahi vua, numeite in amate a uh uhi. Ka mite aw, na makaite un note ang puikhiel vua, amate in na lampi zui uh ang buoisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi mawsah dingin Topa kipan a, a mite thukhen dingin a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Upate le ama’ mi uliente tawh thukhen dingin Topa lut hi. “Lenggui lo a netumte khu noma na hi vua, na inn sung vuah mizawngte’ van na sutte uh a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note in ka mite na suhguoina ule mizawngte’ maitang na gawizanna uh bang na deina uh ahei?” Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Zion tanute kiliensahin ngawng vaipuohin lam a pei vua, kiphatsahna tawh mittol pimpemin mi a en vua, a ketot uh ginsie-in a kal uh a nawsuon liplap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in Zion tanute’ lu tungah hima dimsah ding a, Topa in amau’ guohtang hina a hawmangpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Topa in kebuh hoite, lutuomte le hlade lim tawh a kibang kizepnate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />bilbate, tauciente, ngawngvielte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />lukhute, banbulte, kawngtente, gimnamtui bungte, le ai-a a kibawl puonte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />suoikaina khutsip le nahbate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />pawi puontuolte, songkhol tuolte, puonpite le khutkhai ipte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />puonzal neu vang sitsiatte, tangciin puon sungsilte, dielkhimte, le puon lukhute a lakhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gimnamtui tangin a ui a muot, kawnggah tangin khauhuol, sam kipot hoi tangin lutolna, puontuol hoi tangin la-ip puon hampi, melhoina tangin maizumna a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na mite namsau tawh pua ding a, na galhangte gal sungah si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuopi kotpite kapin mau ding uhi; tua nu kisusie gawpin tuolah a to cimit ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin numei sagi in papi khat pummatin, “Ka an ciet ne-in ka puon ciet ka sil ding uhi; nangma’ minin kote ei kihlansah beh inlen, ka minsietna uh ei lahpieh ta’n,” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Topa’ bameng pen a melhoi-in minthang ding a, tuale leitang pana pieng gate pen a suohta lai Israel-te adingin a kisahtheipi ule a thupina uh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zion khuo-a kinuasie mi poma le Jerusalem-a a omlai teng, Jerusalem ah khang tungtawn a om dingin a kiciemtesa mi zosie a siengtho kici ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Zion numeite’ kidahhuoina teng a sawpsieng ciengin, Jerusalem khuolai panin thukhenna hlagau le meikuong hlagau in sisan baang teng a siengthosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Zion Muol tunga om mun vannuoi le a kikhopna uh munte-ah sunin meikhu le zanin meikuong a omsah ding hi. Topa’ thupina vang in khuopi a khu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua khu mandat bangin sunlai nisat cienga a hlim ding le huipi guopi pana kibuhna le bel ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lawm it pa tangin a lenggui lo tungtang ka zawlla sa vang: Ka lawm it pa in lei hoi mama na muol tung khatah lengga lo khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in lei to-in suongte paidawh a, a deiteel lengguite a suon hi; a laikimah dawsang khat lam a, tua sungah lengga tui hlawhna khuh khat to hi; lengga hoi a ga dingin ama kinem a, hinanle gam lengga a ga mawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in Jerusalem-a tengte le Judah mite aw, keima le ka lengga huon kikalah thu khen vawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lengga huon sungah ka bawl nai lo tuami adingin ka bawl ding bang omlai ahei? Lengga hoi ga ding ka kinep laitahin bang dinga gam lengga po ga zawsop ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in na kungah ka lengga huon tunga ka bawl dan ding kang gen ding hi. A daithaw ka ladawh ding a, tua khu a kinemang ding hi; a pal ka phelkhe ding a, tua khu kituoncil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in lotul ka suohsah ding hi; tua khu hui lo tuh loin om ding a, tua lo sungah ling le khaute khangin a depmang ding hi; Keima in a tungah guo a zuh lo nadingin meiilumte thu ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen Vanglien Topa’ lenggui huon khu Israel innkuonte ahi vua, Judah mite pen ahile lungkima a suon kungte ahi uhi; ama in thutang a lamen a, hizongle sisan luonna a mu hi; ama in thutang a lamen a, ahi vangin kaana a za hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gam laizangah noma guoh a teng ding dan khatin, noma ding ci simlo midangte dinga mun bei vawt za dongin inn a lei bebe mite le lo keh bebete khu mi hamsie ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vanglien Topa khu ka zahna-ah a kiciem zo hi: Inn tampi hawmsuoh valon ding a, inn gol le inn hoite sungah koima teng lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen lengga huon eka sawm in bath khat maimai ga ding a, khaici homer khat in an ephah khat maimai a piengsah ding hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zingmawng thobai-in khamtheizu delin, lenggazu in amate a satsah vapual masangsie, zankhang a a tokho mite in gimna a thuoh ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amau’ pawi sungah lyre lasahna le harp, tawm, theile le zu ciate kihal a, ahi vangin amate in Topa’ sepnate a thusim sih vua, ama in a khuta a bawlte zong amate in a mu sih uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua hi a, thei lona ziehin ka mite salin kikai ta hi; a miliente uh a kielsi vua, amau’ mihonte ahile a dangta-in a kihulvam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Misikhuo dugawna khangsahin bangma tawh a kite thei lo za-in, a kam a kah piehpuoh hi. Jerusalem’ thupina le a mipite, ama’ sunga a nuomsa a mihonpite a sungah a lutsuh sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mite kilukunsahin mi zosie kingiem koi a, mi kiliensahte a mitkhup sa-in ki-omsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle Vanglien Topa ahile a thutang sep ziehin kitawisang a, a Siengtho Pasien in dihtatna tawh a sienthona a lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin a tatna uh lodawng mun bangin tua khuo sungah tuunote in lopa mai ding a, gan kivathaute le tuunote in a siesa khuopite lahah gamta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zuouna khaute tawh khielna kai a, leng khauhuol tawh mawna a kai note in gimna na thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ei mu thei nadingin ama kinawsahin, ama’ nasep mallangsah vai. Eite in i theithei nadingin, Israel Siengtho pa’ gelna a tangtun thei nading kinawsah vai!” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hoi lote a hoi ci a, a hoite hoi lo ci-in, khuovah tangin khuomiel koi a, khuomiel tangin khuovah koi-in, a hlum tangin a kha koi a, a kha tangin a hlum a koi note in gimna na thuoh ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Noma’ mitah pil kisa-in noma’ muna-ah siem a kisate in gimna na thuoh ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zudawn lama a kipasalsahte, le za tawh a kihal khamthei zudawn hatte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />mawnei mite guhgol tawh hla a, mawpengte’ nga dingte a lahpieh note in gimna na thuoh ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin meikuong in bukungte katum a, mei sungah lopa gawte a kahtum bangin a zungte muotmang ding a, leivui bangin a pavuite a lengto ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in Vanglien Topa’ thuhilna a niel vua, Israel Siengtho pa’ kammal a simmaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a mite tungah Topa ’ lungthahna kikuontaw-in, amate langkhatah a khut lamin amate a vatmai hi; muolte kithing a, lampi dung tengah a luonghawmte uh, buathah bangin a om hi. Azieh pen tam teng zosie ziehin a lungthahna kiheimang tuom lo a, ama’ khut a kizah lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A gamlapi-a a om minam khat adingin ama in lim khat khaito ding a, leimonga omte adingin khutkawi tumin, mallangtah le gangtahin amate a pei pai uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate a gim om koima loin, koima a kipai sih uhi. Koima lusu loin, koima kimu lo uhi. Kawnggah puonte kol loin, kedap khau khat zong tat lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a thaltangte uh hiem thei mama a, a thalpite uh kuoisa-in a om hi. A sakol kecinte uzong khu meituh suong bang a, tuale a lengpeite uzong pumpei tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amau’ hawh vapuoh khu humpi hawh tawh kibang a, a hawh vapuoh a khangdawng humpi tawh a kibang uhi; amate in ngih kawmin a neh ding uh sa man a, amate in tua khu a kipuoh dawh vua, koima in a hun zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin tuipi ging bangin amate tungah ging ding a, tuale mite in gam sung a et ciengun khuomiel le lungzinna beh a om hi; meii in khuovah a mielsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Uzziah a si kumin keima in a sang mama le a lien mama kumpi topha tunga a to Topa ka mu hi; tuale ama’ kumpi puon pen biehinn sung teng dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama tungah seraph-te a om hi; tuate in hla guh ciet a nei uhi: Amate in a hla ni tawh a mai a khu vua, ni tawh a keng khu-in, ni tawh a leng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale amate khatlekhat kihlanin: “Vanglien Topa Siengtho, siengtho, siengtho; a vanglietna leitung buppi kidim hi, a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kihlatna awging in kotkhah mungte kilawhsah a, tuale inn sung teng meikhu tawh a kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale keima in: “Gim nga pa hi tang ei! Mi mangthai ka hi ta hi, azieh pen kei kam siengtho lo pa ka hi a, kam siengtho lo mite lahah ka teng hi; hinanle Vanglien Topa Kumpipa ka mu zo ta hi!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Seraph-te lahah khat, maitam panin taite tawh mei-am khat tepin ka kungah ang leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Seraph in tua tawh ka kam ang khoi a, “Tu-in tami in na nephute khoi zo ta hi; na khielna a kilamang ta a, na mawna zong kiphietmang zo ta hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in, “Koi ahiei ka sawl ding, koi ahiei ei tanga va pei ta ding?” a cina aw ka za hi. Tuale keima in, “Tanah om ing! Keima ei sawl in,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “Pei inlen tam mite kungah gen in: ‘Zaza napi na telthei sih uhi; mumu napi na theithei sih uhi,’ vaci ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a mit utawh a et lo nading uh, a bil utawh a zah lo nading uh, a lungsim utawh a thei cien lo nading ule, amate kihei-in damna a nga lo nadingun, tam mite’ lungsim mawlsah inlen, a bil uh bingsahin a mit uh singsah in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “ Topa aw, bang tanvei sawt ding ahei?” ka ci hi. Tuale ama in a gen hi: “Khuopi zosie tenna loin hawmsuoh a, innte-ah mi teng loin leitang gamkhing suoh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in mi zosie a gamlapi-ah sawldawhin, gam sungah a kinuasie mun tampi a op dong cieng, hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua sungah mi sawm-ah-khat a oplai tei vangin, taa kung ahi sihle gangpi singte a kiphua zaw ciengin, a kungbul a omlaite mei tawh a kihalkia bangin amate kihalkia ding hi,” ei ci hi. Tua a kungbul khu khaici siengtho ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uzziah’ tapa Jotham, Jotham’ tapa Judah kumpipa Ahaz hun lai-in Jerusalem sim dingin Aram kumpipa Rezin le Remaliah’ tapa Pekah a kuonto vua, hinanle ama gel in a zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ephraim-te tawh Aram-te kipawlton hi, ci thu David’ innkuonte in a zah ciengin, huipi in a sem gamlah singkungte bangin Ahaz le a mipite’ lungsim a kiling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Isaiah kungah, “Puonsawppa Lo lampi-a buol tungnung tuilahna monga a om Ahaz tawh kimu dingin na tapa Shear-jashub tawh pei unlen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama kungah, “Kidawm in, sip dide inlen, zau vateh sin. A khu lemlem singkhuo tawng ni tawh a kibang lel Aram kumpipa Rezin le Remaliah’ tapa’ lungthahna ziehin kilunggimsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Remaliah’ tapa tawh Aram pangtonin na tungah sietna a bawl sawm vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Judah gam sim dingin va kuonto ta vai-in, tuale Jerusalem sumaimangin eimahaw dingin va zo thop ta vai; tua gam sungah kumpi dingin Tabeel’ tapa koi vai,” a ci uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua ahi tah ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi: Tua thu kip lo ding a, zong tangtung lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen Aram’ lutang khu Damascus ahi a, Damascus’ lutang khu Rezin ahi hi. (Kum sawmguh le kum nga sungin minam khat ahi thei nawn lo ding za-in Ephraim kivatmai ding hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ephraim’ lutang khu Samaria ahi a, Samaria’ lutang khu Remaliah’ tapa ahi hi. Upna sungah na dinkip sih leh na kip vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in Ahaz hopikia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa na Pasien’ lim khat ngen in; tua lim pen Misikhuo bangin thuh hinlen ahi sihle vantung bangin sang heh, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle Ahaz in, “Ka ngen sih ding hi; Topa ka zelah sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Isaiah in, “David’ innkuonte aw, ngai un! Mi na gimsah uh pen no adingin thuneuno khatin na ngaisun vua, ka Pasien zong gimsah lai ding na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa mama in note tungah lim khat ang pie ding hi. En un, ngahnu khat gai-in tapa khat nei ding a, a min Immanuel kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in sil hoi lo nuolin sil hoi a teel thei hun ciengin bawngnawi thaukhal le khuoizu ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen naupang in sil hoi lote nuolin sil hoite bangci teel ding ci thu a thei masangin na giin uh kumpi nite’ gam a kinuasie ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah panin Ephraim-te a peikhiet ni-a kipanin Topa in ni danga a pieng ngai nai lo tua bang nite, nangma, na mite, le na pupa’ innkuon tungah a tungsah ding hi- tua khu Assyria kumpipa tung pan hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in tua ni ciengin Egypt tuinahte-a om thote le Assyria gam sunga om khuoite a saisip tumin a hlan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale amate zong a unpi-in hing pei-in kenkawm lah, suongpi kehte kikal lah, ling le khau lah cinteng le ganhing tatna muncin tengah a tu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Topa in Gungal pana kikawm mulmetna nam ahi- Assyria kumpipa tawh- lu le kengmulte heulieu-in tua ma tawh khamulte zong a heu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin mi khat in bawnglaa khat le tuu ni bang beh suotahpi zo ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />tuate in nawitui kicing tahin a pieh zo ziehin ama in bawngnawi thaukhal a ne zo ding h; azieh pen tua gama a omlaite zosie in bawngnawi thaukhal le khuoizu a ne ciet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin ngun shekel tulkhat a man lenggui tulkhat a op ngaina mun zosie ling lah khau lah a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gam zosie khaugui le lingbawhte tawh kidim ta ding ahi ziehin, mite thal le thaltang tawh gam a vah ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuale nangma in ling le khaute na giin ziehin tupeh tawh a kihlo ngai muoltangte-ah na pei ngam sih ding hi; hizongle tuate bawng hlana le tuute’ gamtatna mun a suoh ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in keima kungah, “Suongpheng gol khat la inlen, tua tungah mikim in a thei dingin laiteng tawh, ‘Maher-shalal-hash-baz ading,’ ci-in giel in,” a ci a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuale keima adinga teci a pang dingin a muonhuoi tecite, siempu Uriah le Jeberechiah’ tapa Zechariah tegel hisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale kamsang nu tawh ka lumton a, ama gai-in tapa khat nei hi. Tua ciengin Topa in keima kungah, “A min dingin Maher-shalal-hash-baz phuo in,” ei ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />azieh pen nausen in, ‘Ka nu ahi sihle ka Pa,’ a ci thei masangin Damascus’ hauna le Samaria van kila zosie Assyria kumpipa in puomang ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in keima ei hopikia-in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen tam mite in damtaha a luong dildiel Shiloah tuite nuolin Rezin le Remaliah’ tapa mai-ah zau-in a citun uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua ziehin Topa in amate a langpang dingin a thahat Gun tuikhangte ahi Assyria kumpipa le ama’ vanglietna zosie a puohto ding hi; a tuilam zosie ah tua tui dimletin a lui pieu zosie hlummang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah gam sung dong nawhsuhin tui dimletin peisuoh ding a, ngawng tan a gei dongin hlumsuoh ding hi; tuale a hla kizah tegel in na gam a vailam teng khusuh ding hi, Immanuel aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No mite aw, kikhawm unlen, lungkham un; Gamlapi-a a om no gam zosiete aw, ngai un. Na kawng gah unlen, lungkham un; na kawng gah unlen lung kham un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thu kikumton un, hinanle bangma a matlap a om sih ding hi. Thu gen un, ahi vangin a kip tuom sih ding hi. Azieh pen kote tawh Pasien a omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in keima tungah a thahat ama’ khut ngamin tua bangin ei hopi-in, tam mite’ lampi ka zui lo nadingin ei na hilkhol a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam mite in sawmdapna a ci vannuoi uh zong sawmdapna ci pai sih unlen, amau’ giinte giing seng sih unlen, zong zau pai sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Vanglien Topa pen a siengtho-in na ngaisun ding uhi; ama khu na zatahpa uh hisah unlen, na giinpa uh hisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama pen mun siengtho khat suohin mite’ sat suongtum khat a suoh ding hi; azieh pen Israel innkuon ni gel adingin pua thei nading suongtum- Jerusalem-a tengte adingin piel le thangkam a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate lahah mi tampi a pua ding uhi; amate pua-in guoicim ding uhi; amate thangah awhin kiman ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua teci panna tun inlen, ka nuazuite lahah thuhilna khahcip dawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jacob’ innkuonte panin a mai a phuol Topa ka ngah ding a, ama sungah ka kinem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />En un, Topa ei pieh tate le keima pen Zion Muol tunga a teng Vanglien Topa tung panin Israel sunga ei pieh limte le hilkholnate ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu-in mite in nangma kungah, “Phui samsama dawi thu gengen dawi aisan siemte le mi bumsiemte kungah thu dong un; mite in a pasien-te uh kungah thu a dawh ding uh kilawm lo a, thuhilna le theisahna dingin a hingte tangin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />misite dawh ding kilawmzaw hi lo amah?” ang ci uleh, a tahtahin tam banga thu gente in khuovah a nei vawt sih ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate pen nahpitahin lungkham le gilkielin gam sungah a vah kawikawi ding uhi; a gil uh a kiel ciengin lunghamin a kumpipa ule a pasien uh a samsie ding uhi. Vantung lamah amate a dahto ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ahi sihle tuol ensuhin a kun ding uhi, ahi vangin amate in mangbahna, mielna, lungzin lunggimna beh a mu ding uhi; tuale mielking lahah amate a kisawn nawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanle lunggim mite adingin lungzinna a om sih ding hi. Nidang lai-in ama in Zebulun le Naphtali gamte simmaw etsatna a thuohsah a, hizongle hun nukhia lamah ama in tuipi peina lampi, Jordan gungal gam, le minamte’ tenna Galilee gam a thupisah kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuomiel sunga a pei mite in khuovah lienpi mu zo uhi; khuomiel thuhna gam sunga a teng mite tungah khuovah a tang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang in minam na pungsah zo a, a lungdamna uh na khangsah zo hi. Anlah huna a lungdam bang ule galvanlah a hawm hunin mite kipahin a lungdam bangun, na mai-ah amate a lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen Midian-te a kizaw ni-a bangin nangma in amau’ vangih puohna hahkol le a liengko vua kikham singzawl, amate a bawlsie mite’ ciengpum na sattawngpieh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen galhangte’ kedap zosie le sisan baang puon zosie mei in sing a kahtum bangin kihaltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen eite adingin nausen khat ang suoh a, eite tungah tapa khat ei kipie hi; ama’ liengko tungah thuneina a om hi; ama pen, Lamdang Thu Kuppipa, Vanglien Pasien, Tawntung Pa, Kilemna Kumpipa, ci-in kiphuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama’ thuneina khang semsem ding a, David’ kumpi topha le a kumpi gam adingin kilemna in tawp hun nei lo ding hi. Ama in tu huna kipan a tawntungin, thudih le thutang tawh gam phutin a tukip ding hi. Vanglien Topa’ deiluotna in tami a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in Jacob langah thu khat puoh a, Israel tungah tua thu a tung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mi zosiete-Ephraim le Samaria-a tengte zosie- in tua thu a thei uhi. Ahi vangin kiphatsahna le lungsim kilietsahna tawh amate in tam bangin a gen uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tehleite a cimzan zo ta a, hinanle a kikhengzol suongte tawh i lamkia ding uhi; theitheh singte kiphua sieng zo a, hizongle tuate munah eite in taamtah sing i zang ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in amate do dingin a langte khangsahin a galte uh a hantawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nisuona lama Aram-te le nitumna lama Philistia-te in a kam uh kahin Israel a nawmval uhi. Tam thute zosie ziehin a lungthahna kihei lo hi; ama’ khut a kizahlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate a satpa lamah mite a kihei sih vua, ahi sihle Vanglien Topa a sui sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ni khat sungin Topa in Israel sung panin a lu le a mei, le lutu ba le pumpeng a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Upate le a zatahhuoi mite a lutang lam ahi vua, zuouthu hil kamsangte a mei lam ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />azieh pen tam mite a puite in amate lamkhielsah a, amate in a pui uh mite lungbuoisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin Topa in a tangvalte uh tungah khuotuona nei loin, a tagate uh’ tung le a meigongte uh tungah lainatna a nei sih hi; azieh pen amate a unpi-un Pasien nei lo le sil hoilo bawlte ahi vua, kamham zosie in motna thu vive a gen hi. Tam thute zosie ziehin a lungthahna kihem loin, ama’ khut kizahlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen gitlona mei bangin kuong a, ling le khaute a katum hi; tua in gamlah hamphul kuongsah a, a tung lamah meikhu lompi a kizielto vapual hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vanglien Topa’ lungthahna ziehin gam sung a katum sieng a, mite pen mei sunga kivang ding sing tawh kibang a, mi koima in a midangte a za tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A zietlama omte a ne vua, hinanle a kham zo sih uhi; amate in a veilama a om a tanaute’ sa zong a ne uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manasseh in Ephraim, Ephraim in Manasseh ne-in, tuale a ni tuohun Judah langpanton uhi. Tam thute zosie ziehin a lungthahna kihem loin, ama’ khut a kizahlai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A dih lo thukhensatte bawlin mi gawtna thukhamte a giel, a dih thukhenna panin mi tasamte heimangin, ka mi zawngte’ nga ding hamphatnate guhpieh a, meigong numeite gal vanlah a suo thei nading ule, no pa nei lote, nehtum dinga bawlte in gimna na thuoh ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Danpieh ni ang tun cieng le a gamla pana tuosiet ni ang tun ciengin, bang law ding na hi uh ahei? Huna ngenin koi kungah tai-in, na neisa uh hei sungah nuasie ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tongkiete lahah kunin ahi sihle a kithat mite lahah a si ding hi lel lo na hi uh amah? Tam thute zosie ziehin a lungthahna a dam zo nai sih a, ama’ khut kizahlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka lungthahna moltum- amau’ khut sunga a om keima’ thangpaina ciengkhut ahi, Assyria in gimna a thuoh ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in Pasien a nei lo minamte a va sim ding le ei thangpaisah mite va sim dingin ama thu ka pie a, amate in bulu gawpin a tomgam ding vua, lampi-a buonnawite bangin a tuoncil gawp ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin tami ama’ siltup ahi sih a, a lungsim sungah zong ngaisutin nei lo hi; ahi vangin a lungsim sungah suhsiet ding le a tawm tham ahi vawt lo minamte suhmai ding a sawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in, “Ka galkapmangte a unin kumpi hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Calno khuo khu Carchemish khuo tawh a kibang ahi sih amah? Hamath khuo khu Arpad tawh a kibang ahi sih amah? Samaria khuopi khu Damascus khuopi tawh a kibang ahi sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem le Samaria milimte sangin a thupizaw milimte a nei milim kumpi gamte ka khut in banzo ahi ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samaria le a milimte tunga ka bawl bangin Jerusalem le a milimte tungah ka bawl sih ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in Zion Muol tung le Jerusalem tunga a nasep zosie a man zaw ciengin ama in a kihisah luotna le a ki-uongsahnate ziehin Assyria kumpipa dan a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in: “Theitelna ka nei ziehin, ka khut hatna le ka pilna tawh ka bawl zo ta hi; mite’ gamgi ka khinpieh a, a gou uh ka tomgam hi; keima in bawngtang bangin kumpi topha tunga tote ka khiesuh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka khut in vabu a mu bangin mite’ hauna ka mu hi; mite in a kinuasie vatui a lah bangin leitung zosie ka khawm zo hi; a hla a piasah lo, a kam kah loin a ham koima om lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moltum in a dom pa a ledop bang le ciengkhut in sing ahi lo mi khat a ledop bangin, a zang pa tungah heitang kiphasah thei ding amah? Ahi sihle a zang pa tungah sing-at nam a kiliensah thei ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Thunei pen pa, Vanglien Topa in a galhang mithaute lahah a gawngsah thei natna a tungsah ding a, a vanglietna nei-ah meikuong bangin a kuong khat a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel’ khuovah mei suohin, ama’ Siengtho Pa zong meikuong a suoh ding hi; khumi in ni khat sungin a ling khaute katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in gamlah’ thupina le an pienna a leitang pen hinna le pumpi gawmin a nipi-in susie ding a, mi dammaw khat bangin ama a tha zawngkhal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A gamlah singkung omsun teng a tawm seng ziehin, naupang khat in a phaza lai tawh gielin sim thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Israel a omlaite le Jacob’ innkuon sung panin a suohta laite in amahaw a satgawpte tungah kingam nawn loin, Topa Israel Siengtho Pa tungah thudih tawh a kingam zaw ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thahat Pasien kungah Jacob innkuon a omlaite a kilekia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen tuipieu-a senel za bangin na mi Israel-te tam nanle a omlai teng beh ang kilekia ding uhi. Dihna tawh a dimlet suhsietna a tun nading kikhensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen a thu khensatsa bangin Vanglien Topa Pasien in leitung mun zosie-ah manthaina tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Vanglien Topa Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi: “Zion-a teng ka mite aw, Egypt-te na bawl bangin Assyria-te in a ciengtawn utawh hing satin a ciengkhut uh hing lamto nan leh amate giing sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Azieh pen tomkal khat sungin keima’ thangpaina dai ding a, amau’ manthai nading lamah ka lungthahna kihei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in Oreb suongpi-ah Midian-te a satlia lai bangin khauhuol tawi-in amate a sat ding hi; tuipi tungah ama’ ciengkhut om ding a, ama in Egypt gama a bawl bangin tua a ciengkhut a domto ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin na liengko panun ama’ vangih kiladawhin na ngawng panun ama’ hahkol kisusie ding hi. Rimmon panin ama peito a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aiath khuo a tung hi; ama in Migron khuo kantanin Michmash khuo-ah a van a khol hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />amate in ciengkot a kantan vua, Geba khuo-ah a gieh uhi; Ramah khuomite zau-in a citun vua, Saul’ tenna Gibeah-te a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gallim khuo tanute aw, nahpitahin kiko un! Laishah khuo aw, ngai in! Anathoth khuo aw, ama dawng in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Madmenah a taimang a, Gebim-a tengte zong suotahna sui-in a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuni mama-in Nob khuo-ah ama khawl ding a, Zion tanu’ Muol Jerusalem muoltang tungah a khuttum a ziel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />En un, Thunei pen pa, Vanglien Topa in a giinhuoi a vanglienpi tawh singbate a heuh ding hi; singkung sang pente kiphua ding a, a sangtuomte kiniemsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in gammang singte hei khat tawh phua ding a, singkung thupite tawh Lebanon a puaton ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jessi’ phung panin a ba khat ang meng ding a, a zungte panin a ba khat ang khang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama tungah Topa’ hlagau ahi, pilna hlagau le theitelna hlagau, ngaisut theina hlagau le thahatna hlagau, theina hlagau le Topa zatahna hlagau a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Topa zatahna khu nuom a sa ding hi. Ama in a mita a mu bangin thu khen loin, a bila a zah bangin zong khensat lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in dihna tawh mizawngte’ thu khenpiehin, leitunga a nunnem mite adingin khentuom nei loin, thu a khensat ding hi. Ama in a kama ciengzawl tawh leitung sat ding a, ama’ nephu husan in migilote a that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in dihna kawnggahin nei ding a, a muonhuoina a taigahna-in nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keivom le tuuno omtonin, kamkei le keelno lumton ding hi; bawngno, humpi, le ganhing thaute lumtonin, naupangno khat in tuate a hawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawngpi le vompi in an maitonin a note zong lumton ding uhi; bawngtang bangin humpi in bukungte a ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gul guneite’ kuo vangah nausen nawitawp laite apmai ding a, nawitang nausente in a khut utawh gulsie’ kuo a sawh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka muol siengthote tungah khatlekhat kiliemsah loin, zong a kisusie sih ding uhi. Azieh pen tuite in tuipi a tuommang bangin Topa theina tawh leitung kidim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin mite tungah Jessi’ zung khu lim khatin ding ding hi; minamte in ama sui-in ama’ opna mun a thupi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Topa in Assyria, Egypt, Pathros, Ethiopia, Elam, Shinar, Hamath, le tuipi gei-a gamte panin ama’ mi a kinuasie a omlaite a ngakia thei nadingin a niveina a khut a zahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in minamte adingin lim khat khai ding a, a kinotmang Israel-te kaikhawmin, ama in lei kiuli panin a kithezah Judah a khawmtuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ephraim’ thangsietna peimang ta ding a, Judah a kigalbawlna teng a kisumaimang ta ding hi; Ephraim in Judah a thangsie sih ding a, Judah in Ephraim a galbawl sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle nitumna lama Philistia-te’ elzangah bawhsuhin a tuong ding vua, nisuona lama mite a bulu ton ding uhi. Edom le Moab tungah a khut uh a hla ding vua, Ammon-te in amau’ thu a mang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in nahpi-in Egypt tuipi’ lei khu a susie ding a, Gun tungah huisa tawh khut a zah ding hi. Tua khu luidung sagi-in kikhenzahin, ama in keng tawh galkai nading lampi a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n Egypt gam pan a peito lai vua Israel adinga lamlien a op bangin, a omlai a kinuasiete adingin Assyria gam panin lam lienpi khat om ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangma in khum ni ciengin tam bangin na gen ding hi: “ Topa aw, na kungah lungdam kang ko ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile kei tungah nang na lungthah vangin na lungthahna a dam zo ta a, nangma in kei nei henem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A tahtahin Pasien khu keima’ kihutdamna ahi hi; keima in ama ka muong ding a, ka zau vawt sih ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa Pasien khu ka thahatna le ka vanglietna ahi hi; ama ka kihutdamna a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note in hutdamna tuikhuhte panin lungdam kipahin tui na tawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin tam bangin na gen ding uhi: Topa tungah lungdam ko-in ama’ min lo un; minamte lahah ama’ nasepnate phuongzah un; ama’ min kitawisang hi, ci-in phuongzah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in thupitahin a sep zo ziehin Topa tungah phatna la sa un; leitung mun zosie-ah tami thu kitheisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpi nam Zion aw, a gingin awng inlen, kipahin zeila awi in. Azieh pen na laikim vuah Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa thupi tahin a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz’ tapa Isaiah in Babylon tawh kisai-in thuphuon mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Muol gawta tungah lim khat khai unlen, amate tungah aw ngai tahin kiko un. Miliente’ kotpi-ah a lut nadingun amate khutzap un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei mama in ka sienthosah mite thu ka pie zo a, ka lungthahna a suokhie dingin kihisahna tawh a kisangkoi ka galhangte ka hlan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai un, mi honpi tampite husa ging banga muoltung tenga awging valuhpi khu! Ngai un, namcin’ kumpi gamte kikhawma awging valuhpi khu! Vanglien Topa in gal sim dingin galkapte a kaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitung buppi susie dingin a gamla vanmong panin Topa le a lungthahna galhiemte ang kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa’ ni ang nai ta ahi ziehin mau-in kap un. Vanglienpa’ kung pan ang pei bangin suhsietna ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ziehin khut zosie thazaw sieng ding a, mi zosie’ lungtang tuisuohin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale amate a lungkie ding uhi. Natna le lunggimna in amate tukon ding hi; numei nausuoh ding bangin na a sa ding uhi. Lamdangsa-in amate khatlekhat a ki-en ding uhi; meikuong bangin amate a mit a mai uh a san ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />En un, leitung gamdai suohsah ding le, a tung pan mawneite a susie dingin, a gilo, a zauhuoi lungthahna le thangpaina tawh Topa’ ni ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen vantung aasite le aasi honpite in amau’ khuovah a tangsah nawn sih ding uhi; ni ang suo ciengin miel pai ding a, hla in zong khuovah tangsah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A gitlona ziehin leitung ka gawt ding a, a mawna ziehun migilote ka gawt ding hi; mi kihisahte’ kiphatsahna ka tawpsah ding a, mi khansie le mi gawgamte ka niemkhieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in mite kham hoite sanga a cieuzaw le mihingte, Ophir khamte sanga a cieu zaw-in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin vante ka kilingsah ding a, Vanglien Topa a thangpai ziehin a giinhuoi a lungthah ni ciengin ama’ mun panin leitung a kithing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kivai sakhi ahi sihle a cing om lo tuu bangin, a unpi-un mipite lamah kihei-in a gam ciet vuah a taimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kimu mi popo tei tawh kidawtlia ding a, mi a kiman popo namsau tawh si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amahaw’ mitmu-in a nausente uh kiguoicimsah ding hi. A innte uh kibulu-in a zite zong kibuon gawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />En un, amate sim dingin ngun a thuse lo pa le kham tawh a lungkim lo Media-te ka hantawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thaltangte un tangvalte that ding hi; amate in naubu pana a pieng nausente a hepi sih ding uhi. A mit un zong nausente a khuotuo sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpi gam zosie’ vanglietna, Chaldea-te’ thupina le a kisahtheipi Babylon khu Pasien in Sodom le Gomorrah a sietsah lai hun ang bang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangma cih hunin mi teng nawn lo ding hi; khang tawntungin zong koima a teng nawn sih ding hi; khum munah Arab-te in a puonbuh uh lam lo ding a, khum munah tuucingte in a gante uh lumsah lo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua munah gamsate lumin, amau’ inn pen a hawh ganhingte tawh kidim ding hi. Tua munah va kalaoh-te teng ding a, tua munah keel-dawite a lam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tausangte sungah ngie-te le kumpi inn nuomte sungah si-alte ham ding hi. Gawt nading hun tungkhiel ta a, a nite kisawtsah nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanle Topa in Jacob tungah lainatna nei a, Israel teelkia-in a gam sung vuah amahaw a koikia ding hi; tuale gamdang mite in amate pawlin tuaci’n amate in Jacob innkuon a bel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mite in amate manin a gam vuah zawpi ding a, Israel innkuon in Topa’ gam sungah minamte sila pasal le sila numei-in a nei ding uhi; amate in sala a man ngai mite salin a lemat mat ding vua, amate a bawlsie mite tungah vai a hawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lungkhamna, na buoina, nasep hamsapi sepna panin Topa in note toidamna ang pieh ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa tungah tam ehneh hona kam na zang ding uhi: Mi bawlsie pa khu bangci manthai a ta e! Mi simmaw hatpa khu bangci manthai a ta e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawl loin mite satna-a kizang, lungthahna tawh minamte tungah vai a hawm, nahpitaha a bawlsie, migilote’ ciengkhut le gam uhte’ ciengkhut khu Topa in sattanpieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leitung mi buppi tawlnga-in a sip dide uhi; amate in la sa-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tungah taasingte a lungdam vua, Lebanon gam sunga taamtah singkungte in, “Nang ang kiniemkoi-a kipanin kote ei phua dingin koima ang pei ta sih hi,” ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na vaitun a dawn dingin leinei-a misite a kiling uhi; nang ang dawntuo dingin leitung makai zosie’ hlimte kithosah hi; leitung kumpi a sem ngai zosie a kumpi topha ciet uh panin a thosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a unpi-un nang hing hopi-in, “Nang zong kote ma bangin thazawm ta teh! kote ma bang ta teh!” ang ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Misikhuo-ah na kithupisahna le na harp lasahna awte kipeipisuh ta hi; thante na netpha ahi ta a, zangh-ehte zong khu na kihuina puon ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Phalvah’ tapa Zingsol aw, vantung pan nang a bangci kieh na hiei! Minamte a niem koi pa ahi nangma, leilah dongah ang bangci kisattan dawh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang in na lungsim sungah, “Van tungah kato vang; Pasien’ aasite tungah ka kumpi topha sangkhan vang; Zaphon munsangte tung, kikhopna muol tungah kato vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />meiilumte dawnah kato vangin, kei le kei Sangpen Pa bangin kibawl vang,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hizongle nang pen Misikhuo, a thuh pente muna Hankhuh sung dongah ang kipeipi suh ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang ang mute in ang encien ding vua, amate in nangma’ thu a lungngai dedu ding uhi: “Leitung a kilingsah pa, kumpi gamte a lawhthing pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />senel gam bangin leitung bawlin, a khuopite a lumlet pa, thongkiete inn-a a peisah lo pa khu tam pa hi lo amah?” a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Minamte’ kumpi zosie a hankhuh ciet vuah thupi tahin a lum uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ahi vangin nang pen na han panin a kidahhuoi misi uite bangin ang kipaimang a, namsau in a sut pailet, Hankhuh suongte sunga a kumsuh, keng tawh kituoncil misite bangin, luonghawmte in nang ang khucip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na gam susie-in na mite that zo na hi ziehin, nang pen amate tawh ang kivuiton sih ding hi. Sietna bawlte’ a suon a hlahte’ min kilo ngai nawn sih taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pate uh’ khielna ziehin a tate thalia nading mun bawlkhol un. Amate leitang luo dingin thosah ngai nawn sih unlen, ahi sihle khuopite in leitung maitang tuomsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in a cina-ah, “A langkhat vuah ka pang ding a, Babylon’ min le a omlaite’ tate le suonlehlahte ka sumaimang ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale keima in sakute busah nadingin tua khuopi bawlin buoltui ka veisah ding hi; tua khu keima in suhsietna munphie tawh ka phiet sieng ding hi,” Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vanglien Topa kiciemzo hi: Ka tupnasa bangin a pieng ding hi; tuale ka gelsa bangin a tung ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka gam sungah Assyria-te ka susie ding a, ka muolte tungah ama ka tuoncil ding hi; amate kung panin a hahkol kisut ding a, a liengko panun a vangih uh kisut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tami in leitung bup tawh kisai-a a kingim gelna ahi hi; tam khut pen minam zosie tunga kizah khut ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vanglien Topa’ gelsa ahi ziehin koi in sumit zo ding ahei? Ama’ khut kizah zo ta hi, koi in dawhkia ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpi Ahaz a si kumin tami thuphuon a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Philistia-te zosie aw, note ang kisatna cieng a tawn ziehin lungdam sih un, azieh pen gul gui panin gul gunei a pien bangin, a suonlehlahte a leng thei gulpi a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mizawngte’ tacilte in an a ne ding vua, tasamte bihtahin lum hit-hiet ding uhi; na zungpi ka kielsisah ding a, a omlai nangma’ mite ka that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kotpi aw, kap vapo in; khuopi aw, awng vapuoh in; no Philistia-te aw, na unpi-un zau-in tuisuohmang un! Azieh pen leilu lam panin meikhu kitungto a, amate a guolguolin a tangtat koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi khatpo in minam kamtaite bangci dawn thei ding ahei? “ Topa in Zion phutkip zo a, tuale amate lahah a tasamte in ama sungah kibuhna a mu uhi,” ci-in dawng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab tawh kisai thuphuon ahi hi. Zan khat sungin Ar a kisuhsiet ziehin Moab gam kisie hi; zan khat sungin Kir a kisuhsiet ziehin Moab gam kisie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biehinnpi-ah Dibon peito a, a kap dingin munsangte ah a kato hi; Nebo le Medeba ziehin Moab nahpi-in kap hi. Luzang zosie kimettol a, khamul zosie kimetkieu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />khuopi lampite-ah la-ip puon a sil uhi; innkhum tungte le tuol-awngte ah mi zosie kapin hlitui luong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heshbon le Elealeh a kap vapo vua, Jahaz dongah a awgingte uh kiza hi; tua ahi ziehin Moab’ kawngte kiling hi; ama a citun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka lungtangah Moab adingin ka kap hi; galtai a mite Zoar le Eglath-shelishiyah ah tai uhi. Azieh pen Luhith katona lampi-ah a kaa kawmun amate a peito uhi. Horonaim zotna lampi-ah manthaina awging tawh a kap uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimrim tuite kang zo hi; hampate gawta sieng a, a dawntha suong ding om nawn loin, lohing khat beh om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate in a sui a zon uh a nei a lamte ule a kholsa uh na tampite, Gielheh Lui galah a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen Moab gam kimvelah kaana aw khat ging hi; kaa le mau in Eglaim le Beer-elim dong ban hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen Dibon luituite sisan tawh kidim a, hinanle Dibon tungah a tamzaw ka tungsah lai ding hi, Moab a suohtate ading le gam sunga a omlaite adingin keima in humpi khat ka langsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Senel gam zotna lampi Sela panin Zion tanu’ muolsang ah gam-uhte adingin tuunote puoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A bu kithezahpieh vate bang le a hla zapin a leng kawikawi vate bangin, Arnon tanmunte-ah Moab’ tanute, tua bangin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thu ei kikuppi unlen, thutang tawh thu ei khenpieh un; sunkim laitahin na hlim zanlai bangsah in. A kipampaite phuol inlen, a galtaite leheh sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />note lahah a kipampai Moab-te tengsah in; mi susiete lah panin a kibuhna uh na hi ta in,” ci hi. Mi bawlsie pa a op nawn lo ciengin suhsietna zong veng a, gam sung pan misuomte a manthai ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />itna kip sungah kumpi topha khat kiphut ding a, thutang sui-in thuman sep ding a kinaw uhpa khat, David’ buh sunga tua topha tungah muonhuoi tahin a to ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite in Moab’ kiphatsahna i za zo ta hi. Kinah phatsah sam ei! A kihisahna, a kiphatsahna, a kilietsahna, a kisielnate zuoupi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Moab kap hinlen, Moab adingin mi zosie kap uheh. Kir-hareseth khuo-a lenggagaw mohte adingin lungsie-in kap un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen Heshbon lote lah tul ta a, Sibmah lengguite zong vul sieng zo hi. Hun khat lai-in tua lengga bawhte in minam uliente na tekham ngai a, tuate in Jazer dong banin senel gamah a zamsuoh hi. Gamlapi-ah a bate zam a, tuipi kantanin a zam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Sibmah’ lengguite adingin, Jazer-te’ kaa bangin keima ka kap hi; Heshbon le Elealeh aw, ka hlitui tawh kang tehlopsah hi. Bangzieh ahei cile na singga lah ule na anlahte tungah kikona sip zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lei hoina lolai-ah kipahna lungnopna kilamang zo ta hi. Lengga huonte-ah la kisa nawn lo a, kikona zong a om nawn sih hi. Lengga cilna-ah koima’n lengga tui suh nawn lo a, lengga a kilaw cienga kikona aw zong a sip ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hi a, Moab adingin harp bangin ka lungtang kisat a, Kir-hares adingin zong kei mama ka kisat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moab, amama a kilah cieng, munsang tungah lung gimin a pei cieng, a mun siengtho-ah thungen dinga a pei ciengin a lawcing sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in tu masangin Moab tawh kisai-in tam thu a na gensa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in Topa in, “A kiciel nasempa’ kum simdan banga a kisim kum thum sungin, ama’ mipite tam tamale Moab’ vanglietna in simmawna thuoh ding hi; tuale a omlaite zong a tawm sengin thanem ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Damascus tawh kisai thuphuon ahi hi. En un, a khuopi hina panin Damascus khawl ding a, a kisie buathah lomtang a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A khuopite kinuasie peisuoh ding hi; tuate ganhonte tatna mun suoh ding a, ganhonte lum hit hietin, koima in amate a zausah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraim panin kulpi mangthai ding a, Damascus panin zong kumpi gam mangthai ding hi; tuale a omlai Aram-te pen Israel mite’ vanglietna bang ding uhi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Jacob’ vanglietna kiniemsah ding a, a tahsa tunga a thauna pen gawngtam ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anlate in ankung po lai kaikhawmin, anvuite khut tawh a at bang le, mi khat in Rephaim Kuomah buvuite a khon bang hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Olive kung a kilawthing ciengin, a bameng sangpen dawna a ga ni ahiei thum ahiei, theikung bamengte tunga li ahiei, nga ahiei a op bangin ansanghte kinuasie ding hi, Israel-te’ Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin mite in amate a Bawlpa thupisimin a mit un Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa a en ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />amate in a khut utawh a bawlsa uh maitamte thudon loin, a khutme tawh a bawlsa uh khuom siengthote hitale maitamte hitale etin zong a nei nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin a khuopi muonhuoite uh pen Hiv-te le Amor-te in Israel mite’ zieha a nuasie uh munte tawh kibang ding a, tua mun gamdai a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen na hundampa uh Pasien na mangngil ta vua, na kibuhna uh Suongpi na phawhkha ta sih uhi; tua ahi ziehin kung hoite suon nan locin, gamdang pasien na bieh nading vua, na suon uh ahi bo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />note in na suon ni ma-un tuate khangsahin, na vaw ni uh a zingmawngin tuate paasah thei nan locin, gimna le damsah thei lo natna ang tun ni-in, anlah ding teng a maimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ah, mi tampite’ husa ging, a husa ging ukhu tuipi lien huging tawh kibang ei! Ah, mi tampite awhna khu tuihatte’ gin vapual tawh kibang ei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tui tampite a hawh vapuoh bangin, minamte a hawh vapuoh vua, hinanle ama in amate phawhsie ding a, gamlapi-ah amate a taimang ding uhi. Muol tunga hui mai-a a leng ansi bang le, huipi mai-a a lengmang leivui bangin amate kidelmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En in, nitah ciengin zauna a om ding hi! Zingmawng masangin tuate om nawn lo hi. Tamte pen ei susiete’ tuo ding thu le, ei bulute’ tanh ding thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ethiopia gunte gal khat a, a hlazap ging ziezuo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nile gun tawnin tuite tungah pumpeng gunkuong tawh palaite a kisawlna gam khu gimna thuoh ding ahi hi! No kamtai tangzangte aw, a tun a sang a cizol sepsop, a nai a gamla-a kizatah, a thahat le galzo minam, a gam uh gun in a khenkhe mite kungah va pei ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />No leitunga teng mi zosie le leitung tunga om mi zosiete aw, muol dawnah lim khat a kikhai ciengin en un! Pengkul a kimut ciengin ngai un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in kei kungah tam bangci hi: Nitang sunga a lum hiuhiau bang le, anlah nisat lai-a meizun bangin, ka tenna mun panin sip dide-in ka en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen anlah hun masang, a paa teng a pul zaw, a paa teng lengga min a suo ciengin, ama in singba heuna namkawi tawh a bameng teng attan ding a, a bazaam teng heu sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua teng zosie, muol tunga vate le leitunga gamsate’ an dingin kinuasie ding hi. Tuale khuokhal lai-in vate in ne ding a, phalbi lai-in leitunga gamsate in a ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua hun ciengin, a gam uh gunpi in a khenkhap, a thahat le galzo minam, a nai le a gamla-a a kizatah minam, a tunsang le a cizol sepsop mite kung panin Vanglien Topa’ min opna Zion muol tungah letsongte kipuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt tawh kisai thuphuon ahi hi. En in, a gang mama meii tungah Topa a tuong a, Egypt gamah a pei hi; ama mai-ah Egypt milimte zau-in citun ding a, a sung vuah Egypt-te’ lungtang tuisuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Egypt-te le Egypt-te a kihau dingin ka tawh ding a, amate khatlekhat, veng khatlekhat, khuopi khatlekhat, gam khatlekhat a kisim ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate sungah Egypt-te’ lungsim hawmsuoh ding a, keima in amau’ gelna ka suhsietpieh ding hi; amate in milimte le misi hlate, dawi siemte le mibum theite thu a kuppi ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />keima in a khansie pupa khat’ khut sungah Egypt-te ka pie ding hi; amate tungah a giinhuoi kumpi khat in vai a hawm ding hi, Thunei pen pa, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nile guntuite kanggaw ding a, guntui kangin gawta ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />luinah tui kilate namsie ding a, Egypt gama Nile gun mengte kiemin gawta ding a, pumpeng le phaipheng phungte a muot sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nile lui gei le Nile luipieu-a munte pawnkieu ding a, Nile lui gei-a kitu khaici zosie gawta-in hui in taw nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngabengte da-in a kap ding uhi; Nile gun sunga ngathang siete zosie kapin mau-in, tui sunga len khu ngai mite a thanem sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anthul khau a ciing nasemte lungkie-in, patpuon gante lungkham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puon gante zauthawngin, sumlaw-a nasem zosie da ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zoan uliente mot citahin a maw uhi; Pharaoh’ thu kikuppi mipilte in mot thu vive a hil uhi. Bangci-in Pharaoh kungah, “Kei mipil khat ka hi a, tanglai kumpite’ a suon a hlahte khat ka hi hi,” ci thei ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in na mipilte uh hei-a om uh ahei? Vanglien Topa in Egypt sim dinga a gelsa thute, bang ahei ci amate in na kungah gensah inlen, kitheisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zion uliente mimaw a suoh sieng ta vua, Memphis uliente zong mite’ solin a om ta uhi; a minam ding vua innkiu suonga a kineite in Egypt a puikhiel ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in amate sungah kituhkalna hlagau buohsuh zo hi; a luoh lahah zukham pa a hawipua bangin, amate in Egypt-te’ sepna zosie-ah khielsahin a hawisah ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt-te adingin a lutang in ahi a, a mei in ahi a, lutu ba in ahi a, pumpeng in ahi zongin, bangma a bawlpieh thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Egypt-te numei bangin om ding a, amate a sim dinga a khut a zah Vanglien Topa mai-ah zau-in citun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale Judah gam pen Egypt-te’ giin khat suoh ding a, Vanglien Topa in amate sim dingin a gelna ziehin tami thu kigenna mi zosiete a zau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Egypt gam sungah Canaan-te’ ham a zang khuopi nga in Vanglien Topa’ thu mang dingin a kiciem ding uhi. Tuate lahah khat pen Ni Khuopi kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Egypt gam laizangah Topa adingin maitam khat, a gamgi-ah Topa adingin khuom khat om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua pen Vanglien Topa adingin Egypt gam sungah lim le teci hi ding hi; amate a bawlsie mite ziehin Topa kungah a kiko ciengun, ama in amate kungah a hundam ding mi khat sawlin amate panpi-in hunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Egypt-te kungah Topa amama kipholah ding hi; khum ni ciengin Egypt-te in Topa ang thei ta ding a, tuale biehpiehna le meihal biehna tawh Pasien a bie ding vua, Topa tungah amate in thuciemnate bawlin, tuate a sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in Egypt-te sat ding a, a satna damsahkia ding hi; Topa kungah amate kilekia ding a, ama in a thumna uh ngai-in a damsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Egypt gam panin Assyria gamah lamlien khat kisiel ding a, tuale Assyria-te Egypt gamah haw-in, Egypt-te zong Assyria gamah haw ding a, Egypt-te in Assyria-te tawh Pasien a bieton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin Israel-te pen Egypt-te le Assyria-te banah a thumna hi ding a, leitung zosie adingin thupha ahi ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in, “Ka mi Egypt-te, ka khutsuoh Assyria-te, le keima’ gouluo Israel-te in thupha nga taheh,” ci-in thupha a pieh mite ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ashdod ah Assyria Kumpipa Sargon in a sawl a galkapmang lienpenpa pei a, tua khuo simin a lah kum-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />khum hun laitahin Topa in Amoz’ tapa Isaiah hopi a, “Pei in, na kawnga la-ip puon suodawh inlen na kedap sutdawh in,” a ci a, tua bang ma-in ama gamta-in guohtang le kengguoh tawh lam a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in, “Ka nasempa Isaiah in Egypt-te le Ethiopia-te langkhatah lim le hilkholna lim dingin a guohtang le kengguoh tawh kum thum sung lam a pei ma bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assyria kumpipa in Egypt-te’ maizum nadingin Egypt a kimante le saltang Ethiopia-te a vuoi a khangin, guohtang le kengguoh tawh tawbo dawhsa-in a puimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale amate pen a kinepna uh Ethiopia le a kisahtheipi uh Egypt ziehin lungkie le lamet bei-in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin tam tuipi gei-a teng mite in, ‘En un, eite’ kinepna, Assyria kumpipa kung pan ei hu ding le ei hunkhie dinga i taina uh mite tungah tam bang thu pieng tamawh ei! Tuale eite bangci suotah ding i hi ta uh ahei?’ ci ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipi gei-a senel gam tawh kisai thuphuon ahi hi. Negeb gam sungah pumpei a kipei bangin, tua khu senel gam pan le a zauhuoi gam panin ang pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kungah a zauhuoi mangmuna khat ang kigen hi; a leheh mipa in leheh a, a susie mipa in susie hi. Elam aw, kuonto in. Media aw, imtawm in; ama’ piensah khuisahna zosie ka vengsah sieng zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ziehin kawng natna tawh ka kidim hi; numei nausuoh nat bangin natna in ei man hi; ka zah thei lo nadingin ka kunsuh a, ka mu thei lo nadingin lungkie-in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lung vai-in zauna in ei lingsah hi; ka hlangai zan khuomiel kei adingin citutna suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in sabuoi pha-in, tuonga kipha puonte a pha vua, an ne tui dawnin a om uhi. Galkap mangte aw, tho unlen, lumte sathau nu un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in kei kungah tam bangin gen hi: “Pei-in galvil khat koi inlen, ama in a mu mite gensah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a kopkopin sakol tung tuongte, laa tunga tuongte, kalaoh tunga tuongte a mu ciengin limtah phatahin ama ngaisah in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin galvil pa a kiko hi: “ Topa aw, tausang tungah sun tungtawnin ka ding a, ka vilna munah zan khuovah ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />En in, sakol tunga tuongte a kopkopin hing pei!” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Babylon cim ta, cim ta; a milim pasien-te zosie lei lahah kisatpua sieng ta,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kicilsa, a kizapsa ka mite aw, Israel-te’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa tung panin note tunga ka zahsa thu teng keima in kang tangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dumah tawh kisai thuphuon tam bang ahi hi. Seir panin khat in ei hlan a, tuzanin galvil pa bang a ci ei? Galvil pa, tuzan bang a ci ei?” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Galvil pa in, “Zingmawng ang tung a, zan zong ang tung hi. Nang thukan ding na hi leh kan in; hing pei inlen hing kan in,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Senel zanglei tawh kisai thuphuon tam bang ahi hi. Dedan mi khuolzin honte aw, Arabia gamlahah na gieh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tema gama teng mite aw, a dangtate tui puoh unlen, galtaite an tawh dawn un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate, namsau, a kidawhsa namsau, a kikuoi thal le gal hanna mun pana ang tai uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Topa in keima kungah tam bangin gen hi: “A kiciel nasempa khat in a sim kumte dung zui-in Kedar’ vang zosie kum khat sungin tawp ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuale a omlai Kedar’ galhangte zong tawp sieng ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa Israel-te’ Pasien in tam thu a genzo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangmuna kuom tawh kisai thuphuon tami ahi hi. Note na unpi vua innkhum tunga na kato uh bang na deina uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kikona husa a dim, a gamlum khuopi, lungdam a kipah khuopi aw, na sunga kithatte khu namsau tawh kithat ahi sih a, gal sunga si zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ulien vaihawmte zosie a taiton ta uhi; thal zah kul loin amate kiman sieng hi. Gamlapi-ah taimang nan locin ang kimu note zosie ang kiman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in ka ci hi: “Kei ei en sih unlen, hlitui naptui luongin ei kapkap sah un; ka it ka mite sina ziehin kei henep ding hing hanciem da ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Vanglien Topa Pasien in mangmuna kuom sungah buoina le kitotcilna, kitawhnawina, kulpite suhsietna le muolte kungah panpi ding ngenin kikona ding ni khat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sakol leeng le sakol tunga tuongte tawh Elam-te in thallawng a puo vua, Kir mite in a lumte uh a hawhmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kuom dei pente uh sakol leeng tawh kidim a, sakol tunga tuongte kul kotpite-ah a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Judah’ kidalna lamang zo ta hi. Tua ni ciengin nangma in Gammang Inn sunga kikoi galhiemte na en a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale nang in David khuopi sungah mun tampitah a kisietna na mu a, tuale nang in buol nuoinung tuite na cing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang in Jerusalem innte na sim a, a kisie kulbangte puophat nadingin innte na phel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kulpi ni kikalah buol lui-a tuikhol nadingin nangma in tuibem khat na bawl hi. Ahi vangin nang in tam a bawlpa etin zong na nei sih a, sawtpi lai-a a gelpa na thuse sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Vanglien Topa in a kap a mau ding, lu heukieu ding le la-ip puon sil dingin keima ei hlan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />hinanle kipahna le guolnopna, bawngtang le tuute gawna, sa nehna le zu nehna a om zawsop a, “Zing cieng si ding i hi ziehin ne vai-in dawn vai,” na ci zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in ka bilkawm-ah thu ang gen hi: Na si masangun tam mawna hing kimaisah het lo ding hi,” Vanglien Topa Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Hing pei in, tam inn sung vaipuo neisa kempa Shebna kungah pei inlen ama kungah tam bangin gen in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tami sungah nang dinga hankhuh a to, a sangna munah hankhuh a bawl, na op nading suong a lem mipa aw, nang in tami munah bang thu na nei a, na sanggamte koi teng ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka mihing pa aw, Topa in nang ang paimang gawp ding hi. Ama in nang hing pummatin zong hing tudetin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ang pingpei ding a, mun tanzau-ah bawlung a kise bangin ang sep ding hi; na pu’ innkuon dinga muolphona ahi nang pa aw, nang tua munah si-in, na kisahtheipi na sakollengte lahah na pua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na nasep panin hing kisuon ding a, na dinmun panin zong hing kikaisuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Hilkiah’ tapa, ka nasempa Eliakim ka hlan ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />na puontuol ama silsahin, na kawnggah tawh ka gah ding hi. Ama’ khut sungah na thuneina ka pie ding a, tuale Jerusalem-a a tengte ading le Judah innkuonte adingin ama pen pa khat ahi ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in ama’ liengko-ah David innkuon’ tawhtang ka koi ding hi; ama in hong ding a, koima in khah zo lo ding hi; ama in khah ding a, koima in hong zo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima in munkip khatah van khaina bangin ama ka khendet ding a, a pupa innkuon dingin ama pen a zatahhuoi kumpi topha hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuale a pupa innkuon’ vang teng zosie ama tungah khai-in, ama’ cihlahte le a ta a naute, vanzah a neu teng zosie, haite-a kipanin thawlte dongin vankhaina-ah a kikhai bangin ama tungah kikhai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin mundet khata kikil vankhaina in a lel ding hi; Topa’ gensa ahi ziehin ama tawngsanin kiesuh ding a, a tunga vangih kikhaite kisie ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tyre tawh kisai thuphuon. Tarshish tembawte aw, kapin mau un, azieh pen na kulpi uh kisusie zo hi. Cyprus panin ang pei lai-un amate in tam thu a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuipi gei-a tengte aw, sip dide un, Sidon sumbuhte aw, na kamtaite un tuipi a kantan vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale tui hatte tungah amate a om uhi; nang dinga phiengsieh kidongte pen Shihor gama pieng ante le Nile guna an kilate ahi hi. Note pen minamte’ sum bawlna na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sidon aw, maizum in, azieh pen tuipi in genzo hi, tuipi kulpi in tam bangin a gen hi: “Nausuoh natna ka vei ngai sih a, nau zong ka nei ngai sih hi, tangvalte ka khoi ngai sih a, nungahte zong ka khansuo ngai sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt gamah tami thusuoh a kizah ciengin, Tyre thusuoh tungah amate lungkham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuipi gei-a teng mite aw, Tarshish kantanin kap un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kipatna tangtawng pan ahi, a gamlapi-a teng dinga a keng tawh a peipi, tam khuopi khu noma’ lungdamna khuopi ma ahi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpi lukhu a khusah pa, a sumbuhte ulien vive hi-in, a sumbawlte uh leitunga a kizatah vive ahi, tami Tyre khuo sim dinga a gel khu koi ahei? A sumbuh bawlte lah uliente vive hi a, a vanleite uzong lah leitunga a kipahtate a hi sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien in minthanna zieha kiphatsahna zosie tawpsah nading le leitunga a kipahtawite zosie zumsuo ding a gelzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tarshish tembawte aw, noma’ gamah galkai un; tembaw khawlmun om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in tuipi tungah a khut zah a, kumpi gamte kilingsah hi. A kulpite a susie dingin Canaan tawh kisai-in Topa in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in tam bangin a gen hi: A kibawlsie Sidon’ tanu ngahnu siengtho aw, nang na lungdam ngai ta sih ding hi; tho inlen Cyprus-ah galkai in. Tua sung nangawnah toidamna na mu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chaldea-te’ gam en un! Tami namte khu Assyria-te ahi sih hi; amate in Tyre khu gamsate kuol nadinga a sesa ahi hi. Amate in khuopi buluna ding tausangte a daw vua, kumpi innte phelkhie-in a kisiet nadingin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tarshish tembawte aw, kap vangut un, azieh pen na kulpite uh kisie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khum ni-a kipanin kumpipa khat’ khankum tan khat ahi kum sawmsagi sung Tyre kimangngil ding hi. Kum sawmsagi a tawp ciengin, numei pahtat khat tungtang la-a a na kitap bang teng Tyre tungah tung ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nang, phawkhah lo numei pahtat nu aw, harp lasahna la inlen, khuopi sungah vah kawikawi in! Ang kiphawkia thei nadingin la ngai nono phuoh inlen, la tampi sa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sawmsagi a cin ciengin Tyre ah Topa haw ding a, tuale ama nu in a nasep ngai semkia-in, lei tunga kumpi gam zosie lahah kizua-in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa kungah ama nu’ sumbuh vante le a lawmante ki-ap ding hi; a summet ngate kikhol loin kituomkoi lo ding a, hizongle ama nu’ sumbuh vante pen Topa’ opna munah a tengte adingin kicing taha a neh ding ule puonhoite leina-a a zah ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Topa in leitung hawmsuoh sahin gamkhing suohsah ding a, lei maitang lumlet gawpin, a tunga tengte thezah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siempute le mipite, silate le a mangpate, sila numeite le a pite, a leite le a zuate, a leitawisahte le a leibate, summet nete le leibate, kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leitung kihawmsuoh sahin kisiecip ding hi; azieh pen Topa in tam thu genzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung vulin gawta a, leitung thanemin vulgawp hi; vantungte le leitung a ni tuohin a thanem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tunga teng mite in leitung niehsah uhi. azieh pen amate in thukham a sukhiel vua, ngaina kipte zui loin, tawntung thuciemna a palsat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin samsietna in leitung nawmval a, a khielna ziehun a tunga tengte a thuoh vua, tua ahi ziehin leitunga teng mite kiemsuhin themkhat beh a om tabo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lenggazu cieu mama-in lengguite vulgawp a, a lungdam mi zosie khuisa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tawm gin ngai teng a dai ta a, kipahna awgingte sip didie-in, lyre lasahna gin ngaite a dai dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />La sah kawmin lenggazu a dawn nawn sih uhi; khamthei zu dawnte zong a zu dawn uh a khalawng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Buoina khuopi cimzan a, koima’ lut thei lo nadingin inn zosie kikhahcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lenggazu a kitasap ziehin lamdungah mite a kiko uhi. Kipahna zosie a tawpna tung ta a, leitung lungdamna a mangthai ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuopi a daidamin kinuasie a, tunkotte kisattanin kisie sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen olive kung a kisat zaw cieng bang le, lengga kilo zo-in a sanghte a kinuasie bangin, leitung le minamte lahah tua bangin a tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in a aw uh sangsahin kipahin la a sa ding uhi; Topa’ thupina ziehin nitumna panin a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ziehin nisuona lamah Topa min phat un; tuipi gei-a a teng mite in Topa Israel-te’ Pasien’ min phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eite in leimongte panin a Midih Pa tungah minthanna om taheh, ci-a phatna la kisa i za uhi. Hinanle keima in, “Ka lunggim mama, ka lunggim mama, gimnga pa hi tang e! Mi muonhuoi lote in muonhuoi lo tahin na a sep ziehun, mi muonhuoi lote in muonhuoi lo semsemin na a sem uhi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitunga teng mite aw, na tung vuah zauna, dum le thangte a om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zauna aw za-in a tai poma dum sungah a kie ding hi; dum sung pana a kato poma thangah a awh ding hi. Azieh pen vantung tawlette kihongin, leitung bulpi kiling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitung pawhkeh gawpin a themthem kisuo a, nasietahin kilawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zukhamte bangin leitung hawilen a, buh bangin kivei hi; ama’ khielna a tungah om a, ama pua-in thokia nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in khum ni ciengin vantunga mihonpite le leitunga kumpite dan a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dum sunga thongkie-te bangin amate kikhawmtuo ding uhi; thong sungah kot a kikhalu ding vua, ni tampi zaw ciengin amate dan kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin hlapi zala ding a, ni a mai a zum ding hi; azieh pen Zion Muol tung le Jerusalem-ah Vanglien Topa maang ding a, a upate’ mai-ah a minthanna a kilangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, ka Pasien na hi hi; nangma kang domsang ding a, na min kang phat ding hi; azieh pen nangma in na lamdangte na bawl zo a, tangtawnga na gelnate muonhuoi-in thawn ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile khuopi buathah lomtang na suo a, kulpi a nei khuopi a siesa-in na koi ta hi; gamdang mite’ kumpi inn khu khuo a bang nawn sih a, bangma cih hunin kilamkia nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mi thahatte in na min ang phat ding uhi; a gawgam minamte’ khuopite in nangma ang zatah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nang pen mizawngte ading in kibuhna, amau’ lung kham hunin tasamte adingin kibuhna, khuopi hui lan cienga kidalna le nisat cienga nihlim na hi hi. Mi gawgamte’ bawlsietna pen phalbi huipi tawh kibang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />gamdang mite’ husa pen mun gawta-a nisa tawh kibang hi. Meiilum a kai ziehin nang in nisa na thuoh zo hi; mi gawgamte’ lasahna khu a kisipsah dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam muol tungah mi zosie adingin Vanglien Topa in antui pen pawi le lengga zului pawi, gungeh tawh a kidim antui pen pawi le, a kitat zuningcia pente tawh pawi a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale ama in tam muol tungah mi zosie tunga kikhu misi puon le minam zosie tunga a kizah puonzalte susie ding hi; ama in a tawntungin sina a valtum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa Pasien in maitang zosie panin hlituite siapieh ding a, leitung mun zosie panin a mite’ mindaina a lahmangpieh ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa in a genzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin, “En un, tami eite’ Pasien ahi hi; eite ei hutdam nadingin ama i ngah uhi. Tami khu i nganga uh Topa ahi hi; a hutdamna sungah lungdamin kipah vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tami muol tungah Topa’ khut kinga ding hi. Ehdum sungah bukung a kisiacil bangin, a opna vuah Moab-te kisiacil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuingapte in tui ngapin a khut a zah bangun, amate in tua gam laizangah khutzah nan ule, a khut uh’ hanciemna om tama nanleh, a kiphatsahna uh kiniemkoi veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama’ kulpi bangsangte kikhiesuhin kiniemkoi ding a, leivui lah nangawnah kipaisuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin Judah gamah tami la kisa ding hi: Eite in khuopi kip khat i nei uhi; kulpite le munkipte bangin ama in guolzawna phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Upna lama a kip a dih minamte a lut thei nadingin kulpi tunkotte hong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang ang muon ziehin na tunga lungsim nga zing mite nangma in lungnopna na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tawntungin Topa muong un; azieh pen nangma in Topa Pasien sungah kumtawn suongpi khat na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in a sanga tengte a niemkhiehsuh hi; ama in khuopi sangpi a niemkhiehsuh hi. Ama in tuolah khiesuh a, leivui lahah paimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mizawngte’ keng le tasamte ketot in tua khuopi a tuoncil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midihte’ lampi a zang dide hi; Midih Pa aw, nang in midihte’ lampi na nelsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, na thukhenna lampi-ah nangma kang ngah uhi; ka hlagau’ lunggul khu ahile na min le na minthanna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zanin ka lungsim in nangma ang hlagul a, ka sunga om ka hlagau in lawptahin nangma ang sui hi. Bangzieh ahei cile nangma in leitungah thu na khen ciengin leitunga a teng mite in thudih kici a mu thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilote tungah angvanna a kilah leh, amate in dihna a theithei sih uhi; thuman mite’ gam sungah a lelamin amate a gamta vua, Topa’ thupina a mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa aw, na khut kilamto a, hizongle amate in a mu sih uhi. Na mite dinga na deiluotna amate musahin maizumsah inlen, ang langpangte mei in katumsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma in ko adingin kilemna nei bawlpieh ding hi, azieh pen kote sepna zosie nangma ei seppieh ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa kohaw’ Pasien aw, nang ahi lo topa dangte in ko tungah thu ang vaihawm vua, ahi vangin kote in nangma’ min beh ka pom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Misite hing nawn lo hi; a hlimte zong tho hi, azieh pen amate dan pie-in na susie zo ta a, amate kiphawkhahna zosie na phietmang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, nang in minamte na pungsah zo hi; nangma patawi-in na om ta hi; nangma in gam sunga gamgi zosie keima nei golkehpieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa aw, amate in lungkham hunin nang ang sui vua, nangma in amate na gawt ciengin thungetna sungin ang tau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Numei naupai khat a suo kuon ciengin na sa-in kipeh a, a awh vapuoh bangin, Topa aw, nangma ziehin kote zong tua bang ka hi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kote nau pai-in na sa-in ka kipehpeh vua, hizongle hui beh nau-in ka suoh uhi. Kote in leitungah guolzawna ka nga sih vua, leitunga a teng dingin zong koima a suoh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na misite uh hingin amau’ luonghawm a tho ding hi. Leivui lahah a tengte aw, khangloin kipahna la sa un! Azieh pen na daitui uh pen a vam lihleh daitui ahi a, leitung in sawtpi lai-a a sisate hingsah kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka mite aw, hing pei-in na innkhan sungah lut unlen, kot kikhalu un; lungthahna a ven masangin bakhat sung kiphuol phot un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amau’ khielna ziehin leitunga tengte dan a pie dingin, a opna panin Topa ang kuon hi; leitung in a tunga sisan a luongsahte pholah ding a, a thasa mite zong selcip nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khumi ni ciengin Topa in a hiem mama, a gol mama le a hat mama namsau tawh, Leviathan gulpi tailai le a kikuolviel gulpi dan pie ding a, tuale ama in tuipi sunga om gulhiempi that ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khumi ni ciengin: A deihuoi lengga lo thu la-in sa un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima, Topa khu tua lo a cing pa ka hi hi; keima in a hun hunin tui ka buoh hi. Koima in a suhsiet lo nadingin sun le zanin ka ngai zing hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in lungthahna ka nei sih hi. Tua sungah ling le khaute a op leh a sattan dingin ka kuon ding hi. Keima in ka haltum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi sihle a kidal nadingun kei ei pom uh hinlen, keima tawh kilemna bawl uheh, keima tawh kilemna bawl uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ang tung ding hunah Jacob ang zung hla ding a, Israel zong dawn suongin ang pallun ding a, a ga in leitung zosie ang dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in ama a satte a satkia bangin ama in amate a sat sam amah? Ahi sihle amate a thatte a kitha bangin amate zong a kithat sam amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hawlkhietna, sal tansahna tawh, nang in amate do ding na hanciem hi; nisuona huipi a lan ni ciengin ama in hui hat tawh amate a tawmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ziehin tam tawh Jacob’ khielna kimaisah ding a, tuale tam pen a mawna kilahmangna ga bukim hi ding hi: Ama in suong tawh a kibawl maitam suongte suongkang kisatvui a bahsah ciengin, khuom siengthote, ahi sihle gimnamtui maitamte a dinglai om nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen kul tawh ki-im khuopi a guohtangin a om ta a, a kitaisan le a kinuasie mite’ tenna gamlah a bang ta hi; khumnah bawngnote gamta-in lum a, khumnah amate in singbate a kheuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A bate a gaw ciengin, tuate a tawngsan sieng hi; numeite pei-in mei-a taw dingin sing a tom uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile tam mite pen theitelna nei lo mite ahi uhi; tua ahi ziehin amate a bawl pa in a tung vuah lainatna nei lo ding a, amate a siempa in amate angvan lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel mite aw, tua ni ciengin Topa in Euphrates tuilam panin Egypt Lui dongin note ang zoi ding a, tuale ama in khat khatin ang kaikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ni ciengin pengkul golpi khat kimut ding a, Assyria gama a mangthaite le Egypt gama a kinotmang mite pei-in Jerusalem muol siengtho tungah Topa a bie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim-a zukhamte’ kisahtheipi paakuol le antui ne-in a gil buol le zu in a zawgawpte’ lutunga kikhusah ahi a vul thei, a vanglien, le a etlawm paape in gimna a thuoh ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En un, Topa in a vanglien a thahat pa khat nei hi; huipi gielpi le a mutsie thei huipi bang le, a thahat huipi le a let valuh tuikhang bangin, ama in a khut tawh lei lahah amate a sawnpua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keng tawh kituoncil ding pen khu Ephraim zukhamte’ kisahtheipi paakuol hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Antui ne-in a gil buol mite’ lutunga kikhusah a vanglien a etlawm, le a vulthei paape pen khallai masanga a min masapen theiga tawh kibang ding a, khatpo in a mu behin loin, a nehtum pai tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuami ni ciengin Vanglien Topa pen a vanglien paakuol hi ding a, a omlai ama’ mite adingin a etlawm kumpi lukhu hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />thukhenna-a a to mite tungah thutang lungsim guon ding a, kulpi tunkotah gal a notdawhte dingin thahatna hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam mite zong zu khamin a kilialawm vua, khamtheizu tawh a hawipua valuoi uhi; siempute le kamsangte zong khamtheizu tawh a kilawmlia uhi, tuale zu khamin amate a amtawng vua, khamtheizu tawh amate hawipua valuoi uhi; amate in a man lo mangmuna a mu vua, a thukhen dingte in zong thu a khen thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sabuoi tung zosie luoh tawh kidim a, mun siengtho kici zong a om ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ama in koi pen khu theina hil ding a, koi tungah thu hilcien ding ahei? Kang sung pana a kiladawh, nawi tawh a kikhente tungah amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thukham tungah thukham, thukham tungah thukham, a guol tungah a guol, a guol tungah a guol, tanah halkhat, khunah halkhat,” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A mantahin, ama in a telha mama kamham le namdangte’ ham tawh tam mite hopi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama in a kung vuah, “Tam pen tawlngahna ahi hi; a gimte tawlngasah un; tami lungnopna ahi hi,” ci hi; hizongle amate in a ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ziehin amate pei-in a thalpua nading ule amate liemin thangah awh a, sala a kikai nadingun, amate tungah Topa kammal, “Thukham tungah thukham, thukham tungah thukham, a guol tungah a guol, a guol tungah a guol, tanah halkhat, khunah halkhat,” ci danin a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin no mi simmawte aw, Jerusalem-a tam mite tunga a uhte aw, Topa’ thu za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen note in, “Sina tawh thuciem khat i bawl zo ta vua, Misikhuo tawh thukimna khat i nei zo ta uhi; sietna tuihuol in ei nawkhah ciengin ei ban loding hi; azieh pen eite in i bel dingin zuouthu i bawl vua, zuouna le nalna sungah i kibu uhi,” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin, Topa Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi, “En un, keima in Zion ah a kize-etsa innbul suong, innbul suong kiptah le a manpha innkiu suong khat ka phut hi: “Ama a muong mi poma a zau sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale keima in thutang pen tena pikhau le thudih pen tena suongkhai bangin ka bawl ding hi; gielpi in zuou kibuhna sempal ding a, tuite in tua kibuhna a hlummang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin sina tawh kibawl na thuciemna uh kiphel ding a, Misikhuo tawh na bawl uh thukimna uh kip lo ding hi; sietna tuihuol in ang nawh ciengin tua in note ang dengguoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note ang nawh khah sielin ang ban ding hi; azieh pen zingmawng khat zaw zingmawng khat, a sun a zanin note ang nawh kha ding hi; tuale thupieng puoh theina in patauna bihbeh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keng hluon nadingin lupna tom luo a, kihui nadingin zong puonzal neu seng luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama’ silbawl-a lamdang a silbawl! ama’ nasep-a tuompien a nasep! a sem dingin, Perazim Muol tunga a sep bangin Topa kuonto ding a, Gibeon kuom-a a thangpai bangin ang thangpai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in mi simmaw sih un, tua ahi sihle note ang kikhina a khauzaw-in ang kibawl ding hi; azieh pen gam buppi tunga om Vanglien Topa Pasien kung panin kisiet nading thukhenna ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngai unlen, ka aw za un; limtah ngai unlen ka thugen za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lokai pa in khaici the nadingin lo a kaikai amah? Amate in lei kalhin lo gitgit uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in lei a zeltam zaw uh ciengin, lengmusel tang vaw-in cummin tang a tu vua, mangbute a guolguolin suonin, a op nading munah mangbuham a tu uhi, tua mangbuhamte a geizui-ah tu uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen amate kilim hil mama hi; a Pasien un amate hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lengmuselte khetbuh tawh a kisat sih a, cummin tangte tungah sakol lengpei kihuol lo hi; hinanle lengmusel pen ciengkang tawh kisat a, cummin pen moltum tawh kisat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moh bawl nadingin antang kisuguoi a, ahi vangin mite in a cil zing sih uhi; tua tungah mi khat in sakol lengkang le sakol a hawl vangin a guoicim sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tami zong Vanglien Topa kung pana ang pei ahi hi; thu kuppina lamah ama lamdang a, pilna lamah guol tungtuong hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ah, Ariel, David’ phuolsatna khuopi Ariel in gimna thuoh ding hi! A kumkumin belap unlen, pawite bantai sah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanle Keima in Ariel lunggimsahin, tua munah kaana le mauna om ding a, Keima adingin Jerusalem khu Ariel tawh a kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima in David bangin kang do nadingin giephuol ka sat ding hi; keima in tausangte tawh kang im ding a, nang do nadingin kanh ka to ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin leithuh sung panin nangma in thu na gen ding a, leivui lah a ngiemna panin na thugente pusuoh ding hi. Sihla khat’ aw bangin lei panin nangma’ aw a pusuoh ding a, leivui lah panin na thugen ang dap ham ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin na gal honpite leivui nel a bang ding vua, a khansie mihonpite zong ansi leng bang ding uhi. Bakhat sung thakhatthu-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien in vanto, zilling le a ging vapuoh, pumpei le huipi le, mi a halvam thei meikuong tawh dan a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ariel sim dingin gam zosie panin mihonpite, a khuopi le ama’ mun muonhuoi a sim zosie le a lungkhamsah zosie pen mangmatna le zan lai-a mangmuna tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A gilkiel mipa in a mang ah an ne-in, a khahlaw ciengin gilkiel veve a, a mangah a dangta mipa in tui dawn a, a dangta pha tuom loin, basamin a khahlaw ma bangin, Zion Muol a sim minam honpi zosie zong tua bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No le no ki-amtum sah unlen, a amtumsa-in om un. No le no kimittaw sah unlen, a mittaw-in om un! Zu dawn lopi-in zukham unlen, zucia dawn lopi-in hawilen un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in note tungah kimut duna hlagau a buosuh a, ama in no kamsangte’ mit ang sinpieh a, ama in no thumute’ lutang ang khumangpieh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Note adingin tam teng zosie pen mangmuna sunga a kizielcip laibu sunga thu om tawh kibang ahi hi. Lai a sim theite kungah, “Tami lai sim un,” ci-a a kipieh ciengin amate in, “A kizielcip ziehin ka sim thei sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale lai a sim thei lote kungah, “Tami lai sim un,” ci-a a kipieh ciengin amate in, “Ka sim thei sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in a gen hi: “Tam mite in a kam utawh keima kung ei nai vua, a nephu beh utawh keima ei patawi uhi, hizongle a lungtang uh pen keima tawh a kigamla hi. Keima ei biehna uzong mihing’ thupieh a zuina uh ahi lel bo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaci’n keima in tam mite tawh a lamdang nate le a cizathuoi le a lamdang nate ka bawlkia ding hi. A mipilte uh’ pilna kisie ding a, thu khinkhai theite’ thu khinkhaina kiselcip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa thei lo dinga gelna thuhpi a selcip, khuomiel sunga a gamta, “Koi ahei ei mu ding? Koi ahiei ei thei ding?” a ci note in gimna na thuoh ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note in nate lumlet sieng ta uteh! Belkheng pa khu tungman bangin a kingaisun ding amah? A kibawlsa na in a bawlpa kungah, “Ama in ei bawl sih,” ci-in, ahi sihle a kisiemsa na in a siempa kungah, “Ama in theitelna nei sih,” a ci ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lebanon muol pen leihoi mun suohsahin, leihoi mun gampalah a suo nading bakhat sung beh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum ni ciengin bilbingte in laibu kiziel sunga thute a za ding vua, lungzinna le khuomiel sung panin mittawte’ mit in khuo mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi neilutte in Topa sungah a tha lungdam kipahna nga ding a, a tasam pente in zong Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa sungah lungdamin a kipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi khansiete mangthai ding a, mi simmawte, sietna bawl ding a ngahlate om nawn lo ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />thukhenna zuma mi thu lelsah, khuopi tutkota thukhenpa a thangsie, thu omlo pi-a midihpa tungah a tanga thu khen nuom lote, kisumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ziehin Abraham a hunpa Topa in Jacob’ innkuon tawh kisai tam bangin a gen hi: “Jacob maizum nawn loin a mai zong kangdang nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate lahah ka khutsuoh ahi a tate a mu ciengun ka min a siengthosah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hlagau lama a khiel mite in theitelna a nei ding vua, a phunsie mite in thuhilna a sang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A ledo tate in gimna a thuoh ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Amate in keima-a’ hi lopi-in gelna a nei vua, amate in keima’ deina om lopi-in kipawlna bawlin mawna bawl bebe uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />amate in thu ei kuppi lopi-in, Egypt ah a peisuh vua, Pharaoh’ humbihna sung belin, Egypt hlim nei-ah buhna a sui uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua ziehin Pharaoh’ humbihna pen na maizumna uh hi ding a, Egypt’ liena sunga na buhna uh pen na maidaina uh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen ama’ uliente Zoan khuo-ah a om vua, ama’ palaite in Hanes khuo a vaphah vangun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amate a phatuomsah zo lo mite tungtawnin, mi zosie tungah maizumna tung a, huna le phattuomna ahi lo maizumna le zakona a nga ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Negeb ganhingte tawh kisai thu phuon. Amate in humpi a nu le a hawh humpi a pa, muoltan le gulpi lengtheite a opna, buoina le lungkhamna nawhin, a haunate uh laa tungah, a goute uh kalaoh tungah puo-in, amate phattuomna a pie thei lo mite tungah a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Egypt’ panpina pen bangma man lo a hawmpi ahi a, tua ahi ziehin ama, “Pia loin a to hit hiet Rahab,” ci-in a min ka phuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in pei-in ang tung ding hunte-ah khantawn teci dingin a mai vua suongpeh tungah giel inlen, laibu khat sungah khum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen amate a ledo mite, upna a nei lo mite, Topa’ thuhilna a ngai nuom lote ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate in thumute kungah, “Mu sih un,” a ci uhi; kamsangte kungah, “Thuphuon a man ei gen sih un; thunuom lam le kisolna mangmuna po ei genzaw un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />lampi nuasie unlen, lamzin panin piel un. Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa’ thu ei zasah nawn sih un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ziehin Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa in a gen hi: Azieh pen note in tam thu na nuol vua, bawlsietna le kisolna suongin tuate na muong uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin tami mawna pen note adingin a kihiel kulsangpi khat lawtkhe-in a cim dihtah, thakhat thu-a a kiesuh ding tawh kibang ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua a cipna pen a kitawkeh beelkheng pa’ beel tawh kibang ding a, nahpi tahin a kisuhguoi ziehin a themnengte lahah meikhuh-a mei lah nading hile, tuikhuh sunga tui saw nading hile, a themkeh khat zong a kimu lo tawh kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa, Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: Note kinuale-in tawlngahna tawh hutdamna na nga ding uhi; sip dide-a opna le muonna khu na thahatna uh ahi ding hi. Ahi vangin note na nuom sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hilo e! sakol tung tuongin i tai ding hi,” na ci vua, tua ahi ziehin na taimang ding uhi! Tuale, “Sakol taihatte tungah i tuong ding hi,” na ci vua, tua ahi ziehin no ang delte in mallang tahin ang nuadel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Muolvuma dielkhuom kiphut le muol tunga lim kikhai bangin, ang kinuasie masangin mi khat’ galgihna tawh mi tulkhat tai ding a, mi nga’ galgihna tawh note na gamtai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ziehin keima in note hing hepi nuomin Topa in note ang ngah hi; tua ahi ziehin note tungah hepina a lah dingin a dingto ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa pen a thutang Pasien ahi hi; ama a ngah mi zosie thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman tahin, Jerusalem-a teng Zion mite aw, note na kap nawn sih ding uhi. Na kaana aw ziehun ama in note ang hepi tahtah ding hi; ama in a zah ciengin note ang dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in note tungah hahsatna an le gentheina tui hing pie nanle na Siepa uh kiphuol nawn lo ding a, na mit un na Siepa uh a mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ziet lama na kihei cieng uh hile, vei lama na kihei cieng uh hile, na nua panin na bil un, “Tami lampi ahi hi, tami zui un,” a ci a za ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin note in ngun tawh a kizut na milimte ule kham tawh a kizem na milim sunte uh na buasah ding uhi. Tua teng pen a nieh puonsiete bangin kithezah ding hi; note in amate kungah, “Peimang dawh un,” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in lei-a na tu uh khaici adingin guo ang zusah ding a, lei-a pieng ante zong hoi-in pung ding hi. Khum ni ciengin na ganhingte un ganhing hlana mun zapi-ah lopa a mai ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />lokai bawngtangte le laate in kawbia le kangkui tawh a kisawhalsa lopa hing a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi tampi a kitha ni, galvilna tausangte a cip ni ciengin, muol sang cinteng tung le muoltang cinteng tungah luitui a luong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tham loin, Topa in a mite’ liemnate tuompieh a, a satna liemmate a damsah ni ciengin, hlatang pen nitang bang ding a, nitang pen ni sagi sunga tangza bangin a za sagi-in tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />En un, a gamla panin Topa’ min ang pei hi. Ama’ lungthahna mei kuong a, tua meikhu kitung valuh hi; a kamte uh lunghanna tawh kidim a, a leite uh mi val thei meikuong tawh kibang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ama pen husan ngawng cieng a pha luitui let tawh kibang hi. ama in lawpi tawh minamte’ kisietna zoih a, mite’ khagu tungah amate lam a pielsah thei kamkai a vaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Note in pawi siengtho kikham ni zan-a bangin la sa-in theile na tum ding uhi; tuale Israel-te’ Suongpi, Topa’ muol lamah a kuonkhiete bangin na lungdam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale Topa in sinsona le mi a kavam thei meikuong sung panin vanging, huipi, le gielpi tawh, a minthanna aw kizasah ding a, a khut a vihsuhna zong kimusah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in a ciengkhut tawh a sat ciengin Topa’ awging ziehin Assyria-te zau mama ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuale Topa in ama tunga a tuhsah moltum tawh a satna zosie tawmneute le lyre gingte tawh kibang ding hi; ama in a khut vihin amate a do ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azieh pen hun sawtpi lai panin mei tawh a kihal nading mun khat bawlsa-in om zo hi; a tahtahin tua pen kumpipa dinga a baisa-a kibawl hi a, a kihalna zong thuhpitah le a kam a golin kibawl a, mei le sing zong kicing tahin om hi; kat tui luong bangin Topa’ husa in tua mei a tawkuong hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huna ngen dinga Egypt ah a peisuhte, sakolte suong a, sakol leeng a tam zieh le sakol tunga tuongte a hat ziehun tuate muongin, Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa a suong lo, Topa thu a dong lote in gimna a thuoh ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanle ama pilin gimna a tungsah hi; a gensa thute dawhkia loin, sietna a bawl innkuonte le khielna a bawl mite a panpite a do dingin amau’ langkhatah ama a ding ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Egypt-te mihing ahi bo a, Pasien ahi sih uhi; a sakolte uh zong tahsa ahi a, hlagau ahi sih hi. Topa in a khut a zah ciengin a panpi pa kipalpua-in a kihu pa zong pua ding a, amate zosie a siton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in keima kungah tam bangin a gen hi: Humpi ahi sihle humpi khanglai in a sa neh ding a ngih lai tahin, humpi a sim dingin tuucing honkhat a kihlat ciengin, amau’ kikona ziehin zau tuom loin amau’ husa a awlmaw lo bangin, Vanglien Topa zong Zion Muol le muoltangte tungah gal sim dingin a kuonsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A bu tunga a leng vate bangin, Vanglien Topa in Jerusalem a humbih ding hi; ama in humbihin hlakhie ding a, zong hinkhawi-in hunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mite aw, note in nahpi taha na leheh pa uh kungah kilekia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile khum ni ciengin, note in noma dinga na khut vua na bawlsa uh, note ang mawsah na ngun milimte ule na kham milimte uh na paimang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tua ciengin mihing’ namsau ahi lo, namsau khat tawh a Assyria-te pua ding uhi; tuale mihing’ namsau ahi lo namsau khat in amate a valtum ding hi; namsau panin ama taimang ding a, tuale a tangvalte thona-aana kisemsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zau ziehin suongpi mangthai ding a, a uliente zong a zau ziehun a dielkhai a taisan ding uhi,” a meikuong Zion-a om, tuale a meikhuh Jerusalem-a om Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En un, dihna tawh kumpi khat maang ding a, tuale uliente in zong thutang tawh uh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate pen huipi pana kibuhna le khuopi hui pana kiselna ahi ding vua, amate pen gam gawta muna a luong luitui a bang ding vua, a tul gam sunga a om suongpi’ hlim bang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuo mu thei mite’ mit kisiing lo ding a, khuoza theite’ bil in thu a ngai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thoptat mite’ lungsim in thu a khinkhai thei ding vua, ham-awhte ahi uleh baitah le kicien tahin a ham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mimawte mi thupi kici nawn lo ding a, migilote mi zatah huoi kici nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien zatah lona a kisin ding le Topa tawh kisai khielna thu a gen ding, a gilkielte’ an duna pha nai lopi-a a kinuasie nading le, a dangtate in dawn ding tui a nei lo nadingin, amate in mimawte in motna thu a gen vua, a lungsim un khielna bawl ding sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Migilote’ gitlona a siehuoi mama hi; zuouna kam tawh mizawngte suhsiet nading le mi tasamte in thuman a gen cieng nangawnun a siesah dingin amate in sil hoi lo bawl a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle mi thupite in na thupite a gel vua, tua na thupite-ah amate a dingkip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No nuomtaha om numeite aw, tho unlen, ka aw za un; noma’ tumtaha a lungkim tanute aw, ka thugen ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Noma’ tumtaha a lungkim numeite aw, kum khat a val zep zaw ciengin na citun ding uhi; azieh pen lengga ang ga lo ding a, singga law hun ang tung lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No nuom taha a om numeite aw, ci tun un, noma’ tumtaha a lungkim numeite aw, linglawng un; na puon uh sutin guohtangin om unlen, na kawng vuah la-ip puon teng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A deihuoi lote le lenggui ga hoite ziehin na awm uh beng un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />azieh pen ka mite’ leitangah ling le khaute po sieng zo hi; hi hi, kipahna khuopi le lungdamna inn zosie dim siengzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen kumpi inn kinuasie-in, mi tampi tenna khuopi kilawi ding hi; muol le galvilna tausangte lei kawhawm suoh den ding a, gam-laate gamtatna le tuuhonte an maina mun suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A sangna panin eite tungah hlagau ang kibuoh masang, senel gam, logam hoi a suo masang le logam hoite gammang banga a kiciemte masangin tua bangin a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin gammang lahah thutang a om ding a, leihoi lote-ah thumanna a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dihna ziehin nopna om ding a, dihna ziehin daina le muonna om den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kilem taha tenna mun, hlamuong taha opna mun le, dai taha khawlna munah ka mite a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gammang tulah mangthai kiukeu ding a, lei-ah khuopi lien matcipsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Luipang cinteng ah khaici vaw-in bawngtangte le laate a nop nopna-a a tasah note pen mi nuomsa na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ang kisusie nai lo, mi a susie pa aw; koima’ lebawl ngai nai lo, mi lebawl pa aw, gimna na thuoh ding hi! Suhsiet ding na khawl ciengin nangma ang kisusie ding hi; tuale na lebawl nawn lo ciengin nang ang kilebawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa aw, kote ei hepi in; nang kang lamen uhi. Zingmawng sielin ka baantha-un hing pang inlen, ka lungkham hun ciengun ka kihutdamna uh hing hi ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihonpi husa ziehin mite taimang hi; na thupina mai-ah minamte kithezah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungpuh in na a khop bangin galvanlahte kikhawm hi; kauphenote a kitom bangin a tungah amate a kitom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa kitawisang a, a sangna munah ama a teng hi; ama in thutang le thudih tawh Zion kidimsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />na khan sungin ama khu dinkipna, hutdamna, pilna le theina hi ding a, Topa giinna khu Zion’ gou ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai un! lamdungah galhangte a kiko uhi; kilemna palai semte nahpi tahin a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lam lienpite zui loin om a, khuolzinte zin nawn lo hi. Thukimnate kisusie-in, kiciemnate kithusim lo a, mawpuohnate zong khawh kisa ta lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamsung zong kapin a thanem hi; Lebanon buoi-in a vulgawp hi; Sharon, senel gam tawh kibang hi; Bashan le Carmel muol in a singte a thing dawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tu-in ka ding ding hi,” Topa in ci hi, “Tu-in kei le kei ka kidomsang ding hi; tu-in kei le kei ka kitawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ansi nau-in na paai vua, butu nau-in na suoh uhi; na husan uh pen no ang katum ding mei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite pen suongkang kihalvam le lingkung kisattan mei-a kihaltum bang hi ding hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No gamlapi-a om mite aw, ka silbawlte za un; no a nai-a omte aw, ka hatna ei theipi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion ah mawneite a zau uhi; Pasien thei lote a citun uhi: “Eite lahah koi ahiei, ei katum thei mei tawh a tengton zo ding? Eite lahah koi ahiei, kumtawn meikuong tawh a tengton zo zing ding?” a ci uhi. Eite lahah koi ahiei, kumtawn meikuong tawh a teng zing zo ding?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dihtah le mantaha kalsuon, le thu a gen, bawlsietna tawh a kinga vante te thusim loin, guhgol sang nuom lo a, a khut a thing vazawh mite, sisansuona thu za nuom loin a bil a humte le, gitlona en nuom loin a mit a siingte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a sangna-ah a teng ding uhi; a kibuhna uh pen suong kulpite hi ding hi; a neh ding uh an kisih ding a, a dawn ding uh tui kitasam lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na mit un kumpipa’ hoina na mu ding uhi; zaipi taha kipha gam zong na gal-et ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na lungsim un patauna thu a ngaisun ding hi: “Mi phaza a simpa hei-ah om ahei? Sieh kikhonte a te mipa hei-ah om ahei? galvilna tausang a sim pa hei-ah om ahei? na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note in a ham na theithei lo uh, a kitel lo kamham a zang, na thei lo uh kam a ham bielbuol mi kihisahte na mu nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I pawi bawlna uh khuopi Zion en vawi un! Daitaha a tenna mun, puonbuh a kikhin lona, a khetphimte a kidaw ngai nawn lona, a kaina khauhuol a kitan lona, Jerusalem khuopi khu na mit un a mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanle tuatah ah vanglien Topa’ thupina khu eihaw-a’ hi ding a, gun golpite le luitate luonna mun ahi ding hi. Tua tuite tungah ei do gal gunkuong kihot nawn loin, gal tembawte zong a pei thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen eite thu ei khen pa Topa ahi a, eite uhpa zong hi hi. Topa pen eite’ kumpipa ahi hi; ama in eite ei hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na tembaw khina khaute kol hi; tua in gunkuong puon khuom tukip zo lo a, gunkuong puon kizah thei lo hi. Tua ciengin neh ding le gal vanlah tampite kihawm ding hi; khelbaite nangawn in van a nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua khuo sunga tengte in, “Kei ka ci na,” a ci sih ding uhi; tua sunga teng mite’ khielna kimaisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minamte aw, thu za dingin ei nai un; no mite aw, ngai un! Leitung le a sunga om zosie, lei pumpi le a sunga pieng zosie in za ta uheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen minam zosie langkhatah Topa lungthah a, a mihonpite’ langkhatah ama a lung a hang hi; ama in a mangthai dingin amate koi-in, amate tha dingin a pie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kithat a mite uh kipaimang ding a, a siluongte zong uito valuh ding hi; muoltungte ah amau’ sisan a luong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vantunga om zosie muotmang ding a, laiziel bangin vantungte kiziel ding hi. Lenggui tunga a nate a vul bang le theikung tunga a ga a vul bangin, vantung na zosie vul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka namsau in vantungte ah a khamtahin a dawn zo a, en un, Edom-te tung le suhmang dinga ka sesa mite tungah thukhen dingin ang kumsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in namsau khat nei hi; tua khu sisan kinoinat hi a, tuuno si le kel si, tuutangte’ a kal thau tawh kizutzol hi. Azieh pen Topa in Bozrah ah biehpiehna khat nei a, Edom gam sungah kithana lienpi om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate tawh gam bawngtangte puaton ding a, bawngtangno gesate le bawngtang hatte a puaton ding uhi. A gamsung uh sisan tawh kipawi-in sathau in a leitang uh a zolsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in phulah nading ni khat, Zion’ vai-ah a dihna a pholah nading kum khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Edom lui tuite tanai suoh ding a, ama’ leitang kat a suoh ding hi; a gam uzong a kuong vapuoh tanai a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua pen sun le zanin mit lo ding a, a khu kato zing ding hi. Khang khat pan khang khat, tenna giena-in kinei nawn lo ding hi; kumtawnin koima in nawh ngai nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle mupi le saku in tua gam a luo ding uhi; tua sungah simbu le va-ahte a teng ding uhi. Ama in tua tungah kitawhnawina khau hlung ding a, a uliente tungah buoina suongkhai hlung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in khum gam pen Kumpi om lo Gam, ci-in minvaw ding a, a uliente zosie zong a mawhna ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mun muonhuoite tungah lingkung po ding a, a kulte uh sungah lahkhai le lingkungte a po ding hi. Si-alte tuolbuolna mun le va-kalaohte tenna mun hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sanga le ngiete a kigop ding vua, keldawite khatlekhat kihlan ding uhi; tuanah Thadamte kumsuhin tawlngahna mun khat mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simbu in tua munah bu bawlin, tuale a tui tha-in nokeu ding a, a hlim nei-ah a note a huoi ding hi; tua sungah mute zong kikhawmin, a nupa cietin a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa laibu pan sui unlen sim un: Tuate lahah khat zong a kimansuo sih ding hi; amate lawm nei lo koima a om sih ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in a kam tawh thupie zo a, ama’ hlagau in amate a khawmzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in amate ai sanpieh a, a khut in tena khau tawh leitang hawmpieh hi; amate in kumtawnin tua leitang tang ding a, amate in khang khat panin khang khat dongin tua sungah teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gamdai le gamgawta kipah ding a, senel gam lungdamin pallun ding hi; muoldum pa bangin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tampi tahin pallun ding a, tuale lungdam kipahin la sa ding hi. Lebanon’ minthanna, Carmel le Sharon muol’ a thupina tua tungah kipie ding hi. Amate in Topa’ vanglietna, eite’ Pasien’ thupina a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khut hatlote khausah unlen, khup zawte kipsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungsim meipuote kungah, “Thakhau unlen, zau sih un! Tanah na Pasien uh a om hi. Phulahna le a zauhuoi danpiehna tawh ama ang pei ding hi. Ama hing pei-in note ang hundam ding hi,” ci un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin mittawte in khuo mu-in, bilbingte in khuo a za ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua ciengin khelbaite sakhi bangin tawn dien ding a, a ham theilo mite in kipahin la sa ding uhi. Azieh pen gamlah ah tui ang pul ding a, senel gam sungah luitui ang luong ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a sa mama senelte buoltui suoh ding a, leigaw lahah tuisam ang pul ding hi; si-alte tatna mun nawnglah suoh ding a, hampate, pumpeng le gulphit a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khumnah lamlienpi om ding a, tua pen Lamlien Siengtho kici ding hi; a sieng lote in tua lampi zawt lo ding a, ahi vangin tua khu Pasien’ mite ading ahi hi; tua lampi-ah khuolzinte, mimawte nangawn a gammang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua munah humpi om lo ding a, sasielne gamsa gilkiel khat beh pei lo ding hi. Hizongle tatsa mite khum munah ang pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa’ tatsa mite kilekia-in, lasa kawmin Zion a zuon ding vua, amau’ lutungah kumtawn kipahna a om ding hi. Amate in kipahna le nopna a nga ding vua, dana le khuisahna a veng ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Hezekiah a uh kum sawm le kum li a cin kumin Assyria kumpipa Sennacherib in Judah gam sunga a om khuopi kulpi nei zosie sim dingin kuonto-in a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Assyria kumpipa in Lachish khuo panin Jerusalem khuo-a kumpi Hezekiah kungah galkap honpi tawh Rabshakeh a sawl hi. Puonsawppa’ Lo zotna lam lienpi buol tungnung tuilahna gei-ah ama a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale ama tawh kimu dingin Hilkiah’ tapa kumpi innsung vaipuo pa Eliakim, thuvanpi pa Shebna, le Asaph’ tapa thuciemte pa Joah a pusuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rabshakeh in amate kungah, “Hezekiah kungah tam bangin gen un: Kumpi lien Assyria kumpipa in tam bangin ci hi: Tami na kimuonna uh bang bulphu na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kamham maimaite po galdo nadinga vaihawmna le thahatna dan a na ngaisut amah? Tu-in kei nei ledo nadingun koi pen muong na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />En un, ama tunga a kingam mi khatpo’ khut a sun ding, pumpeng ciengkhut tawngsansa tawh a kibang ahi Egypt muong na hi lel bo uhi. Ama a muongte tungah Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh tua bang ahi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle note in keima kungah, “ Topa ka Pasien uh muong ka hi uhi,” a ci na hi uleh Hezekiah in a munsangte le a maitamte phelpiehin Judah le Jerusalem kungah, “Tam maitam mai-ah na bie ding uhi,” a ci pa hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in hing pei unlen ka pupa Assyria kumpipa tawh kikhapna khat bawl un: No lam panin a tunga tuong ding mi na mu ngap po uleh sakol tulni kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt-te’ leengte le sakol galkapte muonna tawh ka pu’ nasemte a neupen lahah galkapmang khat nangawn bangci nan zo ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tham loin tami gam a susie ding le a do dingin Topa lo tawh ang kuonto ka hi amah? Topa in keima kungah, “Tami gam sim dingin kuonto inlen susie in,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Eliakim, Shebna, le Joah in Rabshakeh kungah, “Kote in tel thei sam ka hi ziehun na nasemte Aram ham tawh ei hopi in; kulpi tunga om mite’ zahna-ah Judah ham tawh nei hopi lo nadingin kang thum hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Rabshakeh in, “Ka pupa in tami thu pen na pupa ule note kung beha gen dinga ei sawl ahi sih a, a eh uh ne a, a zun uh dawnin note tawh a mangthaitha ding ahi kulpi tunga a to mite kunga gen dinga ei sawl hizaw lo amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rabshakeh dingto-in Judah hamin nahpi tahin tangtawh a, “A lien mama kumpi, Assyria kumpipa’ thugente ngai un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa in tam bangci hi: ‘Hezekiah kisolsah sih un, azieh pen ama in note ang hunkhie zo vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in ei hunkhie valon ding a, Assyria kumpipa’ khut sungah tami khuo kipie lo ding hi,’ ci-in Hezekiah in a gen ziehin na Topa uh muong kha sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hezekiah’ thu ngai sih un; bangzieh ahei cile Assyria kumpipa in tam bangci hi: ‘Keima tawh kilemna hing bawl unlen ka kungah hing pei un, tua ciengin a koima po in amau’ lenggui, amau’ theikung ciet panin ne-in amau’ tuikhuh ciet panin a dawn ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />keima hing pei-in, noma’ gam banga an le lenggazu a opna gam, moh le lengga huon a opna gamah kang peipi masangin a tua ci phot ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in eite ei hundam ding hi, ci-a Hezekiah’ ang genna po tawh ama kipuikhiel sah sih un. Minamte’ pasien-te khatpo in Assyria kumpipa’ khut sung panin a gam uh a hunkhie zo ngai mal amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hamath le Arpad-te’ pasien-te hei-a om ahi ta uh ahei? Sepharvaim gam pasien-te hei-ah a om vuoi? Amate in ka khut sung panin Samaria gam a hunkhie ta uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in keima’ khut sung panin Jerusalem a hutdam thei nadingin, tami gamte-a om pasien-te zosie lahah a koi pen in ka khut sung panin a gam uh hunkhie zo ding ahei?’ ci hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa in, “Ama dawng sih un,” ci-in thupie ahi ziehin a sip dide vua, kam khat beh a dawng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hilkiah’ tapa, kumpi innsung vaipuo pa Eliakim, thuvanpi pa Shebna le Asaph’ tapa, thuciemte pa Joah in a puon uh balkehin Hezekiah kungah a haw vua, Rabshakeh’ thugen teng kumpipa kungah a genkia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Hezekiah in tam thu a zah bepin a puonsil botkeh a, la-ip puon silin Topa’ inn sungah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale ama in kumpi innsung vaipuo pa Eliakim, thuvanpi pa Shebna, le siempu khangham teng la-ip puon a kikhu kawmun Amoz’ tapa kamsangpa Isaiah kungah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in ama kungah, “Hezekiah in, ‘Tuni pen lungdon ni, kihosiet ni, le mindai ni ahi hi; nausuo hun tung napi a suo zawh nading tha a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hing Pasien zako dinga a pupa Assyria kumpipa in a sawl Rabshakeh’ thugen teng, Topa na Pasien un za zo kha ta ding a, tuale a zah thute ziehin Topa na Pasien un a hosie ding hi; tua ahi ziehin a kinuasie a omlaite adingin na thungetna uh sang khan un,’ ci hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isaiah kungah Kumpi Hezekiah’ nasemte a tun ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isaiah in amate kungah, “Na pupa uh kungah, ‘ Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Assyria kumpipa’ nasemte in kei ei gensietna na zah uh thute ziehin zau sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in kam baleng khat za-in a gamah a kilekia nadingin ama sungah hlagau khat ka koi ding hi; keima in a gam sungah namsau tawh ama ka puasah ding hi,’ ci-in gen un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rabshakeh kinuale a, tuale Assyria kumpipa in Libnah a sim a mu hi; azieh pen kumpipa in Lachish khuo nuasie zo ci thu ama in za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu-in Ethiopia Kumpi Tirhakah tungtang thu kumpipa in za a, “Nang ang do dingin ama ang kuon hi,” a ci hi. Ama in tua thu a zah ciengin Hezekiah kungah kamtaite sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Judah Kumpi Hezekiah kungah tam bangin na gen ding uhi: Assyria kumpipa’ khut sungah Jerusalem kipie lo ding hi, ci-a ang kamciemna tawh na kingahna Pasien kisolsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En in, Assyria kumpite in gam zosie susie siengin amate tunga a silbawl teng uh na za zo hi. Nang ang kihunkhie tuom ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate un a na suhmaimang uh ahi minamte, Gozan, Haran, Rezeph, le Telassar-a om Eden mite’ pasien-te in a hunkhie zo ngai uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath kumpipa, Arpad kumpipa, Sepharvaim khuopi kumpipa, Hena kumpipa ahi sihle Ivvah kumpipate hei-a om sieng uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah in kamtaite khut tung panin tua laihlah sangin a sim hi; tua ciengin Topa’ biehinn sungah Hezekiah kato a, tuale ama in Topa mai-ah tua lai kihlah a zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale Topa kungah Hezekiah in thungen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Vanglien Topa , Israel-te’ Pasien, Cherub-te tunga a to pa aw, leitung gam zosie tungah nangma beh Pasien na hi a, nang in vantung le leitung na siem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa aw, na bil ei ngat inlen ei za in; Topa aw, na mit hah inlen ei mu in; Sennacherib in a hing Pasien a zakona, ang hlah thute zosie za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tahtahin Topa aw, Assyria kumpite in minam zosie le a gam uh a susie sieng vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuale a pasien-te uh mei sungah a paimang uhi. Tuate pasien-te ahi sih a, mihing khut tawh a kisiem singlesuongte ahi bo hi, tua ziehin tuate suhsietin a om ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa kote’ Pasien aw, nang beh Topa na hina thu leitung kumpi gam zosie in a thei nadingin tu-in ama’ khut sung panin kote ei hundam in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Amoz’ tapa Isaiah kungah mi sawl a, “Israel-te’ Pasien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: “Nang in kei kungah Assyria Kumpipa Sennacherib tawh kisai thu nang gen zo tah ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ama’ tungtang Topa’ thugen tam bang ahi hi: ‘Zion’ tanu ngahnu siengtho nu in nang ang simmaw a, ang zako hi; Jerusalem’ tanu in na nua sangah a lu ang peisan lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Nang in koi zako-in koi simmaw na hi ahei? Koi langah na aw sangsahin, kiliensahin na mit lehto na hei? Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa langah amah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nang in nasemte zangin Topa na zako zo ta a, “Ka leeng tampite tawh muolsang dawn tengah ka kato zo a, Lebanon muoldawn kui dongah ka kato zo ta hi; tamtaah sing a sang pente, taasing hoipente ka phua zo hi. A sangpen mun, gammang pen zong ka tung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima int tuikhuh to-in tui ka dawn a, Ka ketaw tawh Egypt luitui zosie ka kangsah hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Tua khu tanglai peh panin ka kipsahsa ahi lam na zakha sih amah? Khuopi kulpi neite susie-in buathahlom na suosah nadingin tu-a ka tunsah thute tangmaleh lai pana ka gelsa ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a sunga tengte thahat loin lungkia-in a zala uhi; amate pen lolai-a om hampa kehte, lopa ngehte le innkhum zanga a po, a khan masanga a gawta lopate tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘Na dintona le na tosuhna, na pusuo na sungtumna le ka tunga na thangpainate ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kei tunga na lungthah zieh le na uongtatna thu ka bilin ka zah ziehin, na nahkuo ah siakawi hing bulin, na kamah kamkai hing vaw-in, nang kuonna lampi ma-ah kang kilesahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tuale note adingin tam khu lim ang hi ding hi: Tu kumin anli pote ne unlen, khuovei ciengin tua anlite ma ne un; a kum thumna ciengin khai tu-in an la unlen, lenggui suonin a ga ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judah innkuonte lahah a suohta a omlai teng in lei-ah a huite hlasuh ding a, a tung lamah a ga a om ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />azieh pen Jerusalem panin a omlai teng, Zion Muol panin a suohta sun teng peidawh ding uhi. Vanglien Topa’ deiluotna in tami ang bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Tua ahi ziehin Assyria kumpipa tawh kisai Topa in tam bangci hi: Tam khuopi sungah ama ang lut lo ding a, khum munah thaltang zong kap lo ding hi. Tuami mai-ah lum tawh ang pei lo ding a, gal nanna ding leicien zong ang bawl sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ang kuonna lampi-ah ama kilekia ding hi; tami khuopi sung ang lut sih ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Azieh pen keima le ka nasempa David ka khuolna-in tami khuopi a suotah nadingin ka hung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ vantungmi kuonin Assyria-te’ giephuol ah mihing tul za le sawmgiet le tulnga that hi; zingmawng khuovah ciengin amate a unpi-in misi luong vive na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin Assyria kumpipa Sennacherib pei a, innlam zuonin Nineveh ah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama in a pasien Nisroch’ inn ah bie-in a op laitahin, ama’ tate ahi Adrammelech le Sharezer in namsau tawh ama thatin Ararat gamah a taimang uhi. A tapa Esar-haddon in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Hezekiah a ci na-in si dihtah hi. Ama kungah Amoz’ tapa Isaiah haw a, “ Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Na innsung vai ding hawm in, azieh pen nang na si ding hi; na damkia nawn sih ding hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hezekiah in a mai kawm lam ngatin Topa kungah thu ngen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Nangma mai-ah thumaanna le lungsim zosie tawh gamta-in nangma muna-ah sil hoi ka bawl lam tu-in ei phawh in, kang thum hi, Topa aw,” a ci hi. Tuale Hezekiah nahpi tahin kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Isaiah kungah Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Pei inlen Hezekiah kungah gen in, na pu David’ Pasien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Na thungetna ka za zo a, na hlitui luongte ka mu zo hi; na hinkhuo kum sawm le kum nga kang belap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in Assyria kumpipa’ khut sung panin nangma le tami khuopi kang hunkhie ding a, tami khuopi ka humbih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ama in ang ciemsa thu Topa in ang sep nadingin tam pen Topa kung panin nangma ading lim ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En in, keima in Ahaz kumpipa’ ni-nai tungah nitum kuona a liepsuh nihlim pen kal sawm ka nuatawn sah ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ni-nai tungah a liepsa ni kal sawm a nuatawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah kumpi Hezekiah a ci na-in, a natna pan a dam zaw ciengin ama laigiel tami ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka khan kimsuh laitahin a muolliem ding ka hi ta hi; ka hun omlai teng zong khu Misikhuo tunkot zuon dinga ei kise ahi ta hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hingte’ gam sungah Topa ka mu sih ding a, leitunga teng mite lahah mihing ka en nawn sih ding hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuucingpa’ puonbuh bangin keima kung panin ka tenna kiphelmangin kikhin ta hi; siemgan pa puon ziel bangin ka hinkhuo ka ziel zo ta hi; ama in siembu panin ei attan hi; nang in sun le zanin ka hinkhuo na tawpsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />zingmawng dongin huna ngenin ka kap hi; humpi bangin ka gu ka tang zosie na tawngsansah a, sun panin zan dongin ka hinkhuo na tawpsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sielpaleng bang le vakang bangin ka hamham a, vahui bangin zong ka maumau hi. Tunglam ka et-etna lamin ka mit khamzo ta hi. Topa aw, kei ei kibawlsie hi; ka lungmuonna nangma hing hi ta’n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hizongle ken bang gen thei ding ka hei? Azieh pen ama in tua thu ei gen zo a, amama in tam thu a bawl zo hi. Ka lunggim ziehin ka kimuthei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa aw, tam bang silte ziehin mite a nungta ahi vua, tamte zosie ka hlagau hinna ahi hi. Aw, keima ei damsah inlen, ei hingsah bo in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahsatna lienpi ka thuohna khu keima hoi nading tahtah ahi hi; hinanle nang in sietna dum sung panin keima’ hinkhuo nei nuatuh hi, azieh pen nang in ka mawna zosie na nualamah nei paimangpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen Misikhuo in lungdam ang ko thei sih a, sina in zong nang ang phat thei sih hi; Hankhuh sunga a kumsuhte in na muonhuoina a lamen thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuni-a ka bawl bangin a hing mite, a hing mite beh in nangma kungah lungdam ang ko uhi; pate in a tate uh tungah nangma’ muonhuoina a theisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in keima ei hundam ding a, tuale eite in Topa’ inn sungah i hin sung tungtawnin khausai tumgingte tawh la i sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in Isaiah in, “Amate theiga lomkhat lasah inlen, a himate uh a damkia thei nadingin nupieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hezekiah in zong, “ Topa’ inn sungah ka peito nading bang lim hi ding ahei?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Baladan’ tapa Babylon kumpipa Merodach-baladan in Hezekiah a cinat le a damkiana thu a zah ziehin ama kungah laihlahte le letsongte tawh palaite a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekiah in amate na muoh a, a gou kholna inn sunga neisa zosie, ngun, kham, panamtui, sathau manpha, a galvan zah zosie, a vankoina sunga a kimu thei zosie a unpi-in amate a lah hi. A innsung hile, a gam sunga om zosie hile, Hezekiah in amate a lah lo bangma khat beh om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi Hezekiah kungah kamsang Isaiah pei a, “Tam mite in bang ang gen uh ahei? Hei sung pana nang kunga ang pei uh ahei?” a ci leh Hezekiah in, “Amate pen a gamlapi, Babylon gam panin keima kunga ang pei ahi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in, “Na na inn sungah bang teng a mu vuoi?” a ci hi. Hezekiah in, “Amate in ka inn sunga a om na zosie a unpi-in a mu sieng uhi. Ka vankoina innte sunga nate amate ka lah lo khat beh a om sih hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Isaiah in Hezekiah kungah, “Vanglien Topa’ thu ngai in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na inn sunga om na zosie le na pu na pate in tuni donga a kholsate, Babylon gamah a kipuohmang ding ni ang tung ding hi; bangma kinuasie lo ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma sung pana a pieng na tapate kimkhat kilamang ding hi; Babylon kumpi inn sungah amate cilge-in a om ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hezekiah in Isaiah kungah, “Nei gensa Topa’ thu pen a hoi ahi hi,” a ci hi. Azieh pen ama in, “Ka hin sungin kilemna le lungmuonna om ding hi,” ci-in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, ka mite henem un, henem un, na Pasien un ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Awnem no tawh Jerusalem hopi unlen, a thuoh ding hun ciengtan cing zo a, a mawna thaman kipie zo hi. A mawna zosie ziehin Topa’ khut tung panin a zani-in ama in thuoh zo hi, ci-in ama kungah kiko un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kiko awging khat in: “Gampalah ah Topa pei nading lampi siel unlen, senel gam sungah i Pasien adingin lam lienpi na tangsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Guom zosie kisangsah ding a, muol le tang teng zosie kiniemsah ding hi; lei kituoh lote kitotam ding a, leiphom munte zanglei suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ vang ang kitalang ding a, Topa’ kam in a gensa ahi ziehin, mi zosie in a muton ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Awging khat in, “Kiko in!” ei ci hi. Tuale keima in, “Bang thu kiko ding ka hei?” ka ci hi. Mi zosie lopa bang ahi a, a bulkip dan uh pen gamlah paape tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa’ hu in a mut ciengin, lopate vulin paapete a muol hi; a tahtahin mihingte lopa bang lel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lopate vul a, paapete a muol hi; ahi vangin i Pasien uh’ kammal ahile a kip tawntung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungdamna thu a puoh Zion aw, muolsang dawnah kato in; lungdamna thu a puoh Jerusalem aw, na tha nei za-in awng in, na aw sangsah inlen zau sin; Judah khuopite kungah, “Tanah na Pasien uh a om hi!” ci un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En un, thahatna tawh Topa Pasien ang pei a, ama in ama adingin a khut tawh vai a hawm hi. Ama’ sep thamante ang puo a, a lokiana ding ang masot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in tuucingpa bangin a tuute an a va ding hi; ama in a banah tuunote huoi-in, a kangah tuate pom ding a, a nosen neite zong damtahin a peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koi in a khutkuoh tawh tuite te-in, a khap tawh vante ciemte a, koi in a tena sungah leitung leivui guongin, muolte pongkhaina tawh khai a, koi in muoltangte tawitena tawh te ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koi in Topa’ hlagau lamlah a, ama’ thu kuppipa in ama a hil bangin koi in ama thu hil ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu a thei nadingin ama in koi dong a, koi in ama thutang lampi hil ahei? Koi in ama theina hil a, koi in ama theitelna hil ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minamte nangawn phelkhai khat pana tuimal hlitaa tawh kibang lel a, tawitena tunga leivui baang bangin kingaisun lel hi; en un, ama in leivui them bangin tuikulte a domto lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Meitaw nadingin Lebanon sing in sih zo lo ding a, a ganhingte zong kicing lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama mai-ah minam zosie bangma hi lo hi; ama in bangma lo le a hawmguoh sanga a tawmzaw-in amate a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahile note in Pasien koi tawh tekah ding a, ama tawh tekah dingin a kisutpi bang pen ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Milim khat po amah? -tua pen milim bawlpa khat in sung a, tuale khamkheng pa khat in kham tawh zutzol a, tuami adingin ama in ngun khainiengte sunpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Letsong dingin mite in a muot lo ding nailung sing a teel uhi, tua ciengin a pua lo ding milim khat a phut dingin amate in khutsiem mi khat a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Note in na thei nai sih uh amah? za nai lo na hi uh amah? A cila patin note kungah hing kigen zo hi lo amah? Note in leitung piencila kipanin, thei zo ta hi lo uh na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leitung vielkuol tunga a to pa ama ahi a, a sunga tengte pen kauphe tawh kibang hi; ama in puonkhai bangin vante zah a, ten nading puonbuh bangin tuate a zah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ama in uliente amawhna suohsah a, leitung a uhte bangma lo suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate a gina-in kisuon lo a, amate a gina-in kivaw lo hi. A huite uh lei-ah zung hla loin ama in a mut ciengin a vul vua , huipi in butu bangin amate a tawmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahile kei koi tawh ei tekah ding na hi uh ahei? Ahi sihle ka kikimpi koi pen ahei? Siengtho Pa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sangna lam ento unlen mu un: Koi in tam teng siem ahei? Ama in a honpite pui-in a phaza simin a min cietin hlan hi; ama thahatin a vangliet ziehin a pelem khat beh a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“ Topa kung panin ka lampi kiselmang a, ka Pasien in ka thumanna ei thudon lo hi,” Jacob aw, bang dingin ci-a, Israel aw, bang dingin tuaci ham na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na thei nai sih uh amah? Na za nai sih uh amah? Topa khu kumtawn Pasien ahi a, leimongte a siempa ahi hi. Ama basam lo a, zong gim lo hi; ama’ theitelna ahile sui zawh vet ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in a bate tungah thahatna pie a, thahatna nei lote a tha hatsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khangnote nangawn ba-in gim ding a, tuoilaite a husam ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />hinanle Topa a lamen mite ahile a tha uh dimkia ding a, muvanlai bangin a hla tawh lengto-in, amate tai napi a gim sih ding vua, amate lam pei napi a ba sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipi gei-a om gamte aw, daitahin ka thu ngai un; mite a tha dimkiasah un; amate a nai-ah hing peisah unlen, tua ciengin amate hing gensah un; thu kinei dingin i kinai ciet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nisuona pana ang pei a guolzo mipa, koi in nasem dingin ama hantawhin, koi in ama hlan ahei? Ama in a sungah minamte pie a, ama in a keng tawh kumpite tuoncil hi; ama in a namsau tawh amate leivui bangin bawl a, a thalpi tawh bukung huimut leng bangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a kenga a pei ngai lona lampi ah amate nuadelin nuomtahin a peisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kipat cil a kipanin a khangkhangin mite a hlan, tami nasep sem a, a bawl koi ahei? Keima, Topa khu a masa pen ka hi a, tuale a nukhia pen tawh ka omton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi gei-a om gamte in mu-in a zau vua, leimonga teng mite a citun uhi; amate in nai-in a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khatlekhat a kipanpi vua, khatlekhat “hangsan in,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khutsiem pa in khamseh pa hanthawn a, sehta tawh milim a suizol pa in lungthang tunga a sat pa hanthawn a, a sumtui luonna uh, “Hoi hi,” a ci uhi. Amate in a kilawh thei lo dingin tua milim siakil tawh a khendet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle nang ka nasem pa Israel, kang teelsa Jacob, ka guolpa Abraham’ hlahlesuon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />leimong pana kang lah dawh, gammong a gamla pen pana kang hlat, “Nang ka nasem pa na hi a, nangma kang teel zo ta a, nang kang nuol sih hi,” kang ci pa aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nang kang ompi ziehin zau sin, na Pasien ka hi ziehin patau sin; keima in nang hing thakhausahin kang panpi ding a, ka galzawna zietlam khutin kang tu lenlon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi hi, nang tunga a lungthah zosie maizumin a zala ding uhi; nang ang demte bangma suohin, a mangthai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kihaupite na sui vangin, amate na mu sih ding hi; nangma ang dote bangma a suoh vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen keima Topa na Pasien in nangma’ zietlam khut ka tu hi; “Zau sin, kang panpi ding hi,” ci-a na kunga ang ci pa keima ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lungno bang lel Jacob, no a neu Israel-te aw, zau sih un! Keima in note kang hu ding hi, Topa in ci hi; note ang Tankhie Pa pen Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in note pen a hiem, a tha le ha a nei bucilna bangin kang bawl ding hi; note in muol golte cilin na gawtvui ding vua, muoltangte zong ansi bangin na bawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note in ansite na khap ding vua, hui in tuate tawmang ding a, huipi in tuate a thezah ding hi. Tua ciengin Topa sungah na lungdam ding uhi; Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa sungah note na kisiel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mizawngte le mi tasamte in tui a sui ciengun bangma om lo a, tuidu-in a lei uh a gaw a, keima Topa in amate ka dawng ding a, keima Israel-te’ Pasien in amate ka nuasie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Muolsang pawn tungah guntui ka luongsah ding a, kuomte laikimah tuisam ka pulsah ding hi; senel gam pen buoltui ka suohsah ding a, gam gawta pen ciatui ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Senel gam sungah taamtah sing, gising, muising, le olive kungte ka posah ding hi; senel gamah taasing, hiengpa sing, meigit singte ka suonton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa’ khut in tami bawl a, Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa in tami piengsah hi, ci-in thei-in a mu thei nading, mi zosie in lung ngai-in a theisiem nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na thu uh sung un, Topa in ci hi; na cienlah nuom teng uh hing puoh un, Jacob’ Kumpipa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in tuate puoh uh hinlen, a pieng ding thu gen uheh. Kote in tuate khu ngaisunin a pieng ding thu ka thei nadingun a piengsa thute bang teng ahei ei gen uheh; ahi sihle ang pieng ding thute ei gen ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Note pasien-te na hi lam uh keima in kang thei nadingun, tu zaw cienga ang pieng ding thute kote kungah ei gen uheh; kote patau-in ka zau nadingun a pha ahi a, a sie ahi zongin hing bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tahtahin note bangma na hi sih vua, na nasepnate uh bangma ahi sih hi; note ang teel pa a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Leilu lam pan mi khat ka hantawh a, ama ang kuon zo hi, ama in nisuona lam panin ka minin ei hlan ding hi. Beelkheng pa in buon a cil bang, sum sunga kisuguoi bangin, ama in gam uhte a tuoncil gawp ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka thei nadingun a cil panin koi in ei gen a, “Ama thuman hi,” ka ci thei nadingun, koi in ei magen ahei? Koima in genkhie loin pulah lo a, koima in na gen uh za lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima in Zion kungah tam thu ka pulah masa a, Jerusalem tungah lungdamna thu gen tangko khat ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka et mawh vangin koima om lo hi. Thu ka dawh ciengin ei dawng ding, thu ka kikuppi ding amate lahah koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi lo hi, tuate a unpi-in a zuou bulompi ahi hi; a nasepte uh bangma hi lo a, a milimte uzong hui hawmpi ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam sungah ka tuhdet, ka teeldawh, ka lungkimna ka nasem pa a om hi; ama tungah ka hlagau ka koi zo ta a, ama in minamte tungah thutang a puoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama kap lo ding a, a aw sangsah loin, gawlzing lahah a awging kizasah lo ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama in kisatguoisa pumpeng hliehtawng loin, a tang lingleng meivah khau semmit lo ding hi; ama in muonhuoi tahin thutang a puoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in leitungah thutang a phudet masangin basam loin lungkie lo ding hi; tuipi gei-a gamte in ama thuhilna a lamen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vantungte siem a, tuate a zah pa, leitung pha a, a sunga om zosie a siem pa, leitunga mihingte’ naahu a guon Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima Topa ka hi a, keima in dihna tawh nang kang hlan zo a, ka khut tawh kang tu zo a, nangma kang kem zo hi; mite tungah thuciemna ahi ding, minamte tungah khuovah ahi ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mittawte mit a vahsah ding, leinei thong hawmpi sung panin thongkiete a hlakhie ding le miel lahah a to mite thong sung panin a hlakhie dingin nang kang pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima Topa ka hi a, tua khu keima’ min ahi hi; midang koima tungah ka vanglietna ka pie sih a, keima in milimte tungah ei kiphatna ka pie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />En un, amasa nate pieng zo ta a, tu-in a tha nate kang pulah hi; tuate a pien masangin na kung vuah tuate kang mahilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa tungah la tha khat sa unlen, leimong panin ama phatna la sa un! Tuipi le a sunga omte zosie, tuipi gei-a gamte le amate tunga a tengte hawhsah vapuoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Senel gam le a khuopite, Kedar-te tenna-a teng khuotate in a aw uh sangkhai uheh. Sela gama tengte in zong kipahin la sa uh hinlen, muol dawn teng panin zong kiko uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in Topa kungah vanglietna pie uh hinlen, tuipi gei-a gamte ah ama phatna tangko uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Galkap khat bangin Topa kuon a, galhang khat bangin a lung a sosah hi; ama kiko-in nahpi-in awng a, a galte do-in a hatna lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawtveipi sung bangma ka gen sih a, kei le kei kidehin dai dide-in ka om hi; tu-in numei nausuoh ding bangin ka peng vagua ding a, husamin ka nawnaa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Muol le tangte ka susie ding a, lopa hing zosie ka gawsah ding hi; gunte tuikul ka suohsah ding a, buolte ka gawkang sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amau’ thei lo lampi-ah mittawte ka peipi ding a, amau’ thei ngai lo sul zuipi-in amate ka hla ding hi. Amate masangah khuomiel khuovah ka suohsah ding a, a phomna munte zong zangtam ka suohsah ding hi. Tamte keima bawl ding ahi a, keima in amate ka nuasie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kisui milim muong a, milim kikheng kungah, “Ka pasien-te na hi uhi,” a ci mite kinua delin a maizumin kikoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bilbingte aw, ngai un; mittawte dahto unlen mu un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka nasem pa longal koi a mit taw a, ka sawl ka kamtai pa bangin koi bil bing ahei? A kipumpieh mite bangin koi a mit taw a, Topa’ nasem pa bangin koi a mit a taw ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in na tampi a mu vangin tuate encien lo hi; ama a bil a van vangin khuo za lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama’ dihna a khuolna-in ama’ thuhilna liensah a, a thupisah ding khu Topa’ lungkimna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanle tam mite pen a kisuom le a kibulu gawpte ahi vua, amate pen a unpi-in leihawm sunga a kie mite le thong sunga kikhumte ahi uhi; amate pen a hun ding a om lo, neh dinga kiman ganhing a suoh sieng vua, koima in, “Ei piekia un!” a ci vawt lo gal vanlah a suoh sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Note lahah koi in tam thu ngai ding a, mailam-ah koi in thusimin ngai ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Koi in galvantom pa kungah Jacob pie-in, a bulugawpte tungah Israel pie ahei? A tunga i mawna pa uh, amate in ama’ lampi a zui lo pa uh, a thukham zong a man lo pa uh Topa hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama tungah a lungthahna meisa le a siehuoi galkidona a sungsuh hi; a kimvel zosie-ah a lungsona kuong a, ahi vangin ama in a thei sih hi; tua in ama hulvam a, ahi vangin ama in ngaisutin nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in Jacob aw, nangma ang siempa, Israel aw, nangma ang bawlpa, Topa in tu-in tam bangin ci hi: Nang kang tat zo tah ziehin zau sin; na minin kang hlan zo ta a, nang pen keima-a’ na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuite na kansan ciengin nangma tawh kang om ding hi; gunte na kansan ciengin nang ang tai sih ding hi; meikuong lai-a na pei ciengin ang hulvam sih ding a, tuale meikuong in nang ang katum sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen keima Topa na Pasien uh, Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa, na hundampa ka hi hi. Nangma tat nadingin Egypt ka pie a, nang tawh kihleng dingin Ethiopia le Seba ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima’ mit ah nang na manpha a, zatahhuoi-in, hing it ka hi ziehin nangma tangin mite ka pie a, na hinna hlen nadingin minamte ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang kang ompi ziehin zau sin; nisuona lam panin na suonlehlahte kang puoh ding a, nitumna lam panin kang kaikhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in leilu lam kungah, “Amate piedawh ta’n,” ci-in, leitaw lam kungah, “Tukon sin,” ka ci ding hi. Gamlapi panin ka tapate, leimong panin ka tanute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka minthan nadinga ka piensahte, le ka suhtuo le ka bawlte, ka mina kilo poma hing peipi un,” ka ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mit nei napi a mittawte, bil nei napi a bilbingte hing peipi un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minam zosie kituosah unlen, mite kikhawmsah un. Amate lah panin koi in tam thu pulahin, koi in a tawpsa huna nate eite tungah ei genkhol ahei? Amate in dih a tan thei nadingun a tecite uh hing peipisah unlen, amate zasahin, “Tam khu thu man ahi hi,” cisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nohaw pen keima’ tecite na hi uhi, Topa in ci a, tuale kei pen ama ka hi lam, note in ei thei-in, tuaci’n keima nei up nading ule nei theitel nadingun note pen kang teelsa ka nasem na hi uhi. Kei masangin pasien om lo a, kei’ nua ciengin zong om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei, keima khu Topa ka hi a, tuale kei simlo hundampa dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note lahah pasien dang a op lo lai-in, keima in pulahin hundamin, ka tangko hi. Tuale Topa in note pen keima’ tecite na hi uhi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima Pasien ka hi a, tu huna kipanin zong kei Ama ka hi hi; ka khut sung panin a tankhie zo koima om lo hi; keima in na ka sem a, koi in ei khahtan zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa, note ang Tanpa Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Note ziehin Babylon ah ka sawl ding a, amate in khuopi kotgol zosie a kuoitanin tuale Chaldea-te’ kikona awging pen kaana kisuohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima Topa , na Siengtho Pa uh, Israel a piengsah pa, note’ Kumpi ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipi sunga lampi a siel pa, tuihat sunga lam a bawlpa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />leeng le sakolte, galkapte le galhangte a peipi pa; a tho zo lo dingin amate lumcipsah a, meivah khau a kisuhmit banga a mitsah pa Topa in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nidang lai-a nate phawh nawn sih unlen, a lui nate zong ngaisun nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima a tha na khat ka bawl ta ding hi; tu-in ang pieng ta hi; na thei sih uh amah? Gamlahah lam lienpi khat ka siel ding a, senel gam sungah gunte ka luongsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gamsate, ngiete le va-kalaohte in keima ei patawi ding uhi; azieh pen keima in senel gamah tui pie-in, senel gamah gunte ka pie a, ka teelsa mite’ dawn dingin tui zong ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima dinga ka piensah mite in keima phatna a tangko ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanle Jacob aw, nang in kei nei hlan sih a, Israel aw, nang in kei nei cimtah ta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Meihal biehna dingin kei kungah na tuute nang peipi sih a, na biehpiehnate tawh kei nei patawi sih hi. Keima in biehnate tawh vangih kang suon sih a, gimnamtui tawh zong kang gimsah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kei adingin a hlum mama phaite sum tawh nei leipieh sih a, na biehpiehna ganthau tawh kei nei taisah sih hi. Ahi vangin na mawnate tawh vangih nei suon a, na khielnate tawh kei nei gimsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima ka kikhuolna-in na khielnate ang phietpieh pa kei, keima khu Ama ka hi a, keima in na mawnate ka ciemte sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kei ei mawsah un, thukhen zumah pei vai. Dih na tan thei nadingin na thu hing sung in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na pu na pa masate a na maw vua, na kamphente uzong kei tungah a tawnkhiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in mun siengtho-a om uliente ka buasah ding a, keima in Jacob sietna-ah ka pie ta a, hosiet dingin Israel ka pie ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka nasem pa Jacob aw, ka teelsa Israel aw, tu-in za in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma ang siem pa, naubu sunga ang piengsah le nang ang hu ding Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Ka nasem pa Jacob aw, kang teelsa Jeshurun aw, zau sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima in a dangta leitang tungah tui ka sung ding a, leigaw tungah luitui ka luongsah ding hi; na suonlehlahte tungah ka hlagau ka sung ding a, na tu na tate tungah ka thupha ka sung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate tui lahah lopa dawng bangin po ding a, luitui luong gei-a po gielheh kungte bang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi khat in, “Kei pen Topa -a’ ka hi hi,” ci-in, adang khat Jacob’ min tawh kihlan ding a, hinanle midang khat in a khut tungah “ Topa -a’,” ci-in giel ding a, tuale Israel’ minin kivaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa , Israel Kumpipa le ama a Tanpa, Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Keima a masa pen le a nukhia pen ka hi hi; kei simlo pasien dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima tawh kibang koi ahei? Amate tangkosah inlen, keima mai-ah amate in pulahin gensah in. Koi in ang tung ding nate tangtawng panin tangko ahei? Amate in ang tung lai ding thute eite tungah gensah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zau sih unlen ging sih un; tanglai panin na kung vuah hing genin hing pulah zo hi lo ka mah? Note pen keima teci na hi uhi! Kei simlo pasien dang om amah? Suongpi dang om lo a, khat zong ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kisiemthu milimte zosie bangma ahi sih a, amau’ patat tua nate in phattuomna piengsah lo hi; a tecite un mu loin zong a thei sih uhi. Tuale amate in maizumna a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phattuomna a pie lo pasien koi in bawl a, koi in milim kheng ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En un, ama a bie mi zosie in maizumna a thuoh ding uhi; khutsiem zosie zong mihing ahi bo hi. A unpi-in kikhawmsahin amate dingsah un; amate zausi-in a unpi-un maizumna a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siakheng pa in tua pen a lim khengin meihol tungah em a, sehta tawh lim le guong nei-in khengin a ban hat tawh a sat hi; ama gilkielin gim a, tui dawn loin a balia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sing nasep khutsiempa in khau kai-in laikung tawh melci a, singnawtna tawh nawtin siem hoi-in compass tawh melci hi; tua pen biehbuhno sunga kitung dingin a duongcing mihing le a melhoi mihing bangin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in taamtah singte phua a, ahi sihle sesing khat ahi a, gangpi sing khat ahi zongin teel a, gamlah singte lahah tuate khangliensahin a golsah hi. Ama in taamtah sing khat suon a, tua khu guotui in a khangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua khu singa vah dingin kizang hi. Ama in tua sing themkhat la-in mei awi a, meitaw-in mo a em hi. Tua ciengin ama in pasien khat bawlin bie a, milim khat bawltawmin tua milim mai-ah a kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a phalkhat tawh mei a taw hi; ama in tami alang tungah sa a em a, tua sa ne-in a tai mama hi. Ama le ama kisanglum a, “Ah, ka khuolum ta, meisa nuom sam ei!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in amawh teng a pasien’ milim khatin bawl a, a milim mai-ah bie hi; ama in tua milim tungah thungen a, “Ei hundam in, nang ka pasien na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in bangma thei loin bangma a khentel thei sih uhi; azieh pen amate in khuo a mu thei lo nadingun a mit uh kihumpieh a, thu a thei lo nadingun a lungsim uh kikhacip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Sing a phalkhat tawh mei ka taw hi; a mei-am tungah mo zong ka em a, sa zong emin ka ne zo ta hi. Tu-in amawh teng a kidahhuoi-in ka bawl sam ding amah? Singtun khat mai-ah kun talawm sam ding ka mah?” a ci dingin thu ngaituo mi a om sih a, theina ahi a, thu khinkhai theina ahi zongin a nei koima khat beh a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama vut tawh kiva ahi hi; a lungsim motna in ama puikhiel zo a, ama le ama kihun thei loin, ahi sihle, “Ka zietlam khut sungah zuouthu om hi lo amah? ci-in a gen thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel aw, ka nasem pa na hi ziehin, Jacob aw, tam nate ciemte in; nang kang siem a, nang ka nasem na hi hi; Israel aw, nang kang mangngil sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na thupalsatnate meiilum bang a, na mawnate khuovui bangin ka sumaimang ta hi. Nang kang tat zo tah ziehin kei kungah hing kilekia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vante aw, Topa in tua thu sem zo ahi ziehin la sa un; lei a thuhnate aw, nahpi-in awng un; Muolte aw, la sa-in kiko un. gampalah le a sunga om singkung zosie aw, awng un! Azieh pen Topa in Jacob tan zo ta a, Israel sungah ama kiminthangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Naubu sung panin nangma ang siempa, nangma ang Tanpa, Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in na vannuoi siemin, kei matangin vante zahin, koima’ hu vawt loin leitung ka zah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />zuothu gente’ hilkholna limte a susie pa, aisan siemte mimaw a suohsah pa; mipilte lehei kia-in, a theina uh motna a suohsah pa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a nasem pa’ thu kipsahin, a kamtaite’ thugente a tangtun pa; Jerusalem kungah, “Mi ang teng ding hi,” ci-in, Judah khuopite kungah, “Amahaw kilam ta ding hi,” a ci pa, tua a kisiesate ka dingsah ding hi,’ a ci pa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tuithuhpi kungah, ‘Kanggaw ta’n, na gunte ka kangsah ding hi,’ a ci pa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cyrus kungah, “Ama ka tuucingpa hi a, ka tupna tangtungsah ding hi,” a ci pa; Jerusalem kungah, ‘Ama kilamkia ding hi,’ a ci pa le biehinnpi kungah, “Na khuombul kiphutkia ding hi,” a ci pa khu keima Topa ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama mai-ah minamte a zogawp ding le kumpite’ puontuolte hawhpieh ding, khuopi tunkotte a kikha lo nadinga a mai-a kotpite a hong ding, a zietlam khut ka tuhpieh, a sathau nu pa Cyrus kungah Topa in tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mai-ah pei-in muolte ka zezang ding a, sumngo kotpite susie-in, sia zawlte sattanin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nangma’ min tawh ang hlanpa khu Israel Pasien Topa keima ka hi lam na thei nadingin, khuomiel sunga kikoi goute le mun simtham sunga a kidap koi haunate kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka nasempa Jacob zieh le ka teeltuom Israel ziehin keima in na min tawh kang hlan a, nang in kei nei thei lo vangin keima in patawina za nang kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima Topa ka hi a, koima dang om lo hi; Keima simlo pasien dang om lo hi. note in kei ei thei sih nan locin, keima in note galhiem kang guon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nisuona lam le nitumna lam panin keima simlo koima dang a op lo lam amate in a thei nadingun, Topa khu keima ka hi a, koima dang a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in khuovah ka bawl a, khuomiel zong ka siem hi; keima in nopsahna ka siem a, lungkhamna zong ka siem hi; tam nate zosie a unpi-a a siem pa khu keima Topa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantungte aw, tung lam panin zusah un, vantungte in dihna gua bangin zusah un; hutdamna a phulto thei nadingin leitung kihongsah unlen, tua in dihna zong a posah thei nadingin, keima Topa in tua khu ka siem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma ang Bawlpa tawh a kihau mi pa, beelkheng pa tawh a kiledo leibeel in gimna nga taheh! Tungman in a khengpa kungah, “Bang bawl na hei, ahi sihle, “Na sil bawl in a tuhna nei lo hi,” ci-in a gen amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pa kungah, “Nang in koi na piengsah ei?” a cipa hi tale, numei kungah, “Nang in nausuoh dingin bang pen gimpi na hei?” a cipa in gimna thuoh taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama a Bawlpa, Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: “Nang in keima’ tate thu ei dong a, ahi sihle ka khut tawh ka silbawl tawh kisai thu ei pie ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima in leitung ka bawl a, tua tungah mi ka siem hi; vantungte a zah khu ka khutte ahi a, keima in vantung na honpite zosie thu ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dihna lamah Cyrus ka cil a, keima in ama’ lampi zosie ka tangsah ding hi; ama in nasep manh ding ahi sihle thaman a dei zieh hi loin, ka khuopi lam ding a, saltang ka mite hla ding hi,” Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Egypt’ hauna le Ethiopia sumbuh vante le na kungah a tunsang Seba mite hing pei-in, nangma-a’ ang hi ding vua, nangma’ nua ang zui ding uhi; siakol bulsa-in amate ang pei-in na mai-ah ang kun ding uhi. Amate in nangma kungah thumna ang nei ding vua, “Nangma beh tawh Pasien omton a, koima dang a om sih hi; ama simlo pasien dang om lo hi,” ang ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mantahin, Israel-te’ Pasien, hundampa aw, nangma a kiphuol Pasien na hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />amate a unpi-un zumin a zala gawp vua, milim bawlte zong amtawngin a peiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle Topa in kumtawn hutdamna tawh Israel a hundam hi; note in maizum thuoh loin, kumtawnin zong na zala sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile vantungte a siempa (ama Pasien ahi hi!) leitung a siem pa le a bawl pa (tua khu a kipsah pa; ama in tua khu buoi nadingin siem loin, ten nadinga a bawl pa!) Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Keima Topa ka hi a, koima dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in khuomielna gam sungah thu ka dapgen sih hi; Jacob’ suonlehlahte kungah, “Buoina lahah kei ei sui in,” zong ka ci sih hi. Keima Topa in thuman ka gen a, thudih ka tangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Minamte lahah a suohtate aw, kikhawmin peiton unlen, ei nai un! A sing milimte uh a puo kawikawi-te in theina a nei sih vua, a hundam thei lo pasien kungah thu a ngenngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pholah unlen, na thu uh sung un; amate kikumtonsah un! Sawtveipi lai-in tami koi gen ahei? Tanglai-in koi in a gen ahei? Keima Topa hi lo ka mah? Keima simlo pasien dang om lo a, a dih Pasien le Hundampa khat a om hi; keima simlo pasien dang om lo a, keima sim koima dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leimong a om mi zosie aw, keima lam hing kihei unlen hutdamin om un! Azieh pen keima Pasien ka hi a, koima dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei le kei ka kiciem zo a, dihna ziehin ka kam panin ang kinuale lo ding le ang pusuoh ding thu in: “Keima kungah mi zosie ang khupdin ding a, lei zosie ang kiciem ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa sung behah dihna le thahatna om hi, ei kici ding hi; ama tunga a lungthah zosie ama kungah ang pei ding a, amate kimaizumsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa sungah Israel’ suonlehlahte zosie guolzo-in a kisiel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bel pasien khupbawhin Nebo pasien kunsuh a, a milimte uh vangih a puo ganhingte in a puo hi. Note’ puoh tami vante pen ganhing a gimte tungah vangih bangin kisuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate kunin a khupbawh ton uhi; amate in a vangih puoh uh pengsah thei lo a, amate mama galmatin a pei zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na suo-a kipan kang tawi, naubu sung pana kang puoh, Jacob innkuon, Israel innkuon panin a omlai zosiete aw, ka thu ngai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />na vuoi dong nangawnun keima khu ama ka hi a, na sam uh a kan dong nangawnun keima in note kang puo ding hi; keima in kang bawl zo a, keima in kang puo ding hi; keima in kang tawi ding a, kang hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note in kei, koi tawh ei kisunsahin koi tawh ei kikimsah ding a, ka kibahpi dingin koi tawh ei tekah ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sum-ip pana kham a nopzah mite in tawitena tawh ngun te-in, khamseh pa a ciel vua, amate in tua nate pasien-in a bawlpieh hi; tua ciengin khupbawhin tua milim a bie uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A liengko vuah tua pasien khangin a puo vua, a opna munah koi-in tua munah kitung hi; a opna panin khum mun panin kikhin thei lo hi; ama tungah mi khatpo a kiko vangin ama in a dawng sih a, ama in lungkhamna panin zong koima a hunkhie thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No thupalsat mite aw, tami thu phawhin ngaisun unlen, lungngai pha unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hun lui thute phawh un; azieh pen kei Pasien ka hi a, adang koima om lo hi. Kei Pasien ka hi a, keima bang koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kipat cil panin a tawp tanpha-in ka gen a, tangtawng lai panin a pieng nai lo nate genin, “Ka lungtup kip ding a, ka ngaisutna ka tangtun ding hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nisuona panin sasiel a ne va khat ka hlan a, ka lungtup a sem dingin mun gamla panin mi khat ka hlan hi. Ka gensa ahi ta a, ka tangtun ding hi; ka gelsa ahi ta a, ka sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />No a lungtang khau mite le hutkhietna tawh a kigamla mite aw, ka thu gen ngai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ka hutkhietna a nai-ah kang peipi a, a gamla sih hi. Tuale keima’ hutdamna khu a kiheh sih ding hi; keima’ minthanna ahi Israel adingin Zion ah ka hutdamna ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngahnu siengtho Babylon tanu aw, kumsuh inlen leivui lahah to in! Chaldea tanu aw, kumpi topha a op lona lei lahah tosuh in! Bangzieh ahei cile nang a khangmoi, a ngeh dihdeh ang kici nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An gawina suongte la-in an gawi inlen, na kikhuna puon ladawh in. Na puontuol sutin, na keng dawhsah inlen, gunte kantan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Guohtang na hina khu loin a om ding a, na zumhuoina teng kimu ding hi. Keima in phu ka la ding a, koima ka hinkhawi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eite’ Tanpa, ama’ min pen Vanglien Topa , Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chaldea’ tanu aw, dai tahin to inlen, khuomu lahah pei in! Bangzieh ahei cile nang pen kumpi gamte’ kumpinu ang kici nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite tungah ka lungthah a, ka gouluo ka buasah hi; na khut sungah amate kang pie a, amate tungah hepina na lah sih hi; khanghamte tungah a gih mama dingin na hahkol na bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang in, “Kumpi nu hi zing na vang,” na kici a, tuaci’n tam thute ngaisun loin a thumong zong na phawhkha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in nang a noptat, lungmuong taha a to hit hiet, na lungsim sungah, “Keima ka hi hi, keima lo koima om lo hi; meigongin to sih vangin, tate zong sisuo sih vang,” a ci nu in tam thu ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bakhat, ni khat sungin na tungah tamte gel ang tung ding hi: Aisan siemna le mibum siemnate nasie tahin nei nan lacin nang tungah ta le naute sina le meigonna ang tung veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na gitlona-ah na lungmuong hi; “Koima in kei ei mu sih,” na ci hi. Na pilna le na theina in nang ang puikhiel ta a, tuale na lungsim sungah, “Keima ka hi, kei simlo midang om sih,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hizongle na damsah thei lo sietna na tungah ang tung ding a, na mansah thei lo gimna na tungah ang tung ding hi; na tungah na theikhah lo manthaina thakhatthu-in ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na neulai pana na sep na mibumna le na aisannate ah kiptahin om in; nang in na muolsuo kha thei ding a, mite na zausah kha thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thu kikuppi mi tampite ziehin na lung a gim mama hi; vantung nate kanin aasi zong enin, hladet siela nangma tungah bang thu pieng ding ci thu ang magen mite dingsah inlen, kihundamsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En in, amate bukung tawh kibang a, mei in amate a katum sieng hi; meikuong’ hatna panin amau le amau a kihun thei sih uhi. Tam pen khuolum nading mei-am hi lo a, a mai-ah to-in awi ding mei zong hi lo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na neu lai pana na sum suipi, na septonpi mite in nang tungah ang sep hu thei tam bang teng ahi hi; amate a lampi cietah a vahthap vua, nang ang hundam ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel min tawh a kilo, Judah laigui pana a pieng; Topa’ min tawh kiciem napi thuman thutah tawh Israel Pasien kunga thu a ngen lo Judah innkuon aw, tam thu ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen khuopi siengtho min tawh amau le amau a kihlan vua, Israel Pasien tungah a kingam uhi; Ama’ min Vanglien Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sawtpi lai-in amasa nate kang gen zo a, ka kam panin tuate pusuohin, ka kitheithangsah hi; tua ciengin tuate thakhatin ka bawl a, a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Note na lungkhau vua, na ngawng uh sia thagui tawh kibang a, na talpang uh sumngo tawh a kibah lam ka thei ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />note in, “Ka milim un tamte bawl a, a kisui ka milim ule a kisung ka milim un amate thu a pie hi,” na ci thei lo nadingun note tungah sawtpi lai panin thu kang gen zo a, tuate a pien masangin na tung vuah kang zasah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na za zo ta uhi; tu-in tamte zosie en un; nang in tua khu na pulah sih ding amah? Tu-a kipanin a tha nate, na thei nai lo uh, a ki-imcip nate note kang zasah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate kipiengsah a, sawt nai lo hi; note in “Tuate thei zo ta ung,” na ci thei lo nadingun, a tawpsa hunin note in tua thute na za ngai nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note in za ngai nai loin, zong na theikha nai sih vua, tanglai-a panin na bil uh a kihong nai sih hi. Bangzieh ahei cile nangma in zuouthu tawh na na sem a, na suo-a kipanin mi ledo pa ang kici ding lamtah ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in ka min ka khuolna-in ka lungthahna ka die a, keima in ei kipawhna ka khuolna-in note kang thagam lo nadingin ka ki-ip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En un, note kang siensuo zo a, ahi vangin ngun na bang sih uhi; keima in gimna meikhuh sungah note kang zelah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima ka kikhuolna, keima ka kingaisutna-in tami ka bawl hi, azieh pen bang dingin ka min kigensiesah ding ka hei? Keima in mi khat tungah ka minthanna ka pie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kang hlatsa Israel le Jacob aw, ka thu ngai un: Kei Ama ka hi hi; kei amasa pen ka hi a, a nukhia pen zong ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka khut in leitung khuombul phut a, ka zietlam khut in vantungte a zah hi; keima in amate ka hlat ciengin amate ang ding to pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na unpi-un hing kikhawm unlen za un! Amate lahah tam thute koi in gen ding ahei? Topa in ama a it hi; Babylon tungah a lungtup sem ding a, Chaldea-te lang khatah zong ama’ banhat a pang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei, keima nangawn in thu ka gen a, ama ka hlan hi. Keima in ama ka peipi zo ta a, a sepna a dau pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei kung ei nai unlen, tam thu hing za un! A cila kipanin thu ka dap gen ngai sih a, tua thu a piena kipanin khum munah ka om zo hi. Tuale tu-in Topa Pasien in keima le ama’ hlagau ei sawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangma’ Tanpa, Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Nangma’ hoi nadinga thu ang hil, na zui dinga kilawm lampi-ah ang pui, keima khu Topa na Pasien uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw ka thupiehte na thuse hi lacin! Na nopsahna gunpi bang ding a, na guolzawna zong tuipi a tuihuol bang kha ngel ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />na cihlahte senel za pha-in na suonlehlahte zong senel tang za a pha ding hi; keima mai-ah amau’ min kisumaimang ngai loin, zong kisusie lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babylon panin peikhie unlen, Chaldea panin tai un. Kipahna awging tawh tam thu genin pulah unlen, leimong dongin puoh un. “ Topa in a nasem Jacob tankhie zo hi!” ci-in gen kawikawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in senel gam kantanin amate a pui ciengin a dang uh taa lo hi. Ama in amate adingin suongpi panin tui pulsah a, ama in suongpi satkehin tui a luongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Migilote adingin kilemna om lo hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipi gei-a om gamte aw, ka thu ngai unlen, no a gamlapi-a omte aw, na bil hing daw un! Topa in ka suo masangin keima ei na hlan zo a, ka nu sunga ka op lai-in ka min ei na phuo zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in ka kam, namsau tat hiemsa bangsah a, ama’ khut hlim sungah keima ei phuol hi. Ama in a kinawt ngil thaltang bangin keima ei bawl a, ama’ thaltang lawng sungah keima ei phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in keima kungah, “Ka nasem Israel na hi hi; nangma ziehin ka minthang ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in, “Amawhna-in na ka sem a, bangma lo le amawhna-in ka thatang ka zang hi; hinanle pel loin ka vai teng Topa kungah om a, ka thaman zong ka Pasien kungah om hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama kungah Jacob kipeipi kia-in, ama kungah Israel-te a kisuhtuo thei nadingin Topa muna-ah ei kipatawi a, Pasien pen ka thahatna suohin, ama nasem dingin ka nu sungah keima ei piengsah Topa in tu-in thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in, “Jacob minamte a lamto ding le Israel a suohtate a ngai bangsahkia dingin, ka nasem pa na hina pen a bailam no khat ahi hi. ka hutdamna in leimong dong a phah thei nadingin minamte tunga khuovah ahi dingin nang kang pie ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel a Tanpa le ama’ Siengtho Pa ahi Topa in nahpi taha a kisimmaw, minamte’ huot bawl, gam uhte’ nasempa tungah, “Nangma ang teel a muonhuoi Topa , Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa ziehin, mite na hutdamna thu kumpite in ang mu ciengun ang dingto ding vua, uliente amau le amau ang khupbawh ding uhi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Ang angvan hunin keima in nang kang dawng zo a, hutdamna ni-in nang kang panpi zo hi; keima in note kang kem a, mite dinga thuciemna banga kang pieh na hi a, nang in gam na phu nading le a kinuasiesa goute na hawmpieh nadingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />thongkiate kungah, “Hing pusuoh un,” ci-in, miel lahah a om mite kungah, “No le no hing kilah un,” ka cisah ding hi. Amate in lampi dungah an a ne ding vua, muolvum pawn zosie a an maina uh hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate gilkiel loin, a dangta sih ding vua, huisa le nisa zong a thuoh sih ding uhi, azieh pen amate a khuotuo pa in amate mapui ding a, ama in tuinah pulna munah amate a peipi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka muol teng zosie lampi ka suohsah ding a, ka lam lienpite ka sangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />En un, a gamlapi panin tamte ang pei ding vua, en un, tamte leilu lam le nitumna panin ang pei-in, Syene gam panin tamte ang pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vantungte aw, kipahin la sa unlen, leitung aw, lungdamin dieng in; muolte aw, awngin la sa un! Azieh pen Topa in mite hlamuon zo a, gentheina a thuohte tungah lainatna nei ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle Zion in, “ Topa in kei ei nuasie zo a, ka Topa in kei ei mangngil zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Numei in nawitep lai a ta mangngil thei-in, a sunga pieng a tapa khuotuo loin a om thei ding amah? Tamte nangawn in mangngil kha thei ding a, hinanle ken note kang mangngil sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />En un, ka khutphang gel sungah nangma kang giel zo ta a, na kulpi bangte zong ka mai-ah a om zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ang lam mite ang susiete sangin hatzaw a, ang susiete in ang peisan ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na kimvelah khuodahin en in; amate a unpi-un a kikhawmin na kung ang zuon uhi. Topa in a genna ah, keima a nungta ka hi ma bangin, kizepna bangin tuate na sil ding a, motha bangin tuate na sil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kilawisa le a daidamsa na munte le a kisiecip nangma’ gamte- na sunga a tengte adingin tu-in ahile ang kuocih valon ding a, nangma ang valtumte gamlapi-ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na da hun sung vua a pieng na tate in na zahna vuah, “Kei adingin mun kawcih luo hi; ka ten nading uh mun ei bawlpieh in,” ang ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin na lungsim sungah, “Tam mite koi’ hinsah ahiei? Da le mau-in ka ciing a, salin ei kikaimang hi. Tuaci’n tamte koi’ kep adiei? Kei guohin ei kinuasie a, tam mite hei sung pana ang pei uh ahi diei?” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa Pasien in tam bangin gen hi: A sawt loin minamte tungah ka khut ka lamto ding a, mite adingin ka lim ka khai ding hi; amate in a kang sung vuah na tapate uh tawi-in ang puoh ding vua, amate in na tanute uh a liengko vuah puo-in ang puoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpite pen note ang kem na pate suoh ding a, kumpinute zong note ang khoi na nute suoh ding uhi. Amate in a mai uh tuol lam ngatin nang kungah a khupbawh ding vua, amate in na kephanga leivui baangte ang liepieh ding uhi. Tua ciengin note in Topa ka hi lam nei thei ding uhi. Keima ei ngahte in zumna a thuoh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihat pa kung panin amau’ samat kilahpieh zo a, mi zothaw pa in sala a mat mite a kihunkhie zo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hizongnanle Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Mihatpa’ mat salte nangawn kiladawh ding a, mi zothaw pa’ samat zong kihunkhie ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile nangma ang dem mite keima tawh ka kidem ding a, na tate ka hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang bawlsie mite in amau’ sa ka nesah ding a, zukham bangin amau’ si ma dawnin a kham ding uhi. Tua ciengin kei pen Jacob’ Vanglien Pa, nang ang Tankhie pa, nang ang hunpa Topa ka hi lam mi zosie in ei thei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Ama a nua-a ka peisahna, na nu uh a kikhulna lai hei sungah om ahei? Ahi sihle nang kang zuana ka leibatnate koi ahei? Hi lo hi, na mawna zieh vua note ang kizua uh ahi a, na tawnkhiel zieh vua na nu uh kikhul ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah kang pei lai-in bang zieha mi koima om lo ahei? Kang hlat lai-in bang zieha ei dawng ding koima om lo ahei? A tankhie zo lo dingin ka khut a tom talawm amah? Ahi sihle a hlakhie dingin thahatna ka nei sih amah? Ka phawsietna tawh tuipi ka gawsah a, gunte zong senel gam ka suohsah hi. Tui a op lo ziehin a ngate uh ui than sieng a, dangta-in a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vantungte puonvom ka silsah a, la-ip puon tawh ka khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kammal khat tawh a gim mite ka thahatsah thei nadingin, Topa Pasien in keima siepa khat’ lei ei na guon a, ama in thu kihil mite banga thu ka ngai thei nadingin zingmawng sielin ei phong a, ka bil a khanglosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa Pasien in ka bil ei honpieh zo a, ama langpang nawn loin, ka nuangat nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei ei vuote ka elzang ka daw a, ka khamul a botkieute ka bieng ka daw hi; zakona le cilphitna panin ka maitang ka phuol sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa Pasien in kei ei hu a, tua ahi ziehin ka muolpho sih hi; tua ziehin meituh suong bangin ka maitang ka daw a, ei kimaizumsah lo ding hi, ci-in keima in ka thei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />keima’ thumanna a langsah pa khu keima kungah a om hi. Keima ei dem ding koi ahiei? Eite dingto ciet va vui. Ka kidopi koi teng ahei? Ei kimaituosah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei ei panpi pen khu Topa Pasien ahi hi. Koi ahiei keima ei mawsiet ding? Amate zosie puon bangin paatin nget in amate a netum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa giing a, a nasem pa’ thu a mang, khuomiel sungah lam pei-in, khuovah a nei lo, hinanle Topa’ min muongin Pasien tunga kingam note lahah koi pen ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle na unpi-un mei a tawkuongte le meisel a dete na hi uhi. Na meikuong sung ule na tawsa uh meiselte lahah vah kawikawi un! Note in keima’ khut pana na nei ding uh tami ahi hi: Note in bawlsietna thuohin na lumsuh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa sui a, dihna lam a zuite aw, ka thugen ngai un. Note ang kilemna suongpi le note ang kitawna suongkhuh en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na pa uh Abraham le note ang hing Sarah en un; azieh pen khat tang ahi lai-in ama ka hlan a, ama thupha pie-in tampi ka phasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in Zion henem ding a, ama in a daidamsa ama’ mun zosie henemin, a gamlah zong Eden bangsah ding a, a senel gam zong Topa’ um bangsah ding hi; ama sungah lungnopna kipahna, lungdamkona le lasahna awging kiza ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mite aw, ka thu ngai unlen, ka minamte aw, na bil daw un; azieh pen ka kung panin thuhilna khat pusuoh ding a, ka thutanna in minamte tungah khuovah hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kung vuah ka hutkhietna kang naw peisah ding hi, ka hutdamna peikhie zo a, ka banhat in mite a uh ding hi. Tuipi gei-a gamte in ei lamen vua, keima’ banhat khu a kinepna uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vantung lamah dahto unlen, nei lama om leitung ensuh un; azieh pen meikhu bangin vante mangthai-in, leitung puonsil bangin tonci ta ding a, a tunga teng teng zong thovai bangin a sigam ta ding uhi; hizongle kumtawnin ka hutkhietna om ding a, a tatkhietna in zong tawp hun nei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thumanna thei a, na lungsim sung vuah ka thuhil a vom mite aw, kang thugen ngai un; mihingte’ gensietna zau sih unlen, ang hosiet ciengun lungkie sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen puonsil bangin amate nget in netum ding a, samul puon bangin lungno in amate netum ding hi; hizongle ka hutkhietna kumtawnin om ding a, ka hutdamna zong khantanin a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khanglo in, khang lo in, thahatna puon sil in, Topa’ banhat aw! Hun lui lai, khanghun sawtpi lai-a bangin khanglo in! Rahab a semnen pa, gulhiempi sunpailet pa nang hi lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuipi, tui thuhpite a gawsah pa zong nangma na hi a; hutdamsate a galkai nadinga tuipi thuh tunga lam sielpa zong nangma hi lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa’ tatsate kilekia ding a, la a sah kawmun Zion zuon ding uhi; a lutung vuah kumtawn nopna om ding a; amate in kipahna le nopna nga-in, dana le kaanate a taimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei, keima khu note ang henempa ka hi hi; tua leh bang dingin lopa banga a muol thei, a si valon ding mi maimai khat na hici giin uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Note in vante zahin leitung khuombul phut pa, note ang siem Topa na mangngil ta uhi. Note hing suhsiet sawmin mi bawlsie pa’ sinsona ziehin sunthapai-in na zau zing uhi. Hinanle mi bawlsie pa’ sinsona hei sungah om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kibawlsie mite mallangin kihla ding hi; amate si loin Leihawm sungah a peisuh sih ding vua, anneh tuidawn zong a kitasam sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kei pen tuihuolte a mau nadinga tuipi a lawhgawp pa note’ Topa ka hi a, ama’ min pen Vanglien Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma’ kam sungah ka thute ka guong zo a, keima’ khut lim nei-ah nangma kang sel hi. Keima in vantungte zahin lei bulpi ka phut a, Zion kungah zong, ‘Nang keima’ mi na hi hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hing tho in, nang mama hing tho in! Topa’ khut sung panin a thangpaina hai a dawn zo, a dopnieh dongin hawipuana haipi a dawnkham zo Jerusalem aw, hing ding dawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hinsa a tapate lahah ama lam a lah ding koima om lo hi; ama in a kepsa a tapate lahah ama a khut tawh a kai ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang tungah tami thu nite a tung zo hi. Kisietna le manthaina, kielpi le namsau ahi hi. Koi pen in nang ang henem ta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na tapate a balia ta vua, ngen thanga a awh sanang bangin khuolai lamlien bul zosie-ah amate a lum uhi. Topa’ thangpaina, na Pasien uh’ hosietna tawh amate a kidim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a liem, zu ne lopi zukham a bang note in tam thu za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama’ mite adinga a thumpieh na Pasien uh, Thunei pen Topa na Pasien un tam bangin gen hi: En un, na khut sung panun hawipuana hai ka la zo hi; note in ka thangpaina haipi na dawnkia nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Note kungah, “Na tung vua lam ka hlah thei nadingun na khupbawh un,’ ang ci, no ang bawlsie mite’ khut sung panin tua haipi ka koi ding hi,” a ci hi. Na ngumzang uh leilah bangin bawlin, khuolai lampi bangin amau’ lam hlah nading na bawl zo ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion aw, khanglo in, khang lo in, thahatna puon sil in! Khuopi siengtho Jerusalem aw, na puon hoite sil in; azieh pen nangma sungah tep tan lote le a bua mite ang lut nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kiman Jerusalem aw, leivui panin kithing inlen ding in. A kiman Zion tanu aw, na ngawnga ang kikhina khaute sut in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Bangma loin ang kizua a, sum pieh loin ang kitan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa Pasien in tam bangci hi: Hun sawtpi lai-in Egypt ah pemta-in ka mite a na peisuh uhi; Assyria-te in a thu om lo pi-in amate na bawlsie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mite a thu om lo pi-in kikaimang ta ahi ziehin tami munah bang bawl ding ka hei? Topa in ci hi. A makaite uh a awng vapuoh vua, sunthapai-in ka min kigensie den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka mite in keima’ min thei ding uhi; tua ziehin thu gen pa keima ka hi a, khum ni ciengin tam muna ka op lam amate in ei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kilemna thu a phuongzah, lungdamna thu a puoh, hutdamna thu a tangko, Zion tungah, “Na Pasien maang hi,” ci-a muolte tungah thu a gen, kamtaipa’ keng khu bangza tahin etlawm ahei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai un! na galvilte un a aw uh sangsah a, lungdam tahin amate in la a saton uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Zion ah Topa a kilekiana amate in a mit utawh a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kisie no Jerusalem munte aw, la sa-in kiko ton un; azieh pen Topa in a mite henem zo a, ama in Jerusalem tankhie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minam zosie’ muna-ah Topa in a ban siengtho lah zo a, leimongte zosie in i Pasien’ hutdamna a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kihem un, kihem un. Khum mun panin pei dawh ta un! Topa’ umlebeel a puote aw, a sieng lo nate khoi sih un; khum mun panin pei dawh unlen, no le no kisiensuo tawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na mai vuah Topa ang pei-in, Israel’ Pasien pen note’ nuadal ding ahi ziehin, a kinawsa-in pei loin, lauthawngsa-in zong na pei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En un, ka nasempa a daupei ding hi; ama kitawi sangin kidomto ding a, a sang mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama lamdang a sa mi tampi a op ma bangin, a meelpuoh dan pen mi zong sun nawn loin a meel kisiegawp a, mihing bang nawn loin a guong zong kisie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in minam tampite a dipkuosah ding hi; ama ziehin kumpite in a kam a hum ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in a kigen ngai lo nate a mu ding vua, a zah ngai nai lo uh nate a lungngai ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I zah uh thute koi in um ahei? Topa’ banhat khu koi tungah kilang ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen ama singno dawng khat bang le lei gaw lahah hui a hla singzung bangin ama mai-ah ang khangdawh hi; eite’ et dingin ama in guong kilawm le thupina nei lo a, eite’ ipla thei dingin zong ama in melhoina bangma nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Midangte in ama simmaw-in a nuol uhi; gimna a thuoh mipa le natna tawh kilawi lo pa ahi hi; tuale mite in mu nuom loin midangte in a mai uh a humsan mipa bangin ama kisimmaw a, eite in zong bangma-in i sim sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in eite’ gimna teng thuoh a, eite’ natna teng a puo tahtah hi; hinanle Pasien in ama sat a, gimsah hi, ci-in eite in i ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin eite’ tatsietna ziehin ama in liemna thuoh a, eite’ khielna ziehin ama kitehpuong hi; eite in nopna i nga thei nadingin ama in dan thuoh a, ama’ liemmate ziehin eite in damna i nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I unpi-un tuu bangin lam i khiel sieng ta uhi; i unpi-un i lampi cietah i kipei ta vua, tuale Topa in eite’ khielna zosie, ama tungah a nga ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama kibawlsie-in gimna kithuohsah nanle a kam a kah vawt sih hi. Gaw dinga kipeipi tuuno le a mulheute’ mai-a kipeipi a ham lo tuu bangin ama in a kam a keh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A man lo thukhenna tawh ama a kikaimang hi. Koi in ama’ mailam ding ngaituo pieh thei ding ahei? Azieh pen a hingte’ gam panin ama kisumaimangin, ka mite’ thupalsatna ziehin ama in gimna a thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama tatsie loin a kamah zuou thu om sih nanle, amate in migilote tawh hankhuh a kibang, mihaute tawh a kibangin han a bawlpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama gimna tawh a kitepuong ding pen Topa’ deina ahi hi. Mawna zieha biehna-in ama’ hinna na pieh ciengin, ama in a suonlehlahte mu ding a, tuale ama a damsawt ding hi; ama tungtawnin Topa’ deina a lawcing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in lungkhamna panin khuovah a mu ding hi; a theina tungtawnin ama in lungkimna mu ding hi. Midih ka nasempa in mi tampi dihsah ding a, amau’ khielnate ama in puo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin miliente tawh ama tanh ka hawmpieh ding a, ama in a thahat mite tawh galvan lahte a hawm ding hi; azieh pen ama in sina sungah a hinna sungsuh a, mi tawnkhielte tawh kisimtha hi; hinanle ama in mi tampite’ mawna puohpieh a, mi tawnkhielte adingin a thumpieh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ta a nei lo, a ciing nu aw, la sa in; nausuoh natna a thuoh ngai lo nu aw, la sa-in awng vapo in! Azieh pen pasal nei numei’ tate sangin a kinuasie numei’ tate tamzaw ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na buhmun khan inlen, na tenna puonbuhte kizalsah in.; na khaute nua ziel sin; na khaute sausah inlen, na khuomte phutdet in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen veilam le ziet lamah na kithezah ding vua, na suonlehlahte in minamte’ gou luo-in, a kilawi khuopite-ah a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zau sin, azieh pen maizumna na thuoh sih ding hi; lungkie sin, azieh pen zakona na thuoh sih ding hi; bang ding ahei cile na khangno lai-a na maizumna na mangngil ding a, meigong na hi zieha ang kizakona na phawh kha nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen ang siempa na pasal ahi a, ama’ min Vanglien Topa ahi hi; nangma ang tankhie pa pen Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa ahi a, ama pen leitung buppi’ Pasien kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a kidon lo, a lungkham vangut, tangval’ zi ahisa, a kikhul zi a kihlatkia bangin Topa in nangma ang hlankia hi, na Pasien in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bakhat sung kang nuasie zuai a, ahi vangin lainatna lienpi tawh kang khawmkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tui banga a let ka lungthahna ziehin na kung panin bakhat sung ka mai ka phuol a, ahi vangin kumtawn itna tawh na tungah lainatna kang nei ding hi, nang ang Tanpa Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam pen kei adingin Noah’ hun lai bang ahi hi: Leitungah Noah’ tuite ang peikia nawn lo ding, ci-a ka kiciem ma bangin na tungah lungthah nawn loin, kang phawhsie nawn sih ding hi, ci-in ka kiciem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen muol sangte kihemin, muol neute kikhin thei hi, ahi vangin nangma kung panin ka itna kip kihem lo ding a, ka kilemna thuciem kikhin lo ding hi, nang tunga lainatna a nei Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gimna a thuoh, huipi’ sema a awnsa, ang kihenem lo khuopi aw, keima in suongkang vuite tawh na suongte ka lam ding a, na inn khuombulte zong sappphire suong tawh ka phut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na inn khumvumte ruby suongte tawh, na kul kotpite, jewel suonghoite tawh, na kulpi bangte zong suong manphate tawh ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tapate uh a unpi-in Topa in hil ding a, na tapate uh a hau mama ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dihna sungah nang ang kikipsah ding hi; nang na zau lo ziehin bawlsietna tawh na kigamla ding hi, nang na zau sih ding a, dipkuotna tawh na kigamla ding hi; azieh pen na kungah tuate ang tung lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi khatpo in kitawhmawna a bawl leh tua pen keima kung pan hi lo hi. Note tawh kitawhmawna a bawl poma note ziehin a pua ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />En un, ama’ nasep nadingin pum zapin, hiem a bawl siekhengpa khu keima’ piensah ahi hi; keima in a susie dingin a susie pa zong ka piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang do nadinga kibawl hiem poma mavang lo ding a, thukhenna sungah na langa a pang leii poma na thalpaih ding hi. Tam pen Topa’ nasemte’ gouluo le kei kung pan amau’ dihna kilahna ahi hi, Topa in ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A dangta mi zosie aw, tuikhuh hing zuon un; sum nei lote zong hing pei unlen hing ne un! Hing pei un, sum pieh kul lo man nei loin, lenggazu le bawngnawi hing ne un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An ahi lo nate lei nadingin bang dingin na sum uh zangin, gilva nading ahi lo pi-in bang dingin na sem na hi uh ahei? Ka thugen limtahin ngai-in an tuituoh ne unlen, antuite ah nuomsa-in om un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na bil daw unlen, ka kungah hing pei un; na hin thei nadingun ka thu gen ngai un. Note tawh tawntung thuciemna khat ka bawl ding a, David adingin a tul thei lo keima’ itna kip a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />En un, ama pen mite tungah teci ka suohsah a, mite adingin makai le a uhpa dingin ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />En un, na thei ngai lo uh minamte na hlan ding vua, ama in note hing thupisah zo ahi ziehin, Topa na Pasien uh, Israel’ Siengtho Pa ziehin na kung vuah ang thei ngai lo minamte ang tai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kimu thei petin Topa sui unlen, a nai op petin ama hlan un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />migilote in a lampi uh nuasie hinlen, midih lote in a ngaisutnate uh nuasie uheh; amate tungah ama in hepina a nei thei nadingin Topa i Pasien uh kungah amate kilesahkia un, azieh pen ama in kicingtahin a mawna uh a maisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei ngaisutnate no ngaisutna ahi lo ziehin, na lampite uzong ka lampite ahi sih hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitung sangin vante a sanzawh ma bangin, ka lampite zong no lampi sangin sangzaw a, tua ma bangin ka ngaisutnate zong no ngaisutna sangin sangzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen vantung panin guotui le vua ang kie-in, amate in leitung a nomsah masangsie kinuale kia loin, kungnote mengin dawngsah a, khaici vawpa kungah khaici pie-in a ne pa kungah an a pieh ma bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ka kam sung pan a pusuoh ka thu zong tua ma bang ding hi; keima kungah a hawmpi-in ang kile lo ding a, ama in ka lungtup tangtung sahin, ama ka sawlna thu a muolsuo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen kipah tahin na pei ding vua, lungnuom tahin ang kipeipi kia ding hi; na mai vuah muol le tangte in la sa-in awng ding a, gam sunga sing zosie in khut beng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lingkung tangin taasing po ding hi; theimi ling tangin mui kung po ding hi; Topa mai-ah tua khu phawna hi ding a, a kisattan lo ding kumtawn lim khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: thutang zang unlen, thumanin gamta un, azieh pen ka hutdamna ang tungbai ta ding a, ka hutkhietna ang kilang ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam banga a gamta mite, tami thu a tukip mite, sabbath buasah loin tangin, sietna khatpo bawl nading panin a kideh zo mite pen mi nuomsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa a bel gamdang mipa in, “ Topa in a mite panin kei ei khenkhie tahtah ding hi,” ci sih heh; Cilgesa pasal in, “Kei pen singgaw khat ka hi lel hi,” ci sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Ka sabbath nite tangin ei lungdamsah thei nate teel a, ka thuciemna a tukip a kiget mite tungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ka innsung le ka kulpi sunga tanu le tapate sanga a hoizaw phawna le min ka pie ding a, amate tungah suhmaimang nawn lo ding, a kip tawntung min ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’ na a sem ding, Topa’ min a it ding, ama’ nasem a suoh dingin Topa a bel gamdang mite, sabbath ni tangin a buasah lo, ka thuciemna a tukip mi zosie
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka muol siengtho-ah peipi-in ka thungetna inn sungah ka lungdamsah ding hi; keima in ka maitam tungah a meihal biehna ule a biehpiehnate uh kisang ding hi; azieh pen ka inn in mi namcin’ thungetna inn kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kipampaih Israel a kaikhawm Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi. A kikaikhawmsa mite banah amate kungah midangte ka kaikhawm ding hi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No gamsa zosie, gamlaha gamsa zosie, a valtum dingin hing pei un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel’ galvilte a mit uh taw a, a unpi-un theina a nei sih uhi. Amate a unpi-un mi a kawh thei lo ui tawh a kibang vua, a lup kawmun mang a nei vua, kimut a du mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uite in zong an a hai vua, kham hun a nei ngai sih uhi; tuucingte in theitelna nei loin, a unpi-un a lampi ciet vuah a kihei uhi; amate in a unpi-un a phattuom nading beh uh a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in, “Hing pei un, eite in zu sui vai; eite in khamtahin zucia dawn vai. Zing cieng zong tuni ang bang ding a, nuomzaw lai ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi thuman pa mangthai a, koima in ngaisutin nei lo hi; koima’ thei lo kalin a thutah mite kilamang hi. Azieh pen tuosietna panin midihte kilakhie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />amate nopsahna sungah lut uhi; thutanga kalsuonte ahi uleh amau’ lupna tungah a tawlnga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hizongle no aisan numeite’ tate, angkawmte le a pahtatte’ suonlehlahte aw, tam sungah hing pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na simmaw uh koi hi a, koi langah na kam uh golkahin na leii uh phen na hi uh ahei? Note mi tawnkhielte’ tate, zuouphuohte’ suonlehlahte hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gangpi sing lah le singna dum nei lahah a huasante’ kuom sung teng le suongpikawm tengah na tate uh a thatte hi lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kuom sunga suong zolte lahah na tanh uh om a, tuate khu note’ tanh ahi hi; note in tuate tungah dawnthei biehna sungin an tawh biehna na tawi uhi. Tam silte ziehin kei ka lung a kim ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Muolsang tungah na lupna na koi vua, a kithoi dingin tua munah na kato uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kotpi le kotpi khuom nua lamah na dawi biehna lim na suong uhi; azieh pen nang in kei ei nuasie-in na lupna na hawhkhie a, nangma tua tungah kato-in na lupna a golpi-in na hong hi; amate tawh thukimna bawlin, nang in a lupna uh na lunggul a, a guohtanga a om amate na kaihlit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sathau kengin Molech kungah na haw a, na panamtuite na tamsah semsem hi; gamlapi-ah na palaite na sawl a, Misikhuo nangawnah na sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na khuolzinna a tam ziehin nang na gim mama a, ahi vangin nang in, “Kimanna nei sih,” na ci sih hi. A kikuontawkia na lunggulna na mu a, nang na thazawm ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Koi na giin ziehin zuouthu genin kei ei phawh kha lo na hei? Ahi sihle na lungsim sungah ei ngaisun ta lo na mah? Ka mit singin ka dai dide zieha kei nei giin tah lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na dihna le na sepnate kang genpieh ding a, ahi vangin tamte in nang ang hu zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kiko ciengin na milim kholte kihunsah in! Ahui in amate mutmangin husan khat in tuate semmang ding hi. Hinanle kei ei bel tapo in leitang nei ding a, ka muol siengtho zong a luo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Zih un, zih un, lampi bawl un; ka mite’ lampi a khahtan thei ding na zosie hemdawh un,” kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen a sang le a kitawisang, tawntung muna a teng pa, ama’ min Siengtho a kici pa in tam bangin ci hi: Mun sang le mun siengtho-ah ka teng a, a kiniemkhieh mite’ lungsim le a kisiakia mite’ lungsim a thakhausah dingin kisiakiana lungsim le kiniemkhiehna lungsim neite tawh keima ka omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen amate ka mawsiet zing sih ding a, zong ka lungthah zing sih ding hi; azieh pen ka mai-ah mihing lungsim gim ding a, keima siemsa hinna nangawn a gim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A gitlo huoihamna ziehin ka lung a thah hi; amate vuo-in ka kiphuol a, ka thang a pai hi; hinanle a lunglam ciet vuah a kihei lai veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A lampite uh ka mu zo a, hinanle ka damsah ding hi; Keima in amate pui-in henepna tawh ka thuhkia ding a, a kapte adingin a kam gimman uh ka siempieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nopsahna, nopsahna, a gamla le a nai mite tungah om taheh; keima in amate ka damsah ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanle migilote pen a khawl thei lo tuipi tawh kibang a, a tuite in buon le buathahte a lamto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka Pasien in migilote adingin lungnopna om lo hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Awng in, na aw nei za sit sin! Pengkul gin bangin na aw gingsah in! Ka mite kungah amau’ ledona le Jacob innkuon kungah amau’ mawna phuongzah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate pen a diha a gamta, a Pasien uh’ thupieh a nuasie lo, minam bang danin nisimin keima ei sui vua, ka lampite a thei nuom bang danin a om uhi; amate in ka kung panin a dih thukhenna ang ngen vua, amate in Pasien kung ang nai nuom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Bang dingin nang mu lopi-in kote in an tang uh ka hei? Bang dingin nang phawkhah lopi-in kote kiniemkhieh uh ka hei?” En un, na antan ni-un noma’ deina na sui vua, na nasemte zosie na gawt uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />En un, a kisel ding, a kihau ding, gitlona khuttum tawh a kitum ding bepin note in an na tang uhi. Tuni-a na bawl uh tua bang antanna in a sangna lamah na aw uh a kizah thei nadingin ang bawlpieh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima’ dei antanna in mi khat ama le ama ni khat sung bang beh kiniemkhieh ding amah? Pumpeng bangin a lu tuolkun suhin, la-ip puon le vut lahah lum ding amah? Note in tam pen antanna le Topa dinga san thei ni khat hi, na ci thei ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima’ dei antanna in: a thutang lo kikhinate phel nading, hahkol khaute sut nading, a kibawlsie mite hla nading, hahkol khaute suhtan nading hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua khu a gilkielte na an uh hawm a, na inn vuah mizawng inn nei lote peipi-in, a guohtanga omte na mu ciengun amate puonse-in, na mite kung pana na kiphuol lona uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin phalvah bangin na khuovah uh ang suoh ding a, na damsahna uzong tuisam bangin mallangtahin ang phul ding hi; nangma mai-ah dih ang tangsah pa pei ding a, Topa’ minthanna pen note’ nuadal hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin na hlan ding vua, Topa in ang dawng ding hi; panpina dei-in na kiko ding vua, Topa in, “Tanah ka om hi,” ang ci ding hi. Note lah panin hahkol, khutme tawh mi kawhte, thusie gente sumangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />gilkielte an pie-in, mi gentheite na taisah uleh, khuomiel lahah na khuovah uh ang suoh ding a, na khuomiel uzong sunlai ang bang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in note ang lampui zing ding a, ama in mun gawta-ah hing taisahin, na gu na tang uh a khausah ding hi; tui kibuoh zing um na bang ding vua, a tuite a kang ngai lo tuisam pulna na bang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tanglai-a kisie na khuopite uh kilamkia ding hi; note in khang tampi sunga kisie bulkipte na dingsah kia ding uhi; note na hi uleh a cimsa kul a phawkiate, ten nading lampi a puophate ang kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sabbath thuse lona pan le keima’ ni siengtho ni-a note’ deilam na sepnate panun na kikoicing zo vua, sabbath ni dei huoi sa-in, Topa’ ni siengtho pen note in patawi huoi na ci vua, noma’ lampi ciet zui loin, noma’ phattuom nading beh sem loin, noma’ vai beh na sep sih vua, na patawi uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua ciengin Topa sungah na kipah ding vua, leitung munsangte-ah hing tuongsahin, na pu uh Jacob’ gouluo tawh note kang va ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ kam in a genzo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En un, a hundam zo lo dingin Topa’ khut tom seng lo a, khuo a za thei lo dingin a bil zong bing lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanle na khielna uh pen noma le na Pasien uh kikalah kikhenna suoh a, ama in a zah lo nadingin na mawnate un ama’ maitang a lie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen sisan in na khut uh buasah a, na khutmete uzong khielna tawh bua hi; na kam un zuou thu gen a, na leii un gitlona thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thutang tawh koima in mi heh ngai lo a, citah tahin koima thukhen zumah pei lo hi; amate, bangma lo thusunnate tungah kinga-in zuouthu a gen vua, amate in nau bangin hahsatna paai-in mawna a suoh khie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in gul guneite opin a keusah vua, mom khau puonin a gan uhi; a tui a nekha poma si a, a kitawkeh a tui panin muoltan no khat a keu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A momkhaute uh puonin kizang thei lo hi; silbawlte utawh a kikhu thei sih uhi. A nasep uh pen gitlo nasep hi a, a khut sung vuah tatsietna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sietna lamah a keng uh tai a, mawpeng mite sisan suo ding kinaw mama uhi; a ngaisutnate uh gitlo ngaisutna hi a, a lamlienpite vuah sietna le manthaina om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungmuonna lampi a thei sih vua, a lampite vuah thutang om lo hi. Amate in a lampite uh a kawi-in a bawl uhi; tua sunga peite koima in lungmuonna mu lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ziehin eite tawh thutang kigamla a, thudih in eite ei ban lo hi; eite in khuovah i ngah vua, ngai un! khuomiel a om hi; eite in a vah i ngah vua, hizongle miel lam i zawt uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mittaw bangin kawm i zawt a, mit nei lote bangin i kimaitawm uhi; khuomut pat lam pei bangin suntang lai-in i kipai vua, mi hatte lahah misi i bang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I unpi-un vompi bangin i hawh uhi; vahuite bangin i maumau uhi. Thutang i lamen vua, khat beh a om sih hi; hutdamna i lamen vua, eite tawh a kigamla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen na masangah ka tatkhielna uh tam a, ka mawnate un ka lang khat vuah teci a pang hi. I tatkhielna uh eite tawh om a, eite in i mawnate i thei tahtah uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eite tatkhielin Topa i nuol a, Pasien i zuina uh pan i kiheimang ta uhi. Bawlsietna le ledona thu i gen vua, zuouthu vive ngaisunin i lungsim panun i gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thutang kinuale a, thudih zong khu gamlapi-ah a ding ta hi; mipi kikhopna munah thutah a op lo ziehin thuman zong a tum thei ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuman a kitasam a, sietna a pel mi poma kisuom gam hi. Topa in tam thu mu a, thutang a op lo ziehin ama a lungkim sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in koima a op lo lam mu a, tuale a tang vua a ngetpieh ding koima a mu lo ciengin ama in lamdang a sa hi; tuaci’n ama’ khut in ama guolzawna ngasah a, ama’ dihna in ama a tukip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in dihna khu awmdal bangin sil a, a lu tungah hutdamna sia lukhu khu hi. Ama in phulahna puonte songkholin sil a, puontuol sunga kituom bangin, lunghanna sungah ama kituom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A sepna utawh kituohin ama in thuhkia ding a, ama a langpang mite tungah a lungthahna tungsah ding hi; a galte tungah lethuh ding a, tuipi panga omte zong thuhkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n nitumna lama mite in Topa’ min a zatah ding vua, nisuona lama mite in zong ama’ vanglietna a zatah ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ hui in a semmang tuikhang bangin ama ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale a khielna panun ang kilekia Jacob-te kungah Tanpa dingin Zion ah ang pei ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima adingin tam pen amate tawh ka thuciemna ahi hi, Topa in ci hi: Note’ tunga a om ka hlagau le na kam sung vua ka guonsa ka kammalte, na kam utawh kikhen lo ding a, ahi sihle na tate’ kam, a suonlehlahte’ kam tawh tu le kumtawnin kikhen lo ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tho inlen tang in; azieh pen na khuovah ang tung ta a, nangma tungah Topa’ vang ang suoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen khuomiel in leitung tuom ding a, khuomu tawkhalpi in mite tuom ding hi; hizongle nang tungah Topa ang suoh ding a, nang tungah ama’ vang ang kilang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na khuovah sungah minamte ang pei ding a, na phalvah tang sungah kumpite ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuodah inlen, na kimvel en in; a unpi-un kikhawmin na kungah ang pei uhi; a gamlapi panin na tapate uh ang pei ding a, naucingte in na tanute a kang vuah pomin puo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin nang in mu-in na mai a taang ding hi; na lungtang kisai-in na lung a dam ding hi. Azieh pen tuipi’ kicinna teng na kungah ang kipuoh ding a, minamte’ hauna teng zong na kungah ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midian-te le Ephah-te’ Kalaoh-note, kalaoh honpite in nang tuom ding uhi; Sheba gam sunga om zosie ang pei ding uhi. Amate in kham le panamtui ang puo ding vua, Topa phatna a tangko ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kungah Kedar ganhon zosie ang kikhawm ding a, Nebaioth-a tuutang teng in nangma’ na sem ding uhi; ka maitam tungah biehna-in tua teng kisang ding a, keima in a minthang ka biehinn ka minthangsah semsem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Meiilum banga a leng kawikawite koi hi a, vakhu banga a tawlet vua a lengkhiete koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa na Pasien uh’ min le Israel’ Siengtho Pa ziehin na tapate, a ngun a khamte utawh gamlapi panin a puoh dingin, tuikul gam mite in kei ei ngah ding a, Tarshish tembawte a masa ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile ama in nang ang minthangsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamdang mite in na kulte cieng ding a, a kumpite un nangma’ na sem ding uhi; azieh pen ka lungthah zieha nang kang sat mawh vangin, kang angvanna ziehin na tungah khuotuona kang nei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minamte in a hauna uh ang puoh thei nadingin, a kumpite uh makai-in a guolguola ang lut nadingun na kotpite honsa-in om den ding a, sun le zanin tuate kikha lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen na na a sem lo minam le kumpi gamte mangthai ding a, tua minamte kisie maimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mun siengtho zep nadingin Lebanon thupina ahi taasan sing, hiengpa sing, taasingte, na kungah ang tung ding a, keima in ka keng ngahna mun ka minthangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na mai-ah nang ang bawlsie mite’ suonlehlahte a kun kawmun hing pei-in, nangma ang simmawte zosie nangma’ kephang ang bawh ding uhi. Amate in nang pen Topa’ khuopi, Israel-te’ Siengtho Pa’ Zion, ang ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang ang kinuasie, ang kimuda, koima nawh lo-a ang kikoisa na hi a, keima in a thupi zing dingin kang bawl ding a, a khang khanga kipahna dingin kang bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang in minamte’ nawi na tawp ding a, kumpite nawi zong na tawp ding hi; Keima Topa , na Hundampa le na Tanpa, Jacob’ Vanglien Pa ka hi lam note in nei thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sumngo tangin kham kang puoh ding a, sia tangin ngun kang peipi ding hi; sing tangin sumngo, suong tangin sia kang puoh ding hi. Na mangliente Kilemna ka hisah ding a, na nasem uhte Dihna ka hisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na gam sungah tatsietna kiza nawn lo ding a, na gamgi sungah sietna le suhsietna om nawn lo ding hi; nangma in na kulpite Hutdamna, na kotpite Phatna, na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sun hunin ni pen na khuovah hi nawn lo ding a, zan hunin hlapi vang in ang tan nawn sih ding hi; ahi vangin Topa khu kumtawn na khuovah ahi a, tuale na Pasien zong khu na minthanna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ni tum nawn loin, na hlapi a mang nawn sih ding hi; azieh pen Topa khu kumtawn na khuovah hi ding a, na dana kaana nite a tawp ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na mite a unpi-un midih hi ding a, amate in kumtawnin tua gam luo ding uhi. Amate pen ka minthan nadinga ka suon, a zung meng ka khutsuoh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi tawmpen khat zong be khat ang hi ding a, a neupen khat zong minam thahat khat ang hi ding uhi; Keima Topa ka hi hi; a hun a tun ciengin mallang tahin tam thu ka tangtun ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa Pasien’ hlagau keima tungah a om hi, azieh pen Topa in kei sathau ei nu zo ta hi; ama in a kibawlsie mite kungah lungdamna thu puoh ding, lungsim tamkhamte a khuipieh ding, saltang mite kungah suotahna thu a tangko ding le thongkie mite a hlakhie ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ angvan kum le i Pasien’ phulah ni a tangko ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a date adingin Zion ah, vut tangin paakuol, dana tangin nopna sathau, lungkiehna tangin phatna puon a pie dingin keima ei sawl zo hi. Amate pen dihna gangpi sing kici ding a, ama’ thupina a kilah nadingin Topa’ suon singkung kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in tanglai-a a siesate lamphakia ding a, nidang lai-a a maimangsate dingsahkia ding uhi; amate in a kisiesa khuopite, khang tampi sung a maimangsate a puophakia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuol mite hing dingin na ganhonte uh an a vah ding vua, gamdang mite in na lo uh hlo-in na lengguite uh paw ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahi vangin note pen Topa’ siempute ang kici ding hi; mite in note pen i Pasien’ nasemte ang ci ding uhi; minamte’ hauna teng kivana-in na nei ding vua, note in amau’ hauna teng na kisahtheipi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen amau’ maizumna a za ni ahi a, amau’ tanh dingin maidaina kitangko hi, tua ahi ziehin amate in tanh a zani a luo ding uhi; tawntung lungdamna khu amau-a’ ahi ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen keima Topa in thutang dei-in, misuomna le khielna ka muda hi; a thaman uh thuman tahin ka pie ding a, amate tawh kumtawn thuciemna ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minamte lahah a suon a hlahte uh kithei ding a, mite lahah a cihlahte uh zong kithei ding hi; amate a mu zosie-in Topa’ thupha piehsa minam ahi lam thei-in a pom ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa sungah nahpi-in ka lungdam ding a, ka Pasien sungah ka hinna zosie tawh ka kipah ding hi; azieh pen zinei pa paakuol tawh a kizep bang le a suong manphate tawh motha nu a kisiem bangin, ama in hutdamna puonte keima ei silsah zo a, ama in dihna puontuolpi tawh keima ei tuom zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen leitung in a dawn mengsahin, um in zong a sunga kitute a posah ma bangin, Topa Pasien in minam zosie mai-ah dihna le phatna a posah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama’ dihtanna thu phalvah bangin tangin, ama’ hutdamna thu meivah kuong a bah masangsie, Zion ka khuolna-in ka dai om sih ding a, Jerusalem ka khuolna-in ka mawh op sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minamte in na dihtanna a mu ding vua, kumpi zosie in zong na vanglietna a mu ding uhi; Topa in ama’ kam tawh ang phuo ding min tha tawh nang ang kihlan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang pen Topa’ khut sungah a melhoi lukhu na hi ding a, na Pasien’ khut sungah kumpi lukhu na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang pen a Kinuasiesa, ang kici nawn sih ding a, na gam zong Gamkhing, ang kici nawn sih ding hi; nang pen Ama Tunga Ka Lungkimna, ang kici ding a, na gam zong a Kitenpi, ang kici ding hi; azieh pen nang tungah Topa lungkim a, na leitang zong mite in a kitenpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen tangval khat in ngahnu khat a kitenpi bangin note ang lampa in zi-in ang nei ding a, monu tungah mopa a lungdam ma bangin nangma tungah zong na Pasien a lungdam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, na kulpite tungah galvilte ka koi zo ta hi; sun le zanin amate a sip ngai sih ding uhi. Topa a phawhsahkia note zong mawh khawl sih unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama in Jerusalem sukipin leitung muncin tengah a minthan nadinga a bawl masangin, ama mawh khawlsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zietlam khut le a banhat tawh Topa kiciem zo hi: Na galte’ an dingin na ante ka piekia nawn sih ding a, hanciem a na bawl lenggazu zong gamdang mite in a dawn sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ahi vangin an kholte in ne-in Topa a phat ding vua, a kaikhawm mite in zong a siengtho ka huong sungah a dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pusuoh un, kotpite panin pusuoh un. mite adingin lampi siel un; zih un, lamlienpi zih un, suongte paidawh unlen, mite tungah lim khat khaito un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leimong dongah Topa tangko zo hi: Zion’ tanu kungah, “En in, na hutdamna ang tung ta hi; ama in a thaman ang keng a, a mai-ah leiba sanna ding om hi,” ci un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate pen, “A Siengtho Mite, Topa’ tatsa mite kici ding a, nang pen, “A Kimusa, A Kinuasie lo Khuopi, ang kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Edom gam Bozrah panin puon sandup silin ang pei, tua banga puon tawh thupitah a kivon, a thahatna tawh ang kal suon mipa koi ahei?” “A hundam dinga a thahat, dih tansahna a genkhie keima ka hi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bang ziehin na puontuolte sanin na puonsilte lengga cilte-a’ tawh kibang ahei?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Keima tangin lengga ka cil a, mite lah panin koima in kei ei ompi lo hi; lungthahsa-in ka cilgawp a, a thangpaisa-in ka tuoncil hi; ka puonsil tungah a tuite kithezah a, ka puon teng tungah a baang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen ka lungsim sungah phulah ding ni om a, ka tatkhiet nasep ding kum ang tung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka khuoda vangin ei panpi ding mi om lo hi; ka etcien vangin tha ei pie ding koima om lo hi; tuaci’n keima’ banhat tawh ka guolzo a, ka thangpaina in keima ei kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lungthah ziehin mite tuoncilin, ka thangpai ziehin amate ka siaguoi a, keima in amau’ hinna sisan lei lahah ka sungsuh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama’ ei hepina dung zui le a kicing ei itna kip dung zui-in, Topa in eite dinga ei seppieh sil bangkim le Israel innkuon tunga a angvanna lienpite ziehin, Topa in a lungsietna zieha a silbawlte le a patah huoi Topa ’ nasepte ka sutsut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in, “Amate pen ka mi tahtah ahi vua, zuouthu tawh na sem lo ding tapate ahi uhi,” a ci hi; ama pen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a gentheina zosie vuah a hundampa uh a suoh hi. Kamtaipa ahi sihle vantung mi’ hutdam ahi sih hi; ama’ ompina in amate a hunkhie hi; ama in a itna le a khuotuona tawh amate tankhie a, tanglai hunte zosie-ah amate lamto-in a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongle amate in a ledo vua, a hlagau siengtho a dasah uhi; tua ahi ziehin ama pen a gal uh a suoh hi; ama ma in amate a do hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in tanglai hun, ama’ nasem Moses’ hun a phawh uhi. Tuuhonte le tuucingpa tawh tuipi sung pan a peipi pa hei sungah a om ta e? Amate sungah ama’ hlagau siengtho a koi pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moses’ zietlam khut tawh ama’ banhat a kizawtsah pa, a min a kithei zing nadingin amate mai-ah tuite khenzahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuipi thuh tung tawn a, a peipi pa koi ahiei? Senel lahah sakol pei bangin amate a pua sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kuom sung a zuonsuh ganhingte bangin Topa’ hlagau in amate toidamna a pie hi. Tua bangin nangma’ minthanna dingin nangma in na mite na makai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vantung panin ei ensuh inlen, a siengtho le a thupi na tenna panin ei mu in. Na deiluotna le na hatna hei sungah om a, nei lunggulna le nei lainatna hei sunga om ahei? Keima kung panin tuate a kiladawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen nang ka pa uh na hi a, Abraham in kote ei thei loin, Israel in ei phawh sih nanle; Topa , aw, nang kohaw’ pa na hi hi; na min pen tangtawng pana kohaw’ Tanpa ahi ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa aw, kote in nangma kang giin lo nadingun, bang dingin na lampite panin kote ei pielsah a, kohaw’ lungtang na khausah ahei? Na nasemte, na gouluo minamte nei khuolna-in ang kilekia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A siengtho na mite in bakhat sung na mun siengtho a luo uhi; ahi vangin tu-in ka kidopite in na mun siengtho a tuoncil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kote pen nangma in nei uh khah lo mite, na min tawh a kihlan kha lo mite ka bang ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Van phukehin hing kumsuh lacin, na mai-ah muolsangte kiling ding uhi-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mei in selgaw kuongsah a, tui a sosah bangin, na langte tungah na min kitheisah in. Tuaci’n nangma mai-ah minamte a citun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kote in ka lamet khah lo uh a cizat huoi nate na bawl lai-in nangma nang kumsuh a, nangma mai-ah muolte kiling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tang lai panin ama a lamente adingin na a seppieh pasien dang koima in za ngai loin, koima in thei ngai lo a, koima’ mit in mu ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma in lungdamtahin thuman na a semte, na lampi zui-in ang phawh mite, na kimupi hi. Ahi vangin kote tungah na lungthah a, hinanle kote ka maw ta uhi; kote in na thu ka palsat ziehun nangma in na mai na phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka unpi-un a sieng lo mipa tawh ka kibang ta vua, thuman taha ka sepsa zosie uzong puon nieh tawh kibang lel hi. Singna bangin ka vul sieng vua, ka khielnate un hui sem bangin ei semmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na min tawh ang hlan mi koima a om sih a, ang pom dinga a hanciem zong koima a om sih hi; azieh pen ka kung panun na mai na phuol a, ka khielna uh sungah kote nei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle nang pen Topa aw, kohaw’ Pa na hi hi; kote pen tungman ka hi vua, nang ka beelkheng pa uh na hi hi; kote pen ka unpi-un na khut tawh nei bawlsa ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa aw, lungthah seng sinlen, a tawntungin zong khielna ciemte zing sin. Kote zosie nangma mi ka hina uh tu-in ei ngaisun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma’ khuopi siengthote senel gam suoh sieng a, Zion zong senel gam suohin, Jerusalem gamkhing a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate un nangma ang phatna uh mun, a siengtho le a etlawm biehinn khu mei in a katum zo ta a, ka mun nuom zosie uh zong a kisusie sieng zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa aw, tam thu-ah na ki-ip thei ding amah? Nangma sip dide-in omin nahpitahin kote dan ei thuohsah ding na mah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei ei kan lote sui dingin a baisa-in ka om a, kei ei sui lote mu dingin a baisa-in ka om hi. Ka min tawh ei hlan kha lo minam khat kungah, “Kei tanah om ing, kei tanah om ing,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amau’ dei bang zui-a lampi hoi lo a zuite le a ledo mite tungah sun tungtawnin ka khut ka zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka maitangah a tawntunga kei ei phin zing mite, um sungah kithoina bawlin, tehlei tungah panamtui a hal hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />hankhuh sungah to-in munsip tenga a gieh mite; vohsa ne a, a beel sungah a kidahhuoi sa metui a koite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nang adingin siengtho luo ka hi ziehin, nangma tangin om in, ka kung ei nai sin,” a ci mite ahi uhi. Tua bang mite pen ka nahkuo vanga meikhu le sun tawntunga a kuong den mei tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />En in, ka mai-ah gielsa-in om hi: Ka dai op sih ding a, ka thuhkia ding hi; a kicing tahin ka thuhkia valon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kang sung vuah amau’ khielnate le amau’ pu le pate khielnate ka thuhton tahtah ding hi, Topa in ci hi; azieh pen amate in muol tungah panamtui a hal vua, muol tang teng tungah zong keima ei gensie uhi. Amau’ gamtatna ziehin amau’ sepsa thaman a cingin a kang sung vuah te-in ka thuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: A bawh pan lenggazu kinga a, amate in, “Tuate sungah thupha om ahi ziehin susie vawt sih un,’ a ci ma bangun, ke’n zong ka nasemte khuolna-in tam bangin ka bawl ding a, a unpi-un ka susie sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in Jacob panin suonlehlahte ka piengsah ding a, Judah panin ka muol a luo dingte ka piengsah ding hi; ka teeltuomte in tuate a luo ding vua, tua munah ka nasemte a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima ei sui ka mite dingin Sharon pen tuuhonte gamtatna mun suoh ding a, Akhor Kuom zong bawnghonte kuolna mun a suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle Topa a taisan mite, ka muol siengtho a mangngil mite, Kam-etna-in sabuoi pha a, Sekholna adinga zu a kihalsa hai sunga a sung note pen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />namsau tawh a si dingin kang sekhol ding a, ang that dingte mai-ah na unpi-un na kun sieng ding uhi; azieh pen kang hlat lai-in nei dawng nuom sih vua, kang hopi lai-in na ngai nuom sih uhi. Ka muna-ah note in a sie bawlin ka dei lo nate na teel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in tam bangin ci hi: Ka nasemte in a ne ding vua, hizongle note na gilkiel ding uhi; ka nasemte in a dawn ding vua, hizongle note na dangta ding uhi; ka nasemte a kipah ding vua, hizongle note na maizum ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka nasemte in lungdamin la sa ding a, hinanle lungtang na-in na kap ding vua, na lungsim uh a gim ziehin na tau vangut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Awsie lawna-a zah dingin ka teeltuom mite tungah na min uh na nuasie ding vua, Topa Pasien in note ang that ding hi; hinanle ama in a nasemte tungah min dang khat a phuopieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin leitunga thupha a pie poma in a thuman Pasien suongin thupha pie ding a, gam sunga kiciemna nei poma in a thuman Pasien suongin kiciem ding hi; Azieh pen nidang lai-a buoinate kimangngil zo ta a, keima muna-ah kiphuolmang zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in vantha le leitha ka siem ta ding hi; nidang lai thute kiciemte nawn loin, zong kiphawhkha nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanle ka siemsate sungah lungdam kipahin om zing un; azieh pen keima in kipah nadingin Jerusalem ka siem ding a, lungnop nadingin ama’ mite ka siem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem sungah ka kipah ding a, ka mite sungah ka lungdam ding hi; tua sungah kaana awging le lunggimna awging kiza nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua sungah nausen a ngehsi a om nawn sih ding a, a vuoisi lo ding upa zong a om sih ding hi; azieh pen kum zakhat a a si mite a khansi-in kingaisun ding a, kum za cing lo-a a si mite samsiet thuohin kingaisun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in inn a lam ding vua, a sungah a teng ding uhi; amate in lengga um a bawl ding vua, a ga a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Midangte ten nadingin inn a lampieh sih ding uhi; midangte neh dingin lengga um a bawl sih ding uhi; azieh pen singkung khat’ hintan ma ka mite a hing ding vua, ka teeltuom mite in a khut utawh a sepsate nuomtahin sawtpi a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A mawhna-in na sem loin, lungkhamna dingin zong tate a nei sih ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ thupha pieh tate ahi ding vua, amau’ suonlehlahte zong tua bang ma ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in ei hlat masangun keima in ka dawng ding a, amate in thu a gen laitahun ka bilin ka za ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ngie le tuuno in an neton ding a, bawngtang bangin humpi in bukung a ne ding hi; ahi vangin leivui pen gulpi’ an hi ding hi! Ka muol siengthote tungah amate kiliemsah lo ding a, zong kisusie lo ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Vantung ka topha ahi a, leitung ka keng ngahna ahi hi; kei adingin bang inn ei lampiehin, ka tenna ding bang mun pen ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam nate zosie ka khuta ka bawlsa ahi a, tam nate zosie keima-a’ ahi hi, Topa in ci hi. Ahi vangin ka et ding mi pen a kiniemkhieh le a lungsim kisia, ka thu a zah cienga zau-a a citun mipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawngtang a go poma mihing a that tawh kibang hi; tuuno-a biehpiehna a bawl poma pen ui’ ngawng tan mipa tawh kibang hi; an tawh biehna a pie poma pen voh’ si a pie mipa tawh kibang hi; panamtui tawh phawna biehna pie poma pen milim thupha a pie pa tawh a kibang hi. Tam mite in a lampi ciet uh a teel vua, amau’ kidahhuoi a gamtatnate ah nuom a sa uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />keima in amate a simmaw bawl ding mi ka teelpieh ding a, amate tungah zauna ka tungsah ding hi; azieh pen ka hlat ciengin koima in ei dawng loin, ka hopi ciengin zong a ngai sih uhi; ahi vangin ka muna-ah amate a gitlo gamtat vua, ka deilo nate a teel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama’ thugen za-a a citunte aw, Topa thugen za un: Keima’ min zieha ang muda le ang pampaih na unaute in, “Na lungdamna uh ka mu thei nadingin Topa kiminthangsah heh,” a ci uhi. Hinanle a kimaizumsah ding pen amate ahi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai un, khuopi pana husapi khat khu! Biehinnpi pana awging khat khu! Topa’ awging hi a, a galte a dan piehna a awging ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nausuo nat masang in ama nu a suoh zo ta hi; a nausuo natna in a phah masangin ama nu in tapa khat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua bang thute koi in na za ngai uh ahei? Tua bang thute koi in na mu ngai uh ahei? Ni khat sungin gam khat a pieng thei amah? Bakhat sungin minam khat a pieng thei amah? Hizongle Zion in nausuo natna a thuoh behin tate a suoh pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Naubu hong vanuhin suohsah lo ding ka mah? Topa in ci hi; nau a suohsah keima in naubu ka khah ding amah? na Pasien un ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />No Jerusalem a it zosiete aw, ama tawh lungdam unlen, ama ziehin kipah un; ama zieha a kap note aw, ama tawh lungdamton un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua hile ama’ henepna nawi tawpin na gilva ding vua, a etlawm a kang sung panin lungnopna tawh na dawn sieng thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Gunpi bangin nopsahna le luitui let bangin ama tungah minamte’ hauna ka tungsah ding hi; tuale note in a nawi tawpin ama’ kangah ang puo ding a, ama’ khup tungah na dieng vazawh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nu in a tasen a henep bangin keima in note kang henem ding hi; note in Jerusalem khuopi sungah henepna na a nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note in na mu ding vua, na lung uh a dam ding uhi; lopa bangin na pumpite uzong ang nosuoh ding hi. Topa’ khut in a nasemte tawh omton a, ama’ lungthahna in a galte a dona lam a kithei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile sinsona tawh a lungthahna a thuhkia ding le meikuong tawh thu a hil dingin, meikuong lahah Topa ang pei ding a, ama’ leengte pingpei tawh a kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in mi zosie tungah mei le namsau tawh thukhen ding a, Topa in a thasa mite tam mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Um sunga pei dingin kisiensuo-in a kisiengthosah, a laikima om pen a zuite, vohsa le a kidahhuoi nate le zusa a ne mite mangthah ton ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen amau’ nasepnate le a lunggelte uh ka thei a, minam zosie le kamham zosie a khawmtuo dingin keima kang pei ding hi; tuale amate ang pei-in ka thupina a mu ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuale keima in amate lahah lim khat ka koi ding hi. Amate sung panin Tarshish mite kung, Put le thalpi kap a siem Lud-te kung, Tubal le Javan mite kung, le ka minthanna a za ngai lo le ka thupina a mu ngai lo tuipi gei gamlapi-a om mite kungah a suohta lai mite ka sawl ding hi; tuale amate in minamte lahah ka thupina a pulah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel-te in Topa’ inn sungah kuong siengtho tawh an tawh biehna a tawi bangun, amate in Topa tunga biehna dingin minam zosie lah panin na sanggam zosie uh, sakolte, leengte, laangte, laate, le kalaoh-te tungah ang puo-in ka muol siengtho Jerusalem ah ang peipi ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale amate kimkhat zong siempu ding le Levi dingin ka la ding hi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka bawl ding vantha le lei tha pen ka mai-ah a om zing ding hi, Topa in ci hi; tua ma bangin na suonlehlahte ule na min uh a om zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hla tha khat pan hla tha khat, sabbath khat pan sabbath khat, ka mai-ah ei bie dingin mi zosie ang pei ding uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate pusuohin kei ei ledo mite’ siluong a en ding uhi; azieh pen a thante uh si loin a mei uh mit lo ding a, amate pen mi zosie’ kidah ahi ta ding uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
